			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Janet, the kind that makes people listen when she speaks and follow when she leads. She doesn&apos;t need to prove herself - she already knows where she stands. Janet doesn&apos;t crack under pressure - she sharpens. When everything is going wrong, when the chaos is at its peak, she locks in, making perfect calls and impossibly fast reactions. &quot;Panicking won&apos;t save you. Thinking faster than the enemy will.&quot; </personalityDescription>
