			<personalityDescription>Enreecko lives in the now, always moving, always deciding on the fly. Whether it&apos;s a split-second gamble or an uncalculated risk, they thrive in the rush of immediate action - consequences can wait. Enreecko doesn&apos;t waste time on ventures that don&apos;t pay off. Every decision, every mission, every risk is calculated to ensure maximum return, and if something isn&apos;t profitable, they&apos;re already onto the next big score. </personalityDescription>
