			<personalityDescription>Bhutinanda knows exactly what to say to get people on his side, but his words rarely match his true intentions. He smiles, flatters, and makes promises, but beneath it all, he&apos;s only looking out for himself. Bhutinanda knows things are spiraling. The war, the company, everything. But if he can explain things, if he can make sense of small details, then maybe he can convince himself that some part of this universe still makes sense. </personalityDescription>
