			<personalityDescription>Makbule doesn&apos;t need recognition - she just wants her people to succeed. Whether in battle, in planning, or in moments of doubt, she offers steady, unwavering support that reminds others they&apos;re never truly alone. Makbule treats sleep like an inconvenience. There&apos;s always another report to file, another order to review, another detail to double-check. &quot;I&apos;ll sleep when things slow down,&quot; she says - but things never slow down. Her coworkers have started making bets on when she&apos;ll finally pass out at her desk. </personalityDescription>
