			<personalityDescription>Once Jean makes up their mind, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. Plans don&apos;t change, orders don&apos;t get questioned, and they sure as hell aren&apos;t going to admit being  wrong - not now, not ever. Jean thrives on audacity. They don&apos;t hesitate, don&apos;t second-guess, and certainly don&apos;t blush. Whether they&apos;re making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, they do it all with a smirk and a shrug. </personalityDescription>
