			<personalityDescription>The world can throw everything it has at Michael, and he&apos;ll still keep going. His strength isn&apos;t in speed or skill alone, but in sheer refusal to accept defeat, no matter how far the odds are stacked against him. Trusting Michael is like betting against the house - the game is already rigged. He knows how to talk, how to persuade, and how to convince people that they&apos;re making the right choice, even when it&apos;s all just another carefully designed con. </personalityDescription>
