			<personalityDescription>Hanskarl doesn&apos;t fight out of hatred or ambition - he fights because there&apos;s no  other choice. Every battle is a necessary evil, and every trigger pull is a failure of diplomacy. If he could find another way, he would take it in a heartbeat. Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Hanskarl. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining his gear, or following through on commitments, he tends to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Only fights when cornered. Views violence as failure, not achievement.&lt;br&gt;- Needs a babysitter, not a command.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
