			<personalityDescription>Yvonne isn&apos;t content with following orders or playing it safe. She set her sights high, pursues her goals relentlessly, and never accepts limits - because to her, the only real obstacle is a lack of ambition. Yvonne doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only results. She&apos;ll lie, cheat, steal, and betray without a second thought if it serves her interests. If someone expected honor or fairness from her, they were already doomed to fail. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Follows no one for long. Sets high goals and burns through barriers to reach them.&lt;br&gt;- No loyalty, no hesitation - if it helps, they&apos;ll do it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
