			<personalityDescription>Ben naturally takes control of every situation, expecting others to follow his lead without question. Whether on the battlefield or in command, he believes that authority is best wielded with absolute confidence - and little room for dissent. Ben&apos;s notebook isn&apos;t just logs - it&apos;s a record of decline. Ration cuts, missing payments, the names of warriors who never came back. He writes it all because no one else does. Because someday, the company will fall apart completely. And someone should at least remember how it happened. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 36%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Assumes command by default. Expects obedience - no tolerance for dissent.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
