			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Terezinha knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. She pushes herself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in her mind, every struggle brings her closer to her ultimate goal. Terezinha&apos;s favorite mug has been with her longer than most of her comrades. She&apos;s left planets behind, lost equipment, abandoned people - but this remains. Terezinha doesn&apos;t talk about where she got it or why she won&apos;t replace it. She just holds it a little tighter on the nights when the war feels particularly close. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes harder than most. Sees struggle as proof they&apos;re on the right path.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
