			<personalityDescription>Havva refuses to let hardship define them. They&apos;ve weathered every storm life has thrown at them, adapting, enduring, and proving that no amount of pain or pressure can break their will. Havva sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. They take what they need, wring every ounce of value out of those around them, and discard them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to be defined by pain. Endures, adapts, overcomes.&lt;br&gt;- Treats people like tools - breaks them, bins them, moves on.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
