			<personalityDescription>Severina knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, she&apos;ll take the best deal for herself. She&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, she&apos;ll make sure she walks away with the biggest share. Severina doesn&apos;t waste time on people or ideas she deems unimportant. If she thinks someone&apos;s opinion is useless, she brushes them off without a second thought and moves forward on her own terms. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;br&gt;- Brushes off anything that doesn&apos;t serve immediate purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
