			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Aatifa&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just their skill, but their ability to think. They sift through information, discard the irrelevant, and act with precision, ensuring that when they move, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. Aatifa can&apos;t control the war. They can&apos;t control death, orders, or who makes it home. But they can control their understanding of the sky. They check barometers, watch wind speeds, track pressure shifts - because if nothing else, at least they know when the rain is coming. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
