			<personalityDescription>Samina carries herself with an effortless certainty, believing there&apos;s no challenge too great to overcome. Whether leading a charge or staring down an enemy, she radiates a calm assurance that inspires allies and unsettles foes. Samina doesn&apos;t just watch duels - she models her entire combat style after them. Flashy maneuvers, high-risk plays, individualist mentality - she fights like she&apos;s putting on a show, even in real warzones. &quot;I don&apos;t just want to win - I want them to remember me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Calm assurance. Inspires teammates, unnerves enemies. Confidence backed by presence.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
