			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Muamoholeva believes the best defense is an overwhelming offense, always pushing forward and keeping up the pressure. Hesitation is weakness, and she refuses to give her opponents a chance to recover. Muamoholeva&apos;s stories are legendary, but also suspect. One day, it&apos;s a tale of her holding off an entire battalion with nothing but a sidearm. The next, she&apos;s outmaneuvering an artillery barrage on foot. Her squad humors her, but no one&apos;s ever seen any records to back the stories up. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes in pressure. Always attacking. No room for defensive fallback.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
