			<personalityDescription>Anne exudes a fearless certainty that turns heads the moment she enters a room. Every word, every gesture carries an undeniable weight, as if doubt itself has no place in her world. In a ruthless world, Anne refuses to become another heartless warrior. She watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs her. The weight of every choice lingers in her mind, but she&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries weight just by entering a room. Commands presence without trying.&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
