			<personalityDescription>Henrietta never acts on impulse - every move they make is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, they play the long game, ensuring they always comes out ahead. Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Henrietta. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining their gear, or following through on commitments, they tend to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. </personalityDescription>
