			<personalityDescription>Marybeth doesn&apos;t dwell on uncertainty. She processes information quickly, chooses a course of action, and moves forward without hesitation - confident that momentum is the key to victory. Marybeth doesn&apos;t just focus - she fixate. She drills her skills, studies her enemies, and plans every move with relentless intensity. To her, anything less than total commitment is the first step toward failure. </personalityDescription>
