			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Vicente stands firm. He doesn&apos;t just inspire with words - he leads through action, proving time and again that perseverance, heart, and sheer determination can turn the tide of any battle. Vicente isn&apos;t the type to shoot a retreating enemy, nor does he take pleasure in victory. He fights only as much as necessary. &quot;Not every enemy deserves to die. Some of them are just trying to survive - same as us.&quot; </personalityDescription>
