			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>The line between confidence and recklessness is one Bikila never bothers to acknowledge. He acts on impulse, ignores warnings, and barrels forward at full speed, trusting that he&apos;ll figure things out before it&apos;s too late. Bikila doesn&apos;t just want wealth - he hoards it, exploits others for it, and will do anything to get more. Bribes, backstabbing, and extortion are just tools in his arsenal, and if someone gets in the way of his fortune, they won&apos;t be a problem for long. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t care if it&apos;s reckless - just that it&apos;s fast and loud.&lt;br&gt;- Uses people like stepping stones - crushes anyone who slows the climb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
