			<personalityDescription>Don has a sharp eye for the right moment to strike - whether it&apos;s on the battlefield, in business, or in personal dealings. He&apos;s always looking for an angle, ready to seize any advantage that presents itself. Don has watched people fall to their deaths. He&apos;s seen what&apos;s left when they hit the ground. He remembers the silence right before impact. His fear isn&apos;t irrational - it&apos;s experience. &quot;You ever hear the sound someone makes when they realize there&apos;s no way back up? I have.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always scanning for openings. Strikes fast when advantage appears.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
