			<personalityDescription>Rosalinda doesn&apos;t keep score - she gives freely, whether it&apos;s supplies, favors, or hard-earned wisdom. She believes that lifting others up strengthens everyone, and she never hesitates to share what she has. People want to believe Rosalinda. Her words are smooth, her arguments airtight, and her timing impeccable. She plants ideas like seeds, letting them take root until others think they were their own all along. </personalityDescription>
