			<performanceExamScore>57</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Kseniya never second-guesses herself - why would she, when she&apos;s always right? Every word, every step; every decision is made with the certainty of someone who expects the universe to bend to her will. &quot;We&apos;re walking into a trap,&quot; Kseniya mutters as the mission briefing ends. &quot;How do you know?&quot; someone asks. &quot;Because we&apos;re still breathing - means the universe isn&apos;t done screwing with us yet.&quot; No matter the odds, no matter how good things look, Kseniya is always prepared for something to go wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never hesitates. Expects the world to adjust to their decisions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
