			<personalityDescription>Dhritiman doesn&apos;t believe in playing it safe. He thrives on risk, constantly pushing limits and daring fate to keep up - because to him, caution is just another word for hesitation. After seeing too much death and betrayal, Dhritiman has stopped caring. He doesn&apos;t form attachments, doesn&apos;t believe in causes, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on emotions. In his mind, caring only leads to pain. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 73%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushed by risk, not tactics. Caution dismissed as weakness.&lt;br&gt;- Seen too much, feels nothing. Not dead - just numb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
