			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Nicole has no interest in. They keep everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in their world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Nicole fights for one thing: the highest bidder. They&apos;re not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps them alive and well-paid. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps people away - violently if needed. Trust replaced with defense.&lt;br&gt;- Hired gun. No cause, no loyalty - just money.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
