			<personalityDescription>People exhaust her, and trust is a luxury she can&apos;t afford. Coreene keeps her distance, avoids unnecessary interactions, and only engages when absolutely necessary. Solitude isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s survival. Coreene has a story for every situation. &quot;This reminds me of that time on New Aragon - similar terrain, same terrible odds, and guess what? We made it through that one too.&quot; Her squad isn&apos;t sure whether she&apos;s boosting morale or just reliving her favorite moments. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps to themselves. Probably knows more than they say.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
