			<personalityDescription>Ulyana doesn&apos;t just hold her ground - she digs in so deep that nothing short of  disaster can move her. Changing her mind is as likely as shifting a mountain by sheer force of will. Ulyana insists that good grip is everything. Whether she&apos;s scoffing down an expired MRE, cleaning her sidearm, or attending a mandatory training meeting, her gloves are always on. She thinks they improve performance, reduce wear on her hands, and help keep sweat from ruining her trigger control. Her squad thinks she&apos;s being excessive - until their own hands are blistered and bruised while her are perfectly fine. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Digs in deep. Unmoving, unchanging, unyielding.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
