			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as overconfidence in Patricia&apos;s mind. Whether she&apos;s got the skills to back it up or not is irrelevant - she steps into every situation like she&apos;s already won and lets reality catch up later. Embarrassment is for other people. Patricia takes what she wants, says what she pleases, and never worries about how she&apos;s perceived. If someone doesn&apos;t like it, that&apos;s their problem, not her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Confidence exceeds ability. May succeed through force of will - or get others killed.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t care how it looks - as long as it works.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
