			<personalityDescription>Sebastian has never met a fight he didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, he runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Sebastian knows the situation is serious, but that doesn&apos;t mean he can&apos;t have a little fun. Whether it&apos;s teasing an ally or shamelessly charming the enemy, he keeps things light. &quot;Is your targeting is getting better, or are you just trying to show me a good time?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
