			<personalityDescription>Oliver approaches everything with methodical precision. He doesn&apos;t believe in shortcuts or luck - only in putting in the work, refining his craft, and ensuring that he never leaves anything to chance. Nothing satisfies Oliver for long. He hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand his fortune - no matter the cost to those around him. </personalityDescription>
