			<personalityDescription>Thoanna doesn&apos;t just take charge - she smothers every situation with her presence. Whether giving orders or offering &quot;advice,&quot; she makes sure her voice is the loudest and her will is the only one that matters. Thoanna doesn&apos;t panic, but she&apos;s noticeably uneasy in large, open spaces. She sticks to shadows, corners, anywhere that makes the world feel smaller. &quot;I&apos;d rather not stand in the middle of this room. You never know who&apos;s watching.&quot; </personalityDescription>
