			<personalityDescription>Gavin&apos;s mind is a finely tuned weapon, cutting through distractions and deceptions with precision. He knows exactly when to push, when to hold back, and when to strike for maximum effect. Gavin doesn&apos;t just fight - he analyzes. The moment a battle ends, he&apos;s already dissecting what worked and what didn&apos;t. Positioning, timing, individual performance - nothing escapes review. &quot;We got through it,&quot; someone says. &quot;Yeah,&quot; Gavin mutters, taking notes, &quot;but how much better could it have gone?&quot; </personalityDescription>
