			<personalityDescription>Klara moves through life with absolute certainty, her presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When she speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Klara simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even her own well-being are secondary to whatever she deems important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of her inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commands attention by presence alone. No showmanship - just certainty.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t track gear, doesn&apos;t track people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
