			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Aaron keeps moving. He refuses to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. Patience has never been Aaron&apos;s strong suit. He leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, his restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - he lives for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t accept failure. Grinds forward no matter the toll.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
