			<personalityDescription>For Charlotte, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible she is. She dismisses advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that her skills and luck will always carry her through, no matter the risk. Charlotte refuses to leave anything exposed. She&apos;ll cover, blend, and disguise anything that could be spotted from a distance. If something stands out, she fixes it immediately. &quot;Survival starts with us not being noticed at all.&quot; </personalityDescription>
