			<personalityDescription>Titas doesn&apos;t believe in stopping - ever. No setback, no injury, no force in the universe can keep her from pushing forward until she&apos;s achieved what she set out to do. Titas never does anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s firepower, preparation, or just sheer intensity, she goes all-in, often pushing beyond what&apos;s necessary - or even reasonable. </personalityDescription>
