			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Katina would rather go down in flames than play it safe. She lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy she can get - and somehow, she usually pulls it off. Katina weighs every decision carefully, considering all angles before taking action. She values logic over impulse, ensuring that every move she makes is well-thought-out and serves a greater purpose. </personalityDescription>
