			<personalityDescription>Budharatna refuses to quit, no matter the odds. Whether facing superior firepower or an impossible mission, he grits his teeth and pushes forward - because failure is simply not an option. Budharatna makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through his unshakable resolve, his fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where he reminds someone of their worth, he sparks hope in even the darkest times. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to break. Pushes forward under fire. Failure not in vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Even the cynics listen to them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
