			<personalityDescription>Sylvester has never met a fight he didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, he runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Sylvester doesn&apos;t just hoard rations - he protects them. He&apos;s seen people go without, seen how quickly desperation sets in when food runs out. He never lets himself be that vulnerable again. He doesn&apos;t care if people think it&apos;s paranoia. When the time comes, he&apos;ll be the one still eating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
