			<personalityDescription>Tabitha doesn&apos;t make rash decisions - she plays the long game. Every battle, every move, and every choice is carefully calculated to maximize her advantage and ensure victory with minimal risk. In a ruthless world, Tabitha refuses to become another heartless warrior. She watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs her. The weight of every choice lingers in her mind, but she&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t act - engineers outcomes. Everyone else is playing checkers.&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
