			<performanceExamScore>55</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Seleena&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. She scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts her will so thoroughly that those around her rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Seleena has seen what happens when people rush. The gear that fails, the comms that don&apos;t transmit, the backup plans that weren&apos;t actually ready when needed. She&apos;s watched people die from mistakes they never even knew they made. So she checks, and checks again - because if she doesn&apos;t, no one else will. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
