			<personalityDescription>No matter what gets thrown at him, Akutla bounces back. Whether it&apos;s a brutal loss, a catastrophic failure, or a battlefield injury, he refuses to let anything break him. Akutla has a knack for thinking on his feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, he&apos;s always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes the hit, gets back up. Nothing breaks them for long.&lt;br&gt;- Sharp tongue, sharper brain. Dangerous in any conversation.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
