			<personalityDescription>No matter how hardened the universe tries to make him, Teodus refuses to shut himself off from others. He carries their burdens as if they were his own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. Teodus&apos;s comrades keep dying. His gear? It stays. So he talks to it, maintains it with care, treats it like it&apos;s alive - because at least it won&apos;t bleed out on him. At least it won&apos;t leave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 35%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t harden - chooses to feel. Risky, but admirable.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
