			<personalityDescription>Once Ipuza commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake her resolve once she&apos;s made up her mind. Ipuza&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, she&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Discussion ends at commitment. Mind closed, door locked.&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
