			<personalityDescription>Some people seek compromise - Ossie seeks conflict. She thrives on tension, turning every conversation into a challenge and every challenge into a personal battle. If there&apos;s a peaceful solution, she&apos;s not interested. With a quick joke and a warm smile, Ossie turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. She treats allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. </personalityDescription>
