			<personalityDescription>Nathan isn&apos;t heartless, just detached. He doesn&apos;t feel the need to intervene, fix things, or fight for anything beyond his own survival. If someone expects him to care, they&apos;ll be sorely disappointed. Nathan isn&apos;t just prepared - he&apos;s precise. Every knife, or tool in his kit is honed to perfection. He sharpens his combat blade before every mission, during downtime, and even mid-briefing. His squad jokes that he&apos;d sharpen a laser if he could. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Detached, not cruel - but don&apos;t count on backup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
