			<personalityDescription>To Josh, restraint is a foreign concept. He surrounds himself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy his endless cravings - no matter the cost. A shipment lost, another contract failed, another person missing from the roster. Josh can&apos;t fix those things. But he can decrypt an old DropShip manifest, or solve an old Terran cipher. He focuses on the puzzles he can solve so he doesn&apos;t have to think about the ones he never will. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lives for indulgence - luxury, temptation, distraction. A liability in quiet moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
