			<personalityDescription>Victorya views war as a puzzle, and people as pieces to be moved. Emotions don&apos;t factor into her decisions - only efficiency and effectiveness. If sacrificing a few pawns guarantees her success, she won&apos;t hesitate to make the call. Victorya wears the uniform, the gear, the weight of the war - but none of it ever feels real. She moves like she&apos;s trapped in armor that isn&apos;t her own, unsure if the person she once was is even still underneath it all. &quot;I don&apos;t know if this body was ever mine. I just know it&apos;s the only one I&apos;ve got.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cold-blooded tactician. Will trade lives like poker chips.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
