			<personalityDescription>Vilasini doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - she believes in winning. She bends, breaks, and rewrites the rules to suit her needs, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. Most people aren&apos;t worth Vilasini&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how she sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath her notice, she brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Victory at all costs. Leaves scorched earth behind.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t even look back when leaving someone behind - already onto the next thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
