			<personalityDescription>Zena treats the impossible like an invitation. She never slows down, never looks back, and never lets fear dictate her choices - because, to her, fear is just an excuse she refuses to entertain. Zena doesn&apos;t apologize - because she never sees a reason to. Whether she&apos;s bending the rules, running her mouth, or making an outrageous demand, she does it all with absolute confidence and zero regret. </personalityDescription>
