			<personalityDescription>Death is always a step behind, but Shang-de refuses to run. He faces down overwhelming odds with grim determination, knowing that if he falls, it will be on Shang-de&apos;s  terms, with a smoking battlefield left in his wake. Shang-de&apos;s voice alone can turn the tide of a conversation. He speaks with conviction, adjusts his tone to fit his audience, and always seems to say exactly what people need to hear - whether it&apos;s the truth or not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Faces death on their own terms. Determined to leave a mark, win or lose.&lt;br&gt;- Voice hits like orders, not suggestions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
