			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Antónia doesn&apos;t just plan - they fixate. Every move, every calculation, every angle is analyzed and accounted for. They&apos;ll rework a strategy a hundred times over, because in their mind, a single overlooked detail could mean death. Subtlety has never been Antónia&apos;s strong suit. They speak in hard facts and brutal honesty, never sugarcoating their words or wasting time on delicate phrasing. If someone doesn&apos;t like it, that&apos;s their problem. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rewrites plans until they bleed. Will stall a mission if something&apos;s off.&lt;br&gt;- Subtle as artillery. Doesnt care who flinches.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
