			<personalityDescription>People want to believe Kathryn, and that&apos;s the danger. She sounds sincere, looks reliable, and acts like she has your back - until the moment it benefits her to do otherwise. &quot;Are you sure that&apos;s right? Let me check again. Just in case.&quot; Kathryn verifies numbers three times, hesitates before confirming decisions, and won&apos;t finalize anything unless she&apos;s completely convinced there&apos;s no possible risk. It makes things painfully slow, but she&apos;s never wrong. </personalityDescription>
