			<personalityDescription>Palakikio carries an air of barely restrained aggression, their words sharp and their patience nonexistent. Every conversation feels like a confrontation and that&apos;s how they like it. Palakikio doesn&apos;t trust anyone to provide for them, so they keep everything for themself. Every credit, every round of ammo, every salvageable scrap is hidden away because they know that when things go bad, only those who&apos;ve prepared will survive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 58%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every word a weapon. Conversation feels like combat.&lt;br&gt;- Survivalist mindset. Would rather let others go without than run dry.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
