			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Semi, the kind that makes people listen when they speak and follow when they lead. They don&apos;t need to prove themself - they already know where they stand. &quot;Semi doesn&apos;t like this. Semi thinks this is a bad plan.&quot; Their squad groans. &quot;Semi, you are Semi.&quot; They shrug. &quot;Semi&apos;s aware of that. Semi still thinks you should reconsider before Semi has to explain why Semi was right.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t posture - just leads. Speaks, and others follow without question.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
