			<personalityDescription>Subtlety? Restraint? Zuhal&apos;s never heard of them. If one LRM is good, twenty are better. If a fight can be won cleanly, she&apos;ll still make sure it ends in a glorious fireball. Everything she does is bigger, louder, and more chaotic than it ever needed to be. Zuhal is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, she brings an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bigger, louder, messier - never clean, never subtle.&lt;br&gt;- Fast mover - keeps the rest scrambling to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
