			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Matt sees people as tools - useful until they&apos;re not. They take what they need, wring every ounce of value out of those around them, and discard them the moment they become dead weight. Loyalty and morality are just obstacles to be overcome. Matt doesn&apos;t just insult - they target weaknesses, exploit frustration, and make sure the enemy is too pissed off to think straight. &quot;Oh no, take your time! It&apos;s not like I&apos;ve dodged this same move six times already.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats people like tools - breaks them, bins them, moves on.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
