			<personalityDescription>Leena knows what she wants and isn&apos;t afraid to take charge. Whether on the battlefield or in a briefing room, she speaks with confidence and expects to be heard - hesitation is not in her vocabulary. &quot;&apos;Meks can take a beating. So can pistols. So can this.&quot; Leena yanks a jammed sidearm free with enough force to nearly break the slide, wrenches a stuck panel open with her bare hands, and shoves a power cell into place like she&apos;s punching it into submission. Her squad has learned to hand her the spares. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Speaks with confidence, expects compliance. No tolerance for indecision.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
