			<personalityDescription>Behiye doesn&apos;t believe in overthinking - if an idea crosses their mind, it&apos;s already halfway to reality. Every decision is made in the moment, with no time wasted on doubt or second-guessing. In a ruthless world, Behiye refuses to become another heartless warrior. They watch out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs them. The weight of every choice lingers in their mind, but they&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns thought into action without delay. Second-guessing isn&apos;t in the vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
