			<personalityDescription>No matter how many times Ai-May gets knocked down, she gets back up stronger. She takes every hit, every loss, every failure, and turns it into fuel to keep moving forward. The universe is broken, and Ai-May knows it. She doesn&apos;t get involved in arguments, doesn&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly doesn&apos;t stick her neck out for anyone. As far as she&apos;s concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Uses every failure as fuel. Stronger after every fall.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fight. Doesnt flinch. Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
