			<personalityDescription>Muhjar measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To her, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw she has no intention of indulging. Muhjar builds her life on lies, and she&apos;s good at it. False identities, rigged contracts, and backroom deals are just part of the game she plays. The real trick isn&apos;t just fooling people - it&apos;s making sure they never realize they&apos;ve been fooled at all. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Emotion is leverage, not weakness. Hesitation isn&apos;t tolerated.&lt;br&gt;- Lives in a house of cards and dares you to knock.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
