			<personalityDescription>Once, Ajax might have wanted more, but now? He&apos;s seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Ajax has long since stopped caring. Ajax knows holovids are escapism, but he doesn&apos;t care. They&apos;re structured, predictable, full of meaning. Unlike the mess that is real life, where nothing follows a script and everything falls apart for no reason. &quot;Real life&apos;s got terrible pacing. At least in holovids, things happen for a reason.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Burned out or just gave up - either way, not climbing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
