			<personalityDescription>Connor isn&apos;t just a fighter - they&apos;re a chess master with live ammunition. They set traps, lure enemies into kill zones, and play mind games that leave opponents scrambling while they calmly execute their next move. Connor doesn&apos;t argue - they disregard. They have no patience for hesitation, doubt, or anything they perceives as weakness. If someone can&apos;t keep up, they simply move forward without them. </personalityDescription>
