			<personalityDescription>Some call it paranoia; Pascala calls it survival. She keeps her eyes open, her mind sharp, and her instincts honed, because the moment she lets her guard down, she knows that&apos;s when disaster will strike. Pascala doesn&apos;t just react to situations - she creates them. She manipulates events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering her way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing her game all along. </personalityDescription>
