			<personalityDescription>Erum is content with where she is. While others scramble for promotions, glory, or power, she sees no reason to stress - she does her job, collects her pay, and doesn&apos;t bother chasing dreams that require unnecessary effort. If Erum&apos;s on your side today, don&apos;t count on her tomorrow. She&apos;s an expert at playing both sides, shifting allegiances, and making sure she always lands on top - no matter who she has to betray. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Clock-puncher. No fire, no hunger, no ambition.&lt;br&gt;- Bet on them betraying you. The only sure thing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
