			<personalityDescription>Masaki never acts on impulse - every move he makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, he plays the long game, ensuring he always comes out ahead. Masaki&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. He can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what he wants. </personalityDescription>
