			<personalityDescription>Sharyn refuses to accept anything less than perfection. She puts in the time, the effort, and the relentless focus needed to ensure that when the moment comes, she&apos;s ready for anything. Sharyn tries to act normal, but in zero-G, she can&apos;t hide her discomfort. She moves too carefully, too rigidly, her body tense with every motion. &quot;Yeah, I&apos;m fine. Just - I&apos;m gonna stay right here until we&apos;re back to normal.&quot; </personalityDescription>
