			<personalityDescription>Falala doesn&apos;t check in, doesn&apos;t follow up, and doesn&apos;t worry about what gets left behind. If something was truly important, someone else would have reminded her - or better yet, handled it themselves. Falala&apos;s alarms are always ignored, her comms are always buzzing with angry messages, and she&apos;s always the last one suited up. No one knows how she still manages to be an effective warrior, but somehow, she gets away with it. The day her luck runs out, though, is going to be spectacularly bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 60%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaves loose ends like it&apos;s a strategy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
