			<personalityDescription>Minnie doesn&apos;t just think ahead - she sees ahead. She plays the long game, maneuvering people and events to her advantage, making sure every move she makes strengthens her position while others scramble to keep up. Minnie has seen rules bend and break in the face of war. She&apos;s watched people compromise their values to survive. She refuses. She follows a code because if she doesn&apos;t, then nothing means anything anymore. </personalityDescription>
