			<personalityDescription>Tara is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. She looks out for her allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. Tara doesn&apos;t just want to win - she needs to. When things get desperate, she doesn&apos;t hesitate. She&apos;ll break rules, take risks no sane person would, leave others behind if it means claiming victory. Because in the end, in war, second place is just another name for dead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 67%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always bringing extras - makes sure no one&apos;s left empty-handed.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
