			<personalityDescription>In a ruthless world, Ha refuses to become another heartless warrior. He watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs him. The weight of every choice lingers in his mind, but he&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. &quot;Assisted targeting? No thanks. I trust my own aim.&quot; Ha refuses to rely on advanced systems, opting for manual overrides, old-school tactics, and tech he can actually repair himself. His squad mocks his stubbornness - until their fancy gear inevitably malfunctions, and Ha&apos;s old methods keep him alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
