			<personalityDescription>Mollie never misses an opportunity. She&apos;s quick to turn setbacks into advantages, shifting gears effortlessly when a better option appears. If someone hesitates, she&apos;ll already be three moves ahead, making the most of their hesitation. Mollie has a gift for understanding situations at a glance, spotting the key players and seeing paths to victory that others overlook. Whether in strategy, diplomacy, or battle, her ability to read the moment gives her an undeniable edge. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns losses into leverage. Capitalizes while others hesitate.&lt;br&gt;- Strategic sixth sense. Finds the leverage before the rest of us even blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
