			<personalityDescription>Kabira knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, she&apos;ll take the best deal for herself. She&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, she&apos;ll make sure she walks away with the biggest share. While she doesn&apos;t seek attention, Kabira notices everything. She listens more than she speaks, analyzes before she acts, and values deep conversations over shallow chatter. Her quiet nature makes her words all the more impactful when she chooses to share them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;br&gt;- Quiet type. Won&apos;t lead the toast, but will notice who&apos;s missing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
