			<personalityDescription>Kamna&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. She scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts her will so thoroughly that those around her rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Kamna always has people&apos;s backs. Whether it&apos;s offering words of encouragement, stepping in when someone&apos;s struggling, or making sure her unit feels valued, she&apos;s the kind of person others can always count on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;br&gt;- Backbone of the unit. Always there, even when no ones looking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
