			<personalityDescription>Sadewa enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, they see no reason to deny themself what they desire. Sadewa never makes a move without considering the next ten steps. They manipulate situations like a master tactician, ensuring that when things go their way, it looks like pure luck - but it never is. </personalityDescription>
