			<personalityDescription>Trust is a liability, and Lee-Quin trusts no one. She watches every angle, anticipating betrayal, ambushes, and unseen threats. Whether it&apos;s paranoia or wisdom, her constant vigilance has kept her alive this long. For Lee-Quin, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible she is. She dismisses advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that her skills and luck will always carry her through, no matter the risk. </personalityDescription>
