			<personalityDescription>Agathe doesn&apos;t make rash decisions - she plays the long game. Every battle, every move, and every choice is carefully calculated to maximize her advantage and ensure victory with minimal risk. Agathe is a natural at what she does. Whether it&apos;s piloting, strategy, or problem-solving, she picks things up quickly and executes with precision, making even the most difficult tasks look effortless. </personalityDescription>
