			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Hamasiye - it&apos;s an obsession. She sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in her relentless pursuit of fortune. In the modern military, most people keep their distance - losing friends is inevitable. Not Hamasiye. She remembers every name, every fallen comrade, and she&apos;ll make damn sure no one in her unit dies feeling alone. Whether it&apos;s an arm around your shoulders before battle or a whispered, &quot;We&apos;ve got this,&quot; before charging into hell, Hamasiye refuses to let the universe turn her cold. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Greed isnt a flaw here - its the mission.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
