			<personalityDescription>Andrea trusts exactly one person to get things done right - themself. They nitpick every detail, override decisions they don&apos;t like, and refuse to delegate unless they have no other choice. Andrea thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. They&apos;re impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but them. </personalityDescription>
