			<personalityDescription>Jean doesn&apos;t waste time on sentiment - they do what it takes to win. Morality, loyalty, and fairness are just obstacles, and they have no patience for those too weak to do what&apos;s necessary. Jean doesn&apos;t stomp around like others do. Their footsteps are light, calculated, deliberate. One moment, they&apos;re across the room; the next, they&apos;re right behind you. &quot;You hear that? No? Exactly.&quot; </personalityDescription>
