			<personalityDescription>Jennifer makes it all look easy. Whether it&apos;s navigating a battlefield, negotiating a deal, or fixing a &apos;Mek with limited resources, she handles it with skill, confidence, and just the right amount of flair. &quot;That&apos;s a snake plant. Tough as hell, doesn&apos;t need much, survives in low light. Kind of like us.&quot; Jennifer&apos;s the type to compare a campaign to crop rotation and an ambush to invasive species competition. Her squad has learned to just nod along when she starts explaining plant biology mid-patrol. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Gets it done with style - makes others look clumsy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
