			<personalityDescription>Virginia is the spark that ignites every situation. Her charisma, ambition, and relentless drive make her impossible to ignore, drawing people in and pushing events forward with sheer force of will. People want to believe Virginia, and that&apos;s the danger. She sounds sincere, looks reliable, and acts like she has your back - until the moment it benefits her to do otherwise. </personalityDescription>
