			<personalityDescription>Bent isn&apos;t just quick - he&apos;s calculated. He anticipates problems before they arise and maneuvers people and situations to his advantage. By the time others react, he&apos;s already executing his next move. Bent moves through life like a ghost, detached from the surrounding chaos. Orders are followed, tasks are completed, but there&apos;s no fire behind his actions - just a quiet acceptance that nothing really changes. </personalityDescription>
