			<personalityDescription>No room stays quiet for long when Shihei is around. They thrive on conversation, easily making connections and ensuring that no one feels left out. Whether in a warzone or a bar, they make themself at home among people. Shihei sleeps, but their brain doesn&apos;t. They mutter coordinates, lists off supply counts, or recites mission orders word for word. &quot;Shihei, you were telling us where to take cover in your sleep.&quot; They shrug. &quot;Yeah? And was I wrong?&quot; </personalityDescription>
