			<personalityDescription>Faina has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. She lies, cheats, and takes whatever she pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In her mind, the only crime is getting caught. Faina&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in battle - it&apos;s in people. She connects with others effortlessly, making them feel heard, valued, and understood. Whether leading a unit or comforting a friend, her empathy draws others to her. </personalityDescription>
