			<personalityDescription>Amjad faces the unknown with fearless determination, always pushing forward where others hesitate. Whether it&apos;s uncharted space or a battlefield stacked against him, he refuses to back down from a challenge. Amjad doesn&apos;t just fight - he collects proof of his victories. Spent shell casings, pieces of damaged armor, insignias from defeated foes - his personal space is covered in relics from past engagements. &quot;You keep all this junk for a reason?&quot; someone asks. Amjad smirks. &quot;It&apos;s not junk. It&apos;s history.&quot; </personalityDescription>
