			<personalityDescription>Janice is a walking powder keg, always a moment away from igniting. Her temper flares fast and burns bright, leaving little room for reason once she&apos;s set on a path - whether right or wrong. Janice has an instinct for spotting opportunities before anyone else. She&apos;s always watching, always analyzing, ready to capitalize on any weakness, hesitation, or shift in circumstance. </personalityDescription>
