			<personalityDescription>Edward doesn&apos;t do safe. He thrives in the unknown, the uncertain, the dangerous - where risk is high and the rewards even higher. Whether it&apos;s luck, skill, or sheer nerve, he always seems to come out the other side with a grin. Edward sees everything else as background noise - only the goal in front of him matters. Once he&apos;s committed to something, nothing short of disaster can pull him away. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Avoids safety by choice. Risk is the goal. Somehow, keeps surviving.&lt;br&gt;- Everything but the objective is noise. Won&apos;t stop until it&apos;s done.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
