			<personalityDescription>Subtlety isn&apos;t Chelsey&apos;s style - why waste time sneaking when she can just punch through the front door? She charges in, guns blazing, daring anyone to try and stop her. Tactics are for cowards - brute force gets the job done faster. Chelsey locks onto her objectives with laser precision. Distractions, doubts, and setbacks don&apos;t faze her - once she set her sights on something, she follows through until the job is done. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t sneak. Doesn&apos;t flank. Prefers head-on assaults. No nuance.&lt;br&gt;- Locks in on goals and doesn&apos;t let go. Setbacks don&apos;t register - only results.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
