			<personalityDescription>Nothing slows Sebastiana down - not exhaustion, not setbacks, not even failure. She grinds forward, refusing to accept defeat, because in her mind, stopping is just another way of dying. Sebastiana doesn&apos;t intentionally ignore responsibilities - she just gets caught up in her own world. Whether it&apos;s distractions, forgetfulness, or a lack of organization, things tend to slip through the cracks more often than they should. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps grinding, no matter the setback. Refuses to quit.&lt;br&gt;- Forgetful or just doesn&apos;t care - still a liability.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
