			<personalityDescription>Donall doesn&apos;t let morality get in the way of what he wants. Rules, ethics, and ideals are just obstacles to be sidestepped when necessary - he does whatever works, and if that means playing dirty, so be it. Donall can&apos;t resist a puzzle. &quot;Donall, we need those power cells moved.&quot; &quot;Sure thing - oh, but look at this encryption key, someone tried to hide something here...&quot; His coworkers have learned to either give him puzzles on purpose or rip them out of his hands before he gets lost in them. </personalityDescription>
