			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Masia adapts faster than anyone else. She thrives in unpredictability, adjusting her approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes her way - no matter who gets left behind. Masia&apos;s alarms are always ignored, her comms are always buzzing with angry messages, and she&apos;s always the last one suited up. No one knows how she still manages to be an effective warrior, but somehow, she gets away with it. The day her luck runs out, though, is going to be spectacularly bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrives in chaos. Adapts instantly, leaves others scrambling to catch up.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
