			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Mitsuno has no interest in. She maneuvers through life like a shadow, twisting words, bending loyalties, and setting traps that only she knows how to avoid. People want to believe Mitsuno. Her words are smooth, her arguments airtight, and her timing impeccable. She plants ideas like seeds, letting them take root until others think they were their own all along. </personalityDescription>
