			<personalityDescription>Subtlety has never been Erik&apos;s strong suit. They speak in hard facts and brutal honesty, never sugarcoating their words or wasting time on delicate phrasing. If someone doesn&apos;t like it, that&apos;s their problem. Erik doesn&apos;t have time for delicate fixes or careful handling. The system works, or it doesn&apos;t. If it breaks, they&apos;ll force it to work or move on to something that will. They&apos;ve seen too much, lost too much, to waste time being gentle with something that might not even last another day. </personalityDescription>
