			<personalityDescription>Emmy carries a permanent chip on her shoulder, always ready to turn a disagreement into a full-blown confrontation. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s words or fists - what matters is proving she won. Emmy has a sharp eye for the right moment to strike - whether it&apos;s on the battlefield, in business, or in personal dealings. She&apos;s always looking for an angle, ready to seize any advantage that presents itself. </personalityDescription>
