			<personalityDescription>Megan always has people&apos;s backs. Whether it&apos;s offering words of encouragement, stepping in when someone&apos;s struggling, or making sure her unit feels valued, she&apos;s the kind of person others can always count on. Megan closes her eyes and sees them - the dead, the battles gone wrong, the faces of those who won&apos;t be in the next deployment. So she doesn&apos;t sleep. She just keeps moving, keeps planning, keeps doing something, because the moment she stops, the memories will catch up. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Backbone of the unit. Always there, even when no ones looking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
