			<personalityDescription>No obstacle is too great, no challenge too daunting - Eduard finds a way. When others falter, he digs deep and keeps going, turning setbacks into fuel for an unstoppable drive toward victory. Eduard doesn&apos;t forget because he&apos;s careless. He forgets because his head is already full - full of old battlefields, old mistakes, old names. There&apos;s only so much room in a person&apos;s memory, and Eduard made a choice long ago: he&apos;ll never forget the fallen, even if it means losing everything else. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into fuel. Driven beyond normal limits.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
