			<personalityDescription>Violet isn&apos;t loud about her support, but it&apos;s always there. A nod at the right time, an unspoken gesture of help, or simply being present when it matters - her strength lies in knowing exactly what people need, even when they don&apos;t ask for it. Violet keeps a small, weathered notebook strapped to her gear. Enemy movements, ammo counts, battle formations - if it happens, she writes it down. Some joke that she&apos;s trying to become a war historian, but when her notes reveal enemy patterns before command does, no one&apos;s laughing. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows what you need before you ask. Delivers, quiet and sure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
