			<performanceExamScore>45</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Why wait when you can act? Desaree leaps before looking, speaks before thinking, and never backs down from a challenge. Whether it&apos;s a high-stakes battle or a bad bet, she is always rolling the dice, just to see what happens. Desaree doesn&apos;t believe in luck, but she believes in warnings. She&apos;s watched people ignore the signs - only for them to never return. A slight misstep, a broken routine, a bird call at the wrong time - all dismissed, all followed by disaster. She&apos;s done trying to convince others. She just hopes she&apos;s smart enough to listen when it really matters. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps into trouble for the thrill. Makes chaos just to see the outcome.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
