			<personalityDescription>Some call it persistence, others call it sheer stubbornness - Krasnomira just calls it doing what needs to be done. She doesn&apos;t waste time complaining or doubting; she simply pushes forward until the job is finished. Krasnomira doesn&apos;t rush - she refines. Every plan, every shot, every move is calculated and practiced until it&apos;s second nature. She believes that mastery comes from discipline, and discipline comes from doing the work no one else is willing to. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Quiet, relentless persistence. Gets it done or dies trying.&lt;br&gt;- Repetition breeds mastery. Refines until perfection is habit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
