			<personalityDescription>Fiona knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for her own. She pulls strings, applies pressure, and always ensures that the cost of her success is paid by someone else. No room stays quiet for long when Fiona is around. She thrives on conversation, easily making connections and ensuring that no one feels left out. Whether in a warzone or a bar, she makes herself at home among people. </personalityDescription>
