			<personalityDescription>Steve carries themself with an effortless certainty, believing there&apos;s no challenge too great to overcome. Whether leading a charge or staring down an enemy, they radiate a calm assurance that inspires allies and unsettles foes. When others are ready to retreat, Steve is already planning their next move. No matter how hopeless the situation looks, they refuse to stop. &quot;We&apos;ve lost when we&apos;re dead. And last time I checked, we&apos;re still breathing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
