			<personalityDescription>To Nayara, restraint is just another word for cowardice. They overextends themself at every opportunity, chasing grand plans and high-stakes gambles, never considering that one wrong move could send it all crashing down. No matter the cost, Nayara refuses to let their allies fall. They push themself to exhaustion, takes risks no one else will, and puts others before themself - even when it means they&apos;re the one left bleeding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases every high-risk move like it&apos;s glory. Won&apos;t stop until it&apos;s wreckage.&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds for others, and wont stop until everyones safe.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
