			<personalityDescription>Nothing Augusto does is by chance - he plays the long game, reading between the lines and thinking five steps ahead. By the time others realize what&apos;s happening, he&apos;s already won. Augusto doesn&apos;t believe in taking the high road - not when the low road is so much more satisfying. He remembers every slight, every insult, and every moment someone underestimated him, and he takes special pleasure in evening the score. </personalityDescription>
