			<personalityDescription>Rhea doesn&apos;t just focus - she fixate. She drills her skills, studies her enemies, and plans every move with relentless intensity. To her, anything less than total commitment is the first step toward failure. Experience has made Rhea sharp, cynical, and impossible to fool. She reads between the lines, recognizes hidden motives, and plays every situation like a seasoned professional - because that&apos;s exactly what she is. </personalityDescription>
