			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Patrick is the rock they lean on. He doesn&apos;t just stand his ground - he inspires others to do the same, proving that true strength comes from never backing down, no matter how impossible the fight may seem. Keeping up with details isn&apos;t a priority for Patrick. He does the bare minimum to get by, leaving others to pick up the slack. Whether it&apos;s out of laziness or indifference, he rarely follows through unless it directly benefits him. </personalityDescription>
