			<personalityQuirkDescriptionIndex>2</personalityQuirkDescriptionIndex>
			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>To Rajko, restraint is a foreign concept. They surround themself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy their endless cravings - no matter the cost. Rajko wasn&apos;t always like this. Maybe it was the stress, the years of battle, the losses piling up. Whatever the cause, their mouth can&apos;t always keep up with their brain anymore. &quot;It&apos;s j-j-just a voice, r-right? As long as I c-can still f-f-fight, it d-doesn&apos;t matter.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lives for indulgence - luxury, temptation, distraction. A liability in quiet moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
