			<personalityDescription>Mathias never acts on impulse - every move he makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, he plays the long game, ensuring he always comes out ahead. Even when Mathias offers help, it comes wrapped in barely concealed disdain. His advice drips with superiority, his compliments feel backhanded, and every conversation leaves people wondering if they&apos;ve just been insulted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 75%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every move is measured. Long-game thinker, never impulsive.&lt;br&gt;- Leads with ego. Expects everyone to thank them for the privilege.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
