			<personalityDescription>Dani doesn&apos;t get angry - she gets efficient. Killing isn&apos;t about rage or revenge; it&apos;s about eliminating threats as quickly and effectively as possible. If she has to wipe out an entire company to make a point, so be it. Dani doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow her down. Every decision, every action is a step toward her goal. While others waver or compromise, she stays locked onto her objective, no matter what it takes to get there. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cold, lethal efficiency. Will wipe out entire units to prove a point.&lt;br&gt;- Laser-focused. Doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise - just advances.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
