			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Ralph has a sharp mind and a keen eye for details. He quickly picks up on patterns, sees through deception, and understands situations faster than most, making him a formidable strategist both on and off the battlefield. Ralph doesn&apos;t care if it&apos;s tactically efficient - what matters is style, impact, and recognition. If he&apos;s going to win, he&apos;s going to do it his way. &quot;If they don&apos;t know it&apos;s me by how I fight, then I&apos;m not fighting right.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through noise - grabs the signal before anyone else hears it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
