			<personalityDescription>Death isn&apos;t just a consequence of war for Maurice - it&apos;s the objective. They move through conflict like a reaper, methodical and unrelenting, leaving nothing but silence and ruin in their wake. Maurice has a fact or figure for every situation, whether it&apos;s accuracy rates, survival odds, or enemy engagement trends. They never just trust intuition. &quot;Statistically speaking, you should already be dead. But hey, keep doing whatever it is you call &apos;strategy.&apos;&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Death is the goal, not the cost. Methodical, unstoppable, thorough.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
