			<personalityDescription>Samantha doesn&apos;t believe in &quot;enough.&quot; No matter how much wealth or influence she accumulates, she always craves more, scheming and manipulating to ensure that every deal tilts in her favor. Samantha doesn&apos;t just live by her warrior&apos;s code - she expects others to respect it. She looks down on cowardly tactics, refuses to dishonor a battlefield, and has no patience for those who fight without principle. &quot;A victory without honor isn&apos;t a victory at all,&quot; she proclaims. </personalityDescription>
