			<personalityDescription>Titas never acts without a plan. Every move she makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time her opponents realize what&apos;s happening, she&apos;s already won. Titas is most comfortable in the quiet, away from the noise and chaos of crowded rooms. She doesn&apos;t mind company, but she prefers to keep her circle small - only those she trusts, and even that list is short. </personalityDescription>
