			<personalityDescription>Betty doesn&apos;t just see the game being played - she plays it better than everyone else. She spots weaknesses, exploits blind spots, and reads people like open books. By the time others realize they&apos;ve been outmaneuvered, it&apos;s already too late. Betty&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, she keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Playing three games at once and winning all of them.&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
