			<personalityDescription>Kang-xi is always spoiling for a fight, whether it&apos;s on the battlefield or in a bar. He thrives on confrontation and never backs down, turning even the smallest slight into an excuse to throw a punch - or fire a shot. No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Kang-xi tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. He refuses to play politics or pretend to be something he isn&apos;t, even if it makes him enemies. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 34%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Picks fights over nothing. Escalates at the drop of a hat. Dangerous in close quarters.&lt;br&gt;- Tells the truth even when it hurts. Especially when it hurts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
