			<personalityDescription>Jamison&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in skill or strategy - it&apos;s in sheer, unyielding willpower. Once she starts something, she&apos;ll see it through to the bitter end, no matter what it costs. Nothing satisfies Jamison for long. She hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand her fortune - no matter the cost to those around her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will sees them through. Won&apos;t stop until the job&apos;s done - or they are.&lt;br&gt;- Always chasing the next payout. Never sticks around after the take.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
