			<personalityDescription>For Juan, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. He fights like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. There&apos;s no telling what Juan will do next, and that&apos;s what makes him dangerous. His moods swing wildly, his plans shift without warning, and his reactions can be as destructive to his allies as they are to his enemies. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks more than just machines. Aims to destroy morale. Relentless.&lt;br&gt;- Volatile. Could win the day or get someone killed.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
