			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Kenna carves a path forward with unwavering determination. She doesn&apos;t ask for permission and doesn&apos;t wait for approval - Kenna acts, and others either follow or get left behind. Kenna doesn&apos;t believe in lost causes. As long as she&apos;s breathing, she&apos;s still in the fight. She&apos;ll push forward even when logic, reason, and survival instincts say to fall back. &quot;You think it&apos;s over? Not until I say it is.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts without asking. Leads by momentum. Others fall in line or fall behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
