			<personalityDescription>Once Ron sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no stopping him. He thrives on momentum, constantly pushing himself and those around him to reach new heights. Ron wakes up some nights with his hands shaking, convinced he can still feel something breathing against his skin. He doesn&apos;t know if it&apos;s the nightmares or something worse bleeding through the cracks of reality. &quot;It&apos;s not just a dream. I know what I saw.&quot; </personalityDescription>
