			<personalityDescription>Patience and restraint have never been Balthazar&apos;s strengths. He acts first, thinks later, and rarely regrets it - because in his mind, slowing down is just another way of losing. Compassion is a weakness Balthazar can&apos;t afford. He doesn&apos;t hesitate to make hard decisions, sacrifice allies, or eliminate threats with cold efficiency. In his mind, survival means shutting out anything that might make him hesitate. </personalityDescription>
