			<personalityDescription>Marjani doesn&apos;t believe in brute force when superior strategy will do. They dissect enemy formations, anticipate movements, and execute plans with ruthless efficiency - ensuring that by the time the battle begins, they&apos;ve already won. Marjani never hides behind false pretenses or empty words. They stand by their beliefs, never bending to fit expectations, and make no apologies for who they are - whether people like it or not. </personalityDescription>
