			<personalityDescription>Rich builds his life on lies, and he&apos;s good at it. False identities, rigged contracts, and backroom deals are just part of the game he plays. The real trick isn&apos;t just fooling people - it&apos;s making sure they never realize they&apos;ve been fooled at all. Rich doesn&apos;t waste his time on pointless debates or petty disputes. He&apos;ll listen, nod, and then quietly walk away, letting others fight while he moves on. &quot;You all let me know when you&apos;re done yelling. I&apos;ll be over here actually getting things done.&quot; </personalityDescription>
