			<personalityDescription>Alcine charges headfirst into danger without hesitation, trusting instinct and luck to carry them through. Whether it&apos;s an impossible maneuver or a head-on assault, they never stop to ask if it&apos;s a good idea - only if it&apos;s exciting. No achievement satisfies Alcine for long. They devour challenges with reckless enthusiasm, only to discard them once conquered, already looking for the next impossible feat to chase. </personalityDescription>
