			<personalityDescription>Makeen has an uncanny ability to turn even the worst situations into financial gain. Whether it&apos;s salvaging wrecks, flipping assets, or cutting deals in the middle of chaos, he always ensures he walks away richer than he started. Makeen always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. He might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. </personalityDescription>
