			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Mae&apos;s vengeance isn&apos;t always loud, but it&apos;s always calculated. A missing ration pack, an inconvenient reassignment, a subtle but devastating rumor - she plays the long game when it comes to payback, and she enjoys every second of it. Mae&apos;s habit of collecting callsigns isn&apos;t just trivia - it&apos;s a survival tactic. She knows who&apos;s on the other side of the radio before they say a word. &quot;That&apos;s Razor on comms. If she&apos;s talking, it&apos;s already bad.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Quiet vengeance artist. Recommend assignment nowhere near comms.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
