			<personalityDescription>Verner moves like they&apos;ve got an internal reactor running at full burn. Whether it&apos;s work, combat, or downtime, they tackle everything with relentless enthusiasm, always ready for the next challenge. Trusting Verner is like betting against the house - the game is already rigged. They know how to talk, how to persuade, and how to convince people that they&apos;re making the right choice, even when it&apos;s all just another carefully designed con. </personalityDescription>
