			<performanceExamScore>33</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Langgeng doesn&apos;t wait for chances - they take them, regardless of the cost. Allies, morals, and promises are all secondary to survival and success. If there&apos;s a gap to exploit, they&apos;ll find it, and if there isn&apos;t one, they&apos;ll make one. Langgeng doesn&apos;t just accept chaos - they expect it. They&apos;ve seen too many battles fall apart, too many plans shatter on contact with reality. The ones who survive? They&apos;re the ones who stop trying to force order onto war and start embracing the madness. </personalityDescription>
