			<personalityDescription>The world can throw everything it has at Evelpist, and he&apos;ll still keep going. His strength isn&apos;t in speed or skill alone, but in sheer refusal to accept defeat, no matter how far the odds are stacked against him. Evelpist is never satisfied - his hunger for power, resources, and dominance knows no limits. He devours opportunities, crushes competition, and takes what he wants without hesitation. Sooner or later, even his allies will wonder if they&apos;re next. </personalityDescription>
