			<personalityDescription>Fikra thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Fikra simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Fikra sees morality as a luxury they can&apos;t afford. If there&apos;s a faster, more efficient way to get ahead - no matter how brutal - they&apos;ll take it without hesitation or regret. </personalityDescription>
