			<personalityDescription>In a ruthless world, Miranda refuses to become another heartless warrior. She watches out for those who can&apos;t protect themselves, even when it costs her. The weight of every choice lingers in her mind, but she&apos;d rather carry it than let others suffer. Miranda doesn&apos;t panic when things go wrong - she adapts. Running low on ammo? She&apos;s already found an alternative. Outnumbered? She&apos;s using the terrain to even the odds. &quot;Doesn&apos;t matter what we have. What matters is how we use it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries the guilt others avoid. Hearts still in it, even if it costs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
