			<personalityDescription>Supriya doesn&apos;t fight with finesse or restraint - she fights to destroy. Every engagement is a whirlwind of unrelenting brutality, where survival isn&apos;t enough - domination is the only acceptable outcome. Supriya&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just her skill, but her ability to think. She sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when she moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No subtlety, no retreat. Survival is secondary to total destruction.&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
