			<personalityDescription>Cheymarina doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. Cheymarina doesn&apos;t just want - she takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, she ensures every advantage lands in her pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees setbacks as challenges, not endings. Keeps advancing.&lt;br&gt;- Takes first, asks never. If it&apos;s not nailed down, it&apos;s already theirs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
