			<personalityDescription>Fida doesn&apos;t rush - he refines. Every plan, every shot, every move is calculated and practiced until it&apos;s second nature. He believes that mastery comes from discipline, and discipline comes from doing the work no one else is willing to. Fida believes that strength isn&apos;t just about winning battles - it&apos;s about lifting others up. He offers encouragement when morale is low, steps in when someone struggles, and always ensures those around him feel seen and valued. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Repetition breeds mastery. Refines until perfection is habit.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t forget the people in the fight. Makes sure no one gets left behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
