			<personalityDescription>Hervé doesn&apos;t just dream - he plans. Every action he takes is calculated to move him forward, and he doesn&apos;t get distracted by short-term setbacks or fleeting opportunities. If he wants something, he&apos;ll get it, one way or another. Hervé has a talent for convincing others to do the hard work while he reaps the rewards. He plays on emotions, dangles promises just out of reach, and always manages to walk away with more than he put in. If someone ends up shortchanged, that&apos;s their problem. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plans every step. Ignores setbacks - only progress matters.&lt;br&gt;- Lets others do the work, then pockets the rewards with a smile.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
