			<personalityDescription>No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Bob tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. He refuses to play politics or pretend to be something he isn&apos;t, even if it makes him enemies. Enemy forces closing in? Bob still finds time to compliment someone for their &quot;magnificent trigger discipline&quot; or the lance&apos;s scout for &quot;nailing that stealthy approach.&quot; Some think it&apos;s just his way of keeping morale up. Others think he&apos;s stalling, trying to keep himself from processing the violence happening around him. </personalityDescription>
