			<personalityDescription>Lykaios isn&apos;t interested in quick victories - they&apos;re interested in certain victories. They wait, watch, and maneuver every piece into place before making their move, ensuring that when the moment comes, their enemies never see it coming. Experience and instinct guide Lykaios&apos;s every move. They don&apos;t hesitate, don&apos;t second-guess - they just execute with the confidence of someone who&apos;s done this a thousand times before. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Prefers certainty to speed. Strikes only when the board is set.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t flinch. Just acts - and it works.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
