			<personalityDescription>Yoshi doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects him to stick his neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. Yoshi refuses to stand still, his mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. His adaptability keeps him one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. </personalityDescription>
