			<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Kai refuses to be infected. He knows he&apos;s the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment he does, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. &quot;This reminds me of a fight we had on Kelenfold. Same terrain, same bad odds.&quot; Kai always has a story, always a comparison to something before. His lance listens - sometimes for wisdom, sometimes just to hear about a time when things weren&apos;t so bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 64%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats doubt like weakness. Believes they&apos;re the best - and fights like it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
