			<personalityDescription>For Ann, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible they are. They dismiss advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that their skills and luck will always carry them through, no matter the risk. Ann simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even their own well-being are secondary to whatever they deem important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of their inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not their. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees every warning as noise. Trusts skill to bail them out - always.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t track gear, doesn&apos;t track people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
