			<personalityDescription>Every situation is a potential fight in Brandy&apos;s mind. They don&apos;t care if it&apos;s an argument, a rivalry, or a full-scale war - they treat them all the same: something to be won, and preferably in the loudest, most aggressive way possible. Brandy has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. They can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get their way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where they want them to go. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees all conflict as war. Solves everything loud and hard.&lt;br&gt;- Gets agreement without argument. Smooth operator.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
