			<personalityDescription>Arnel&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just his skill, but his ability to think. He sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when he moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. Arnel&apos;s normal most of the time, but when certain topics come up, his demeanor changes. He redirects, deflects, or just walks away entirely. It&apos;s not subtle, but it works. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
