			<personalityDescription>No matter what gets thrown at her, Rakhi bounces back. Whether it&apos;s a brutal loss, a catastrophic failure, or a battlefield injury, she refuses to let anything break her. Rakhi fights with honor because she refuses to become just another killer. She&apos;s seen what war does to people - how it turns them into cold, brutal survivors. If she&apos;s going to fight, she&apos;ll do it her way - with courage, with dignity, and with the hope that it still matters. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes the hit, gets back up. Nothing breaks them for long.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
