			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Power and influence mean nothing to Lexus unless they can be bought. She thrives on backdoor negotiations, whispered exchanges in dimly lit rooms, and untraceable contracts. If there&apos;s a way to twist the system for personal gain, she&apos;s already ahead of the game. Lexus isn&apos;t heartless, just detached. She doesn&apos;t feel the need to intervene, fix things, or fight for anything beyond her own survival. If someone expects her to care, they&apos;ll be sorely disappointed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every favor ends up in their bank account.&lt;br&gt;- Detached, not cruel - but don&apos;t count on backup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
