			<personalityDescription>Mike charges into danger without a second thought, unshaken by enemy fire or overwhelming odds. He believes fear is a distraction and meets every challenge with unwavering resolve. Mercy is just another word for weakness in Mike&apos;s mind. He eliminates threats before they become problems and never lets emotions stand in the way of his ambition. </personalityDescription>
