			<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Tori like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. They fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Tori has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply their presence, they remind people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fueled by anger. Never lets an insult slide - on or off the field.&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
