			<personalityDescription>For Alexis, compromise is just another word for weakness. She sticks to her principles, strategies, and orders with unwavering determination, even when logic - or survival - suggests a different path. Alexis&apos;s hunger for success, power, and experience is bottomless. She consumes challenges, pushes boundaries, and refuses to settle for anything less than total domination - because anything less would be a waste. </personalityDescription>
