			<personalityDescription>James isn&apos;t just tough - he&apos;s unshakable. Setbacks don&apos;t discourage him, and suffering doesn&apos;t slow him down. He keeps pushing forward, no matter how much it hurts, because giving up simply isn&apos;t an option. James weaves lies so seamlessly into the truth that even he might start believing them. From forged documents to fabricated histories, he&apos;s built his success on smoke and mirrors, always staying one step ahead of the truth. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unshakable. Keeps pushing - giving up isn&apos;t in the vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Lies so well they forget where the truth ends.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
