			<personalityDescription>Ivan has a way with words and an even better way with deals. He can navigate complex negotiations, twist situations in his favor, and come out ahead in any conversation. If someone tries to con him, they&apos;d better be ready to lose. Ivan&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, he keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Silver tongue and iron grip - gets what they want, walks away clean.&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
