			<personalityDescription>Marie has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, her sharp mind and keen perception give her an edge in any encounter. Marie doesn&apos;t let bullets, explosions, or chaos stop her from making sure people get pronouns right. She&apos;ll dodge incoming fire while effortlessly correcting someone mid-sentence. &quot;Yeah, yeah, cover me - also, &apos;they&apos; just took down two enemies, not &apos;she.&apos; Now move.&quot; </personalityDescription>
