			<personalityDescription>Nora thrives on thinking outside the box. Whether it&apos;s unconventional tactics, custom modifications, or creative problem-solving, she&apos;s always finding new ways to gain an edge where others see dead ends. Nora is known for being fearless - until a situation involves heights. She avoids cliffs, refuses to stand near edges, and takes every alternate route possible. &quot;Yeah, yeah, I know it&apos;s the &apos;quickest way.&apos; It&apos;s also a death sentence.&quot; </personalityDescription>
