			<personalityDescription>Chaos isn&apos;t an obstacle for Shigeta; it&apos;s the natural state of things. They are most alive when everything around them is on the edge of collapse, thriving in the turmoil where others falter. Shigeta always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear they think they&apos;re the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, they have a way of making others feel small without ever raising their voice. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrives in chaos. Performs best under collapse.&lt;br&gt;- Smirks before they speak. You know the tone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
