			<personalityDescription>Virginia isn&apos;t just tough - she&apos;s unshakable. Setbacks don&apos;t discourage her, and suffering doesn&apos;t slow her down. She keeps pushing forward, no matter how much it hurts, because giving up simply isn&apos;t an option. Virginia fights for one thing: the highest bidder. She&apos;s not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps her alive and well-paid. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unshakable. Keeps pushing - giving up isn&apos;t in the vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Hired gun. No cause, no loyalty - just money.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
