			<personalityDescription>Subtlety isn&apos;t Jadzia&apos;s style - why waste time sneaking when she can just punch through the front door? She charges in, guns blazing, daring anyone to try and stop her. Tactics are for cowards - brute force gets the job done faster. Jadzia knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. She pushes herself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in her mind, every struggle brings her closer to her ultimate goal. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t sneak. Doesn&apos;t flank. Prefers head-on assaults. No nuance.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes harder than most. Sees struggle as proof they&apos;re on the right path.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
