			<personalityDescription>For Laurent, hesitation is just another form of failure. He throws himself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, he never slows down. Laurent is ruled by his desires, chasing pleasure with reckless abandon. He consumes, indulges, and takes what he wants without concern for the consequences, leaving behind a trail of broken promises and burned bridges. </personalityDescription>
