			<personalityDescription>Everything grates on her - people, orders, even the sound of her own comms. Asdghig is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who she is, her temper is a fuse ready to blow. Asdghig keeps the music going because without it, all that&apos;s left is the sound of gunfire, screams, and things she&apos;d rather not remember. She drowns it all out before it can creep in. &quot;You want me to turn it off? No. I don&apos;t do silence.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
