			<personalityDescription>Once Kaylie sets her sights on something, there&apos;s no shaking her. She&apos;ll keep coming, keep working, and keep fighting long after others would have given up, proving that sheer force of will can sometimes be the most dangerous weapon of all. There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Kaylie&apos;s world. She delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, she makes sure they know it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Once committed, won&apos;t let go. Willpower becomes weapon.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
