			<personalityDescription>The universe grinds down the weak, but Stef refuses to break. They endure hardship, battle, and betrayal with ironclad willpower, pressing forward no matter how much blood they have to wade through to get there. Stef never doubts themself, even when they absolutely should. They struts into battle like they&apos;ve already won and dismisses any challenge with a smirk. If someone questions their skills, they&apos;ll be the first to bet their wages on proving them wrong. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Wades through hell with steady purpose. Bleeds, but never breaks.&lt;br&gt;- Never doubts, even when wrong. Swagger first, strategy later.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
