			<personalityDescription>Anice is convinced she can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. She stretches herself thin, takes on risks she shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether she can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of her vocabulary. Yet. Anice doesn&apos;t freeze when things go sideways - she accelerates. No hesitation, no second-guessing, just instinct and action. Her lance watches her make reckless choices that somehow always pay off. &quot;Stop overthinking. Just move.&quot; </personalityDescription>
