			<personalityDescription>In Elizabeth&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. She seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the only one left standing. Elizabeth chases every high, every challenge, every risk like she&apos;s possessed. Whether it&apos;s wealth, battle, or adrenaline, she can&apos;t stop herself from pushing further, faster, and harder - because the moment she slows down, she gets bored. And that is unacceptable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees kindness as weakness. Destroys problems before they form.&lt;br&gt;- Restless, reckless, always hunting the next rush. Can&apos;t sit still.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
