			<personalityDescription>Suseela doesn&apos;t fight with finesse or restraint - he fights to destroy. Every engagement is a whirlwind of unrelenting brutality, where survival isn&apos;t enough - domination is the only acceptable outcome. Suseela doesn&apos;t waste time on fair deals when an unfair one gets him more. He plays on desperation, weaknesses, and ambition, twisting every situation to ensure that, in the end, Suseela is the one who profits most. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No subtlety, no retreat. Survival is secondary to total destruction.&lt;br&gt;- If theres a win to be had, they&apos;ll take the lion&apos;s share and call it fair.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
