			<personalityDescription>Mandy doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise, and certainly doesn&apos;t entertain alternatives. Her way is the right way - end of discussion, no exceptions. Mandy doesn&apos;t just use hand signals as a preference - she relies on them. She&apos;s seen how noise gives away positions, how a whispered word at the wrong time can be the last thing someone says. She signals because it&apos;s safer. Because sometimes, speaking at all is too dangerous. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No deviation, no negotiation. Their way or nothing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
