			<personalityDescription>To Saniya, every situation holds potential - she just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into her gain, she never lets an opening go to waste. Saniya&apos;s locker is full of small, seemingly insignificant items - a spent shell casing from her first battle, a scrap of fabric from an old unit patch, a dented dog tag that isn&apos;t her. &quot;They&apos;re just reminders,&quot; she says when asked. Reminders of what, she never says. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats crisis as currency. Turns every shift into personal gain.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
