			<personalityDescription>Sehar never truly relaxes - her mind is always scanning, always assessing. Every situation is a puzzle, every interaction a potential threat, and she refuses to be caught  off guard. To Sehar, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits her, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. She&apos;s not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits her most in the moment. </personalityDescription>
