			<personalityDescription>Jennifer acts before thinking, always ready to throw herself into a fight at the slightest provocation. Patience isn&apos;t her strong suit, and keeping Jennifer in check is often as dangerous as facing the enemy. Jennifer never asks for recognition, never tries to take control. But somehow, her way of doing things always becomes the way things get done. People look to her when they&apos;re uncertain, even though she never volunteers for leadership. </personalityDescription>
