			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Derla doesn&apos;t just take charge - they smothers every situation with their presence. Whether giving orders or offering &quot;advice,&quot; they make sure their voice is the loudest and their will is the only one that matters. Derla always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. They might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, they&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Dominates every room. Advice feels like orders - can&apos;t be ignored.&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
