			<personalityDescription>Maria lives for the thrill of the impossible, drawn to challenges that make others hesitate. Rules, limits, and second thoughts don&apos;t interest her - only the rush of proving that nothing is beyond her reach. Maria doesn&apos;t rush - she refines. Every plan, every shot, every move is calculated and practiced until it&apos;s second nature. She believes that mastery comes from discipline, and discipline comes from doing the work no one else is willing to. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Drawn to the impossible. Ignores limits. May outpace team or plan.&lt;br&gt;- Repetition breeds mastery. Refines until perfection is habit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
