			<personalityDescription>Morality is just a tool for the naive. Kailyn does whatever it takes to get ahead, stepping over anyone who gets in their way and never looking back. Kailyn doesn&apos;t just track time - they dread it. Every mission is another countdown, every day is another mark closer to an inevitable, unspoken deadline. They schedule things not because they like order, but because they&apos;re terrified of how little control anyone really has. </personalityDescription>
