			<personalityDescription>Sharvani doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. They do what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in their world, only the strong deserve to survive. Sharvani isn&apos;t just a fighter - they&apos;re a chess master with live ammunition. They set traps, lure enemies into kill zones, and play mind games that leave opponents scrambling while they calmly execute their next move. </personalityDescription>
