			<personalityDescription>Tofeeq doesn&apos;t need brute force when a few well-placed words can do the job. He weaves half-truths and clever deceptions with ease, turning enemies against each other while he walks away unscathed - and usually richer. Tofeeq expects things to go wrong, so he prepares before they do. He inspects equipment, tests redundancies, and always runs his own last-minute diagnostics. His lance groans every time he slows them down - until the one time he catches something everyone else missed. </personalityDescription>
