			<personalityDescription>To Raúl, obstacles are just opportunities that haven&apos;t realized they&apos;ve lost yet. He meets every challenge with unwavering confidence, his presence alone enough to make people second-guess their own hesitation. Raúl talks about his terrible crime like it&apos;s ancient history, even though it&apos;s clear it&apos;s still eating him alive. His comrades think he&apos;s made peace with it - but Raúl knows better. &quot;Yeah, I did that. Turns out &apos;sorry&apos; doesn&apos;t fix that kind of mistake.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns problems into stepping stones. Confidence shakes others out of doubt.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
