			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Lusala refuses to be infected. He knows he&apos;s the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment he does, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. Lusala will do whatever it takes to survive and profit. He switches sides when the money&apos;s right, abandons allies if the deal goes sour, and never lets sentiment get in the way of a paycheck. If someone wants loyalty, they&apos;d better pay extra. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats doubt like weakness. Believes they&apos;re the best - and fights like it.&lt;br&gt;- Switches sides mid-fight if the payout shifts. Not to be trusted without a signed contract.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
