			<personalityDescription>Trusting Keith is like betting against the house - the game is already rigged. He knows how to talk, how to persuade, and how to convince people that they&apos;re making the right choice, even when it&apos;s all just another carefully designed con. Keith&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, he keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every word a hook - smiles while fleecing the mark.&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
