			<personalityDescription>Brona doesn&apos;t believe in waiting for the right moment - she makes the moment right. Her determination fuels everything she does, propelling her forward no matter the obstacles in her way. Brona enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, she sees no reason to deny herself what she desires. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t wait for chances - builds them. Momentum is the fuel.&lt;br&gt;- No impulse control - if they want it, they take it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
