			<personalityDescription>Subtlety? Restraint? Alycia&apos;s never heard of them. If one LRM is good, twenty are better. If a fight can be won cleanly, she&apos;ll still make sure it ends in a glorious fireball. Everything she does is bigger, louder, and more chaotic than it ever needed to be. Alycia&apos;s voice may stumble, but her hands never shake. She might struggle to get the words out, but when the moment comes to act, she&apos;s quicker and sharper than anyone else. &quot;L-l-listen, I d-don&apos;t need to s-say it twice. Y-you better move n-now.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bigger, louder, messier - never clean, never subtle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
