			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Rick has no interest in. He keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in his world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Rick doesn&apos;t let morality get in the way of what he wants. Rules, ethics, and ideals are just obstacles to be sidestepped when necessary - he does whatever works, and if that means playing dirty, so be it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps people away - violently if needed. Trust replaced with defense.&lt;br&gt;- Morality optional - does what works, not what&apos;s right.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
