			<personalityDescription>Rizalino thrives on risk, always pushing limits and taking chances others wouldn&apos;t dare. Whether piloting through a storm of enemy fire or attempting a near-impossible maneuver, he believes that fortune favors the bold. The universe is broken, and Rizalino knows it. He doesn&apos;t get involved in arguments, doesn&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly doesn&apos;t stick his neck out for anyone. As far as he&apos;s concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Seeks risk. Puts faith in boldness. Will test machines, odds, and orders.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fight. Doesnt flinch. Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
