			<personalityDescription>Zuri&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. They don&apos;t hesitate, don&apos;t look back, and don&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, they&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. Zuri refuses to do anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s war, business, or pleasure, they throw themself into everything with a level of intensity that&apos;s exhilarating - or terrifying, depending on where you stand. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;br&gt;- No such thing as enough - only what&apos;s next.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
