			<personalityDescription>Jennifer&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just her skill, but her ability to think. She sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when she moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. Jennifer doesn&apos;t escape because she&apos;s afraid - she does it because  she&apos;s seen what happens when people refuse to retreat. She&apos;s learned that sometimes, the difference between living and dying is knowing when to run. And she never hesitates when that time comes. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
