			<personalityDescription>There is no &quot;enough&quot; for Bruna. She grind forward, unyielding, sacrificing sleep, comfort, and even allies if necessary. Failure isn&apos;t an option - because if she stops moving, she might have to face what she&apos;s lost along the way. Bruna doesn&apos;t just give - she gives big. Whether it&apos;s picking up the tab, upgrading a friend&apos;s &apos;Mek, or spreading wealth where it&apos;s needed, she believes that success means nothing if you can&apos;t share it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 65%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices everything for progress. Keeps moving to outrun whats behind.&lt;br&gt;- Generosity&apos;s big, loud, and hard to miss - keeps spreading the wealth like it&apos;ll never run out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
