			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Some people call it grit, others call it madness, but Julianna doesn&apos;t care what they think. No matter how much the world tries to grind them down, they keep going, long after anyone else would have quit. Julianna doesn&apos;t just see war as strategy - they see it as expression. They study legendary duels, they dissect perfect maneuvers, and they talk about battles like they belong in a museum. &quot;That last engagement? Pure artistry. You don&apos;t just see skill like that every day.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Grit or madness - hard to tell. Doesn&apos;t care. Just keeps moving.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
