			<personalityDescription>Rajanigandha doesn&apos;t waste time with hesitation - once a decision is made, she commits fully. On the battlefield, she acts with precision and confidence, knowing that in the chaos of war, a fast decision is often better than a perfect one. Rajanigandha thrives on audacity. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether she&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, she does it all with a smirk and a shrug. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 35%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commits fast, no waffling. Values momentum over precision. Trusts instinct.&lt;br&gt;- Built from brass and boldness. No filter, no fear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
