			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Eric is already halfway through it. He thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Eric&apos;s actions rarely follow a clear pattern. One moment, he&apos;s cautious and methodical; the next, he&apos;s diving headfirst into chaos. His unpredictability keeps enemies - and sometimes allies - on edge. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 37%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Risks draw them in. Sees combat as challenge, not threat.&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable. Keeps everyone guessing - sometimes that&apos;s an asset.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
