			<personalityDescription>Bhagavatiprasada&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just his skill, but his ability to think. He sifts through information, discards the irrelevant, and acts with precision, ensuring that when he moves, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. Bhagavatiprasada always finds time to check his plants. &quot;You&apos;re looking real good today, Lt. Lavender,&quot; he murmurs to a sprouting seedling. His coworkers have long since stopped questioning it - unless they catch him slipping the plants extra water rations (again). </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brain over brawn. When they act, it&apos;s because they&apos;ve already won.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
