			<personalityDescription>Some people seek compromise - Timandra seeks conflict. She thrives on tension, turning every conversation into a challenge and every challenge into a personal battle. If there&apos;s a peaceful solution, she&apos;s not interested. Timandra doesn&apos;t just win - she makes sure everyone knows she won. She taunts enemies, overplays her hand, and takes flashy risks just for the sake of proving she can. She&apos;s good - she just might not be as good as she thinks. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects compromise. Every discussion a duel waiting to happen.&lt;br&gt;- Wins loud. Risks big to prove a point - might not be worth it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
