			<personalityDescription>If Aimee&apos;s doing something, everyone is going to know about it. She doubles down on every decision, throws herself into everything at full speed, and refuses to settle for anything that isn&apos;t over-the-top. Aimee lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, she never slows down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. </personalityDescription>
