			<personalityDescription>Constança believes the best way to handle a crisis is to prevent it before it happens. She stays ahead of the curve, anticipating challenges and solving problems before anyone else even sees them coming. Constança believes in results, not feelings. She dismisses emotions as distractions and refuses to waste time comforting others. To her, facts, logic, and action matter - sympathy does not. </personalityDescription>
