			<performanceExamScore>40</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Svetolik doesn&apos;t pressure people - he makes them think they&apos;re making their own choices. His calm demeanor, well-placed words, and ability to read a situation let him guide conversations where he wants them to go, without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been led. His hands shake after missions, so he bites his nails. It gives him something to focus on, something small to control when everything else spirals beyond his grasp. If his fingers are raw, if his nails are ruined - well, at least it&apos;s proof he&apos;s still here. At least it&apos;s his own damage, not someone else&apos;s. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- You think it was your idea. It wasn&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
