			<personalityDescription>Malia isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - she simply doesn&apos;t think about them. She jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for her, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. Malia&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s her ability to manipulate. She spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, she&apos;s already taken what she wanted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No thoughts of consequence. Laughs at disaster, races toward it.&lt;br&gt;- Lies like breathing. By the time truth lands, they&apos;re long gone and richer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
