			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>A constant storm of anger simmers beneath Aissa&apos;s surface, ready to explode at the slightest provocation. She doesn&apos;t just despise her enemies - she barely tolerates allies, seeing them as temporary conveniences rather than comrades. Aissa rigs the barracks door to announce everyone&apos;s full rank and name when they enter. She swaps someone&apos;s comm ID so they sound exactly like the unit commander. Even in the middle of a war, she finds ways to make people laugh - because sometimes, that&apos;s the only thing keeping them from breaking. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Anger always close to the surface. Barely tolerates allies - expects them to fail.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
