			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Thomas doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow him down. Every decision, every action is a step toward his goal. While others waver or compromise, he stays locked onto his objective, no matter what it takes to get there. No one knows when Thomas does it, but somehow, there&apos;s always a small paper crane, fox, or star waiting near his bunk, inside DropShips maintenance panels, or tucked into the ammo crates. &quot;Figure if we&apos;re always breaking things,&quot; he says with a shrug, folding another, &quot;I might as well make something for a change.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Laser-focused. Doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise - just advances.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
