			<personalityDescription>Bari is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, he brings an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. Bari sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, he doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in his mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. </personalityDescription>
