			<personalityDescription>Brandeis plays to win, and he doesn&apos;t care how messy it gets. Whether it&apos;s business, politics, or the battlefield, he exploits weaknesses, eliminates competition, and ensures he&apos;s the last one standing - no matter the cost. Brandeis sees every resource as his to claim and his to keep. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage or simple supplies, he takes what he can and shares only when absolutely necessary - if at all. </personalityDescription>
