			<personalityDescription>Diplomacy is second nature to Yolanda. She reads people like an open book, adjusting her words and approach to persuade without pressuring, ensuring that even those who disagree walk away feeling like they&apos;ve been heard. It doesn&apos;t matter if they&apos;re bunked down in a secure zone or camping in enemy territory - Yolanda will always check every entrance, every lock, every secured weapon. &quot;You laugh now,&quot; she says, rattling the latch again, &quot;but the one time I don&apos;t do this, we&apos;ll get jumped in our sleep.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No one argues. Everyone thinks they won. Smart operator.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
