			<personalityDescription>While he doesn&apos;t seek attention, Aeary notices everything. He listens more than he speaks, analyzes before he acts, and values deep conversations over shallow chatter. His quiet nature makes his words all the more impactful when he chooses to share them. Aeary counts enemy movements, tracks their steps, and notes the exact delay between artillery salvos. &quot;That Long Tom fires every 6.4 seconds,&quot; he mutters. &quot;We have 3.2 seconds to move.&quot; Someone scoffs - until Aeary steps out exactly on time, avoiding the blast. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Quiet type. Won&apos;t lead the toast, but will notice who&apos;s missing.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
