			<personalityDescription>While others argue and analyze, Sun-wei is already in motion. He doesn&apos;t need endless deliberation to see the best path forward - Sun-wei weighs the options, picks a course, and executes it with ruthless efficiency. Sun-wei never plays fair - he plays to win. Every promise, every alliance, every deal is just another tool in his arsenal, and he always ensures he comes out ahead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through debate. Acts while others plan. Cold efficiency.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t play fair - plays to win. Every alliance is a setup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
