			<personalityDescription>Sandy knows best - just ask her. Whether it&apos;s battle tactics, logistics, or how to hold a damn coffee cup, she has an opinion and makes sure everyone hears it. If Sandy had more hands, she would probably try to do everyone&apos;s job at the same time. Sandy has an instinct for spotting opportunities before anyone else. She&apos;s always watching, always analyzing, ready to capitalize on any weakness, hesitation, or shift in circumstance. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Has input on everything. Micromanages down to the trivial.&lt;br&gt;- Sees opportunity before it&apos;s visible. Moves first, reaps the reward.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
