			<personalityDescription>If Isvasa isn&apos;t in control, he isn&apos;t comfortable. He orchestrates every move, dictates every step, and ensures that nothing happens without his approval - because, in his mind, no one else can be trusted to do it right. Isvasa doesn&apos;t just remember past battles - he lives in them. He compares every engagement to something that happened before, as if history is on a loop and they&apos;re just playing out a rerun. &quot;We&apos;ve been here before,&quot; he mutters. &quot;Not here-here, but close enough.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Needs full control to function. Dictates every step, permits nothing unsupervised.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
