			<personalityDescription>Hasina treats every challenge like a war of attrition - she doesn&apos;t have to be the fastest or the strongest, just the one still standing at the end. And she always is. By the time others are starting their first briefing, Hasina has already run a full systems check, a workout, and possibly a simulated battle. &quot;I&apos;ve been productive for hours,&quot; she grims, as someone else mumbles, &quot;It&apos;s literally 05:00.&quot; </personalityDescription>
