			<personalityDescription>Julian&apos;s attention to detail is unmatched. Whether reviewing battlefield intel or adjusting a targeting system, he works tirelessly to ensure every factor is in his favor - because in his world, overlooking one detail is a mistake he refuses to make. Julian doesn&apos;t get involved unless he has to. Other people&apos;s problems, moral dilemmas, or even the bigger picture don&apos;t concern him - he focuses on what directly affects him and ignores the rest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t blink without a checklist. Won&apos;t move until every variable&apos;s locked down.&lt;br&gt;- Does the job. Doesn&apos;t care who signs the check.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
