			<personalityDescription>Alysia thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Alysia simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Alysia&apos;s comrades keep dying. Her gear? It stays. So she talks to it, maintains it with care, treats it like it&apos;s alive - because at least it won&apos;t bleed out on her. At least it won&apos;t leave. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Momentum addict. Planning seen as weakness. Lets consequences catch up later.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
