			<personalityDescription>No achievement satisfies Parfeniy for long. He devours challenges with reckless enthusiasm, only to discard them once conquered, already looking for the next impossible feat to chase. Parfeniy isn&apos;t just skeptical - he&apos;s haunted by past failures. The cutting-edge weapons that jammed, the prototype that failed, the experimental implants that fried their users from the inside out. He doesn&apos;t hate innovation - he just knows that in war, new means untested, and untested means deadly. </personalityDescription>
