			<personalityDescription>Compromise is just another word for weakness in Bernadette&apos;s mind. She doesn&apos;t negotiate or accommodate - she dictates, expecting the world to move according to her vision, whether others like it or not. There&apos;s no room for doubt in Bernadette&apos;s world - she already knows she&apos;s right. She speaks with absolute authority, rarely bothers to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of her valuable time. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees compromise as failure. Imposes vision regardless of input.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t listen. Speaks like a prophet, ignores dissent like noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
