			<personalityDescription>Li-Hsia has a way with words and an even better way with deals. She can navigate complex negotiations, twist situations in her favor, and come out ahead in any conversation. If someone tries to con her, they&apos;d better be ready to lose. Li-Hsia has seen too much to care about petty concerns. She ignores emotions, disregards complaints, and barely acknowledges those she considers beneath her. If someone isn&apos;t immediately useful, they might as well not exist. </personalityDescription>
