			<personalityDescription>Elliot doesn&apos;t wait for chances - he takes them, regardless of the cost. Allies, morals, and promises are all secondary to survival and success. If there&apos;s a gap to exploit, he&apos;ll find it, and if there isn&apos;t one, he&apos;ll make one. Elliot doesn&apos;t just swear - he weaponizes it. His profanity is so aggressive that it either rallies his allies or completely rattles his enemies. &quot;Listen here, you miserable pack of rusted ****-stains, either you run now or I&apos;ll show you what a real ****ing disaster looks like.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes chances without hesitation. Morals are optional - results aren&apos;t.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
