			<personalityDescription>Brid refuses to let hardship define her. She&apos;s weathered every storm life has thrown at her, adapting, enduring, and proving that no amount of pain or pressure can break her will. Brid always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear she thinks she&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, she has a way of making others feel small without ever raising her voice. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Refuses to be defined by pain. Endures, adapts, overcomes.&lt;br&gt;- Smirks before they speak. You know the tone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
