			<personalityDescription>Harrietta has never met a fight she didn&apos;t want to start - or finish. Whether it&apos;s charging headfirst into battle or arguing over who gets the last drink, she runs on impulse, always running hot and never cooling down. Harrietta is convinced she can handle anything, no matter how big the challenge. She stretches herself thin, takes on risks she shouldn&apos;t, and charges ahead without thinking about whether she can actually pull it off - because failure isn&apos;t part of her vocabulary. Yet. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Runs on impulse. Seeks out fights, never backs off. No cooldown.&lt;br&gt;- Thinks confidence replaces planning. Runs headfirst into collapse.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
