			<personalityDescription>Ivan doesn&apos;t just lead - he inspires. Whether through quiet words of reassurance or a rallying cry before battle, he fuels those around him with the drive to keep moving, keep fighting, and keep believing in victory. Ivan doesn&apos;t care about sparing feelings - he cares about survival. If someone makes a bad call, he&apos;ll say it outright. If a plan is sloppy, he&apos;ll tear it apart in real-time. &quot;That was a terrible angle. You barely made that shot.&quot; His lance complains - until they realize he&apos;s making them better. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not just a leader - makes people want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
