			<personalityDescription>Why wait when you can act? Borislava leaps before looking, speaks before thinking, and never backs down from a challenge. Whether it&apos;s a high-stakes battle or a bad bet, she is always rolling the dice, just to see what happens. Borislava doesn&apos;t get involved unless she has to. Other people&apos;s problems, moral dilemmas, or even the bigger picture don&apos;t concern her - she focuses on what directly affects her and ignores the rest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps into trouble for the thrill. Makes chaos just to see the outcome.&lt;br&gt;- Does the job. Doesn&apos;t care who signs the check.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
