			<personalityDescription>Albert carries themself with an effortless certainty, believing there&apos;s no challenge too great to overcome. Whether leading a charge or staring down an enemy, they radiate a calm assurance that inspires allies and unsettles foes. Albert&apos;s instincts are razor-sharp. They can smell a bad deal before it&apos;s offered, spot a bluff before it&apos;s played, and turn a negotiation into a masterclass in getting exactly what they want. </personalityDescription>
