			<personalityDescription>While others focus on the now, Nahla&apos;s gaze is locked on what comes next. Her ideas are bold, her ambition boundless, and her ability to inspire others makes even the impossible seem within reach. Nahla&apos;s nightmares bleed into her waking hours, leaving her tired and hollow. She shrugs it off when people notice the dark circles under her eyes. &quot;It&apos;s fine. I&apos;ll sleep when I&apos;m dead. Or maybe not.&quot; </personalityDescription>
