			<personalityDescription>Mirko has seen too much, lost too much, to care anymore. The only thing that matters is getting the job done, and if that means making brutal decisions, so be it. In their world, kindness is just another word for weakness. Mirko is miserable in extreme conditions, but they always find ways to cope. On an ice world? They&apos;re hoarding heat packs in their boots. Stuck in a dust storm? They&apos;re wearing a scarf like some kind of post-apocalyptic bandit. Their ability to adapt is almost as impressive as their ability to suffer loudly. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds others, not themself. Doesn&apos;t lose sleep.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
