			<personalityDescription>Mamoru picks up on unspoken words and subtle cues, adjusting his approach based on the emotions and ideas of those around him. His ability to read people makes him an effective leader, negotiator, and ally. Mamoru doesn&apos;t see convoy missions as boring logistics - he sees them as a real test of skill. Protecting a moving force, managing ambush points, bottlenecks, and chokepoints - to him, that&apos;s the real game. &quot;Stationary fights are predictable. Convoy missions? That&apos;s where you prove you know what you&apos;re doing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads the room better than the brief.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
