			<personalityDescription>Matilde doesn&apos;t believe in stopping - ever. No setback, no injury, no force in the universe can keep her from pushing forward until she&apos;s achieved what she set out to do. Matilde has a habit of letting things slide - deadlines, promises, even basic maintenance. She always means to get around to it, but somehow, there&apos;s always something more interesting or pressing to focus on instead. </personalityDescription>
