			<personalityDescription>Byron&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in battle - it&apos;s in people. He connects with others effortlessly, making them feel heard, valued, and understood. Whether leading a unit or comforting a friend, his empathy draws others to him. Byron doesn&apos;t hoard weapons for fun - he does it because he&apos;s seen what happens when people are caught unprepared. He&apos;s not going to be the one scrambling or a weapon when everything falls apart. If the war comes to him, he&apos;s ready for it. </personalityDescription>
