			<personalityDescription>An-Toan doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make him walk away from something he&apos;s committed to. An-Toan keeps everything - ammo, supplies, spare parts - because you never know when you&apos;ll need them. He refuses to let go of anything useful, even if it means stockpiling more than he could ever realistically use. </personalityDescription>
