			<personalityDescription>Carolyn thrives on momentum, always pressing forward with an intensity that makes backing down seem impossible. She refuses to slow down, always demanding more, pushing herself and everyone around her past their limits. Carolyn doesn&apos;t just have a rival - she has a fixation. A constant presence in her life that keeps her pushing forward, staying sharp, refusing to slip into complacency. Without that challenge, she&apos;s not sure she&apos;d know what to do with herself anymore. &quot;Without them, I don&apos;t know who I&apos;d be. And that scares me more than losing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
