			<personalityDescription>Experience and instinct guide Kesari&apos;s every move. She doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess - she just executes with the confidence of someone who&apos;s done this a thousand times before. Kesari simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even her own well-being are secondary to whatever she deems important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of her inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t flinch. Just acts - and it works.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t track gear, doesn&apos;t track people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
