			<personalityDescription>Awareness is Dave&apos;s greatest weapon. He reads people like a battlefield, catching the smallest shifts in expression or intent, ensuring he&apos;s never the one taken by surprise. Dave talks about his terrible crime like it&apos;s ancient history, even though it&apos;s clear it&apos;s still eating him alive. His comrades think he&apos;s made peace with it - but Dave knows better. &quot;Yeah, I did that. Turns out &apos;sorry&apos; doesn&apos;t fix that kind of mistake.&quot; </personalityDescription>
