			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Allaire has no patience for hesitation. She faces overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop her. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. Allaire never acts without a plan. Every move she makes is part of a bigger picture, ensuring that by the time her opponents realize what&apos;s happening, she&apos;s already won. </personalityDescription>
