			<personalityDescription>Ghaaliba measures success in wealth and power, and she refuses to settle for anything less than everything. If there&apos;s something to gain, she&apos;ll take it - no matter the cost. Ghaaliba trusts instinct over orders, flow over formation. Her style is chaotic but effective, and somehow, it keeps working. &quot;Plans fall apart. Tactics get countered. You know what doesn&apos;t? Thinking faster than the other guy.&quot; </personalityDescription>
