			<personalityDescription>Takiyah doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow her down. Every decision, every action is a step toward her goal. While others waver or compromise, she stays locked onto her objective, no matter what it takes to get there. Takiyah doesn&apos;t just chase profits - she extracts them. She cuts costs, exploits loopholes, and squeezes every last drop out of a deal, no matter who gets shortchanged in the process. If there&apos;s money to be made, morality is just an inconvenience. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Laser-focused. Doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise - just advances.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts corners for profit. If youre in the way, youre the margin.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
