			<personalityDescription>Ellen doesn&apos;t believe in waiting for the right moment - they make the moment right. Their determination fuels everything they do, propelling them forward no matter the obstacles in their way. Ellen feels restless the second they&apos;re not in combat. Sitting still, relaxing - it just doesn&apos;t feel right. They move like they&apos;re waiting for something to go wrong, even when everything&apos;s fine. &quot;Off-duty? What does that even mean? Feels like a damn trap.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t wait for chances - builds them. Momentum is the fuel.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
