			<personalityDescription>Bob doesn&apos;t coddle - he drives people forward. His words are sharp, his expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around him survive. If he&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because he refuses to let them fail. Bob works to a tune, humming as he clears the rota, whistling while fixing manifest errors, occasionally breaking into full song when the numbers actually balance for once. No one&apos;s sure if he even realizes he&apos;s doing it, but at this point, his coworkers consider it part of the daily routine. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, expects more - pressure makes diamonds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
