			<personalityDescription>John doesn&apos;t waste time with indecision or second-guessing - he makes the call and expects others to keep up. John isn&apos;t rude, just efficient - after all, in the heat of battle, clear orders save lives. John has long since stopped caring about things that don&apos;t directly affect him. Wars rage, people scheme, and alliances crumble - but to him, it&apos;s all just noise. He does what&apos;s necessary and moves on without a second thought. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes fast calls. Efficient, not rude. Tactical clarity is priority.&lt;br&gt;- Sees war as noise. Filters everything but orders.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
