			<personalityDescription>Bill is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. His tactics shift constantly, his decisions keep enemies guessing, and his sheer momentum makes him nearly impossible to stop once he sets his sights on something. Bill doesn&apos;t let bullets, explosions, or chaos stop him from making sure people get pronouns right. He&apos;ll dodge incoming fire while effortlessly correcting someone mid-sentence. &quot;Yeah, yeah, cover me - also, &apos;they&apos; just took down two enemies, not &apos;she.&apos; Now move.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable, high-pressure operator - don&apos;t get in their way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
