			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Gliona doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, she&apos;ll do it her way - whether anyone asked for her help or not. In the middle of a skirmish, with missiles flying and alarms blaring, Gliona is still humming. She does it when charging, when bracing for impact, even while dodging incoming fire. Some say it helps her focus. Others think she&apos;s just a little too comfortable in the chaos. Either way, the tune never stops - until the shooting does. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects teamwork. If it&apos;s not done their way, it&apos;s wrong.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
