			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for doubt in Pamphile&apos;s world - they already knows they&apos;re right. They speaks with absolute authority, rarely bother to listen, and treats any criticism as a waste of their valuable time. Pamphile&apos;s words carry weight because they come from a place of honesty. They don&apos;t waste time with false flattery or empty promises - when they speak, people listen, because they know they mean it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t listen. Speaks like a prophet, ignores dissent like noise.&lt;br&gt;- When they talk, people listen.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
