			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Nachni&apos;s strengths. They speak before thinking, act before planning, and never apologize for either. If boldness is a virtue, then they consider themself a saint. Nachni&apos;s dreams are haunted by the faces of the dead - people they couldn&apos;t save, missions that went wrong, and things they&apos;ve done that they&apos;ll never be able to forget. They wake up gasping, clutching their weapon, unsure if they&apos;re still dreaming. &quot;Sleep is just another battlefield I need to survive.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
