			<personalityDescription>Andrew approaches every obstacle with the unshakable certainty that he can overcome it. He thrives in high-stakes moments, his excitement infectious as he drives himself and those around him forward with almost reckless enthusiasm. &quot;You really believe that alarm will go off when it&apos;s supposed to? That&apos;s... optimistic.&quot; Andrew treats every emergency system as already broken. If something hasn&apos;t failed yet, it&apos;s because it hasn&apos;t a chance to. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 38%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges in with full belief - infectious, but risky under fire.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
