			<personalityDescription>Christian has survived things that should have killed him - more than once. No matter how many times he gets knocked down, he just keeps getting back up, proving that sometimes, sheer refusal to die is a strategy all its own. Christian has seen too much, lost too much, to care anymore. The only thing that matters is getting the job done, and if that means making brutal decisions, so be it. In his world, kindness is just another word for weakness. </personalityDescription>
