			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Randy has no interest in. He keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in his world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Randy makes it seem like he&apos;s a team player, but everything he does is carefully crafted to benefit himself first. He&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for him, making sure that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the one standing on top. </personalityDescription>
