			<personalityDescription>Patrick&apos;s patience is as short as his temper is explosive. He doesn&apos;t wait, doesn&apos;t deliberate - he reacts, fast and forceful, often leaving those around him scrambling to keep up. Patrick always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear he thinks he&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, he has a way of making others feel small without ever raising his voice. </personalityDescription>
