			<personalityDescription>Kayley doesn&apos;t believe in overthinking - if an idea crosses her mind, it&apos;s already halfway to reality. Every decision is made in the moment, with no time wasted on doubt or second-guessing. Kayley doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects her to stick her neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns thought into action without delay. Second-guessing isn&apos;t in the vocabulary.&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one, helps no one, and always walks away richer.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
