			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Dymas, the kind that makes people listen when he speaks and follow when he leads. He doesn&apos;t need to prove himself - he already knows where he stands. Dymas approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. He doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. </personalityDescription>
