			<personalityDescription>Wealth, power, and influence mean little to Piyan if he can&apos;t use them to help those around him. He sees generosity as more than just kindness - it&apos;s a responsibility, one he takes seriously. Piyan&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in battle - it&apos;s in people. He connects with others effortlessly, making them feel heard, valued, and understood. Whether leading a unit or comforting a friend, his empathy draws others to him. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats generosity like duty - takes it as seriously as rank.&lt;br&gt;- Connects with the crew fast. Morale anchor.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
