			<personalityDescription>No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Benno tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. He refuses to play politics or pretend to be something he isn&apos;t, even if it makes him enemies. Benno doesn&apos;t just fight - he fights with style. Whether it&apos;s a dramatic duel, a well-timed flourish, or a perfectly executed maneuver, he makes battle look good. &quot;If you&apos;re going to fight,&quot; he grims, dodging incoming fire, &quot;you might as well make it memorable.&quot; </personalityDescription>
