			<personalityDescription>Iemitsu operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, they&apos;re playing it safe; the next, they&apos;re charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with them is a challenge - predicting them is impossible. Iemitsu dreams of things that should not exist - impossible shapes, unknowable sounds, and colors that don&apos;t belong in this universe. They talk about it like it&apos;s a joke, but there&apos;s a thin edge to their voice. &quot;Yeah, I dream in high definition now. Too bad it&apos;s always something that wants to kill me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
