			<personalityDescription>Susheela walks into every room like they own it and onto every battlefield like victory is already assured. Whether it&apos;s skill, luck, or sheer arrogance, Susheela makes it look easy - and they make sure everyone knows it. Susheela hates wide-open battlefields. They feel exposed, vulnerable, and too easy to target. If there&apos;s no cover, if there&apos;s too much empty space around them, their instincts start screaming. &quot;You want me to stand out in the open? What, you trying to get me killed?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enters every situation like it&apos;s already won. Walks the line between skill and arrogance.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
