			<performanceExamScore>62</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Subtlety? Restraint? Pablo&apos;s never heard of them. If one LRM is good, twenty are better. If a fight can be won cleanly, he&apos;ll still make sure it ends in a glorious fireball. Everything he does is bigger, louder, and more chaotic than it ever needed to be. Laughter and stories are his armor. Pablo keeps the energy high and the conversation flowing, but beneath the charm, there&apos;s a deep need to drown out the silence - the kind that brings back ghosts best left forgotten. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bigger, louder, messier - never clean, never subtle.&lt;br&gt;- Never short on stories - or on company.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
