			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Kadar never met a fight he didn&apos;t think he could win. Whether it&apos;s in combat, making bets, or mouthing off to the wrong people, Kadar jumps in without thinking - because, really, what&apos;s the worst that could happen? Kadar simply doesn&apos;t care. Duties, relationships, and even his own well-being are secondary to whatever he deems important at the moment. If something - or someone - falls apart because of his inattention, that&apos;s their problem, not his. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overestimates self. Picks fights, makes bets, mouths off. No fear - no filter.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t track gear, doesn&apos;t track people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
