			<personalityDescription>Ji-Hwan moves through life with absolute certainty, her presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When she speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Ji-Hwan doesn&apos;t need spotlights, titles, or recognition to lead. Her voice is calm, her directions are measured, and she ensures her team is always positioned for success. &quot;I don&apos;t need to be in front. I just need to be in control of the field.&quot; </personalityDescription>
