			<personalityDescription>For Dawud, there&apos;s always a next step, a bigger challenge, a greater prize to chase. No victory is ever enough - he&apos;s always looking beyond the horizon for the next opportunity to climb higher. With a quick joke and a warm smile, Dawud turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. He treats allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. </personalityDescription>
