			<personalityDescription>Florinda doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only what works. She lies, cheats, and betrays without hesitation, using people as stepping stones on her path to power. If someone trusted her, they&apos;ve already made their last mistake. Bullets fly, explosions shake the ground, and Florinda? Florinda&apos;s singing. &quot;Florinda, why the hell are you singing right now?&quot; someone shouts. &quot;Gotta keep morale up!&quot; she yells back - right before nailing a perfect headshot while still holding a tune. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 75%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty? Ethics? Dead weight. Uses people like tools.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
