			<personalityDescription>Rich isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - he simply doesn&apos;t think about them. He jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for him, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. Rich doesn&apos;t pretend to be something he&apos;s not. He speaks his mind, stays true to his beliefs, and refuses to put on a mask just to impress others. What you see is exactly what you get. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No thoughts of consequence. Laughs at disaster, races toward it.&lt;br&gt;- What you see is what you get - no polish, no bullshit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
