			<personalityDescription>When others falter, Hamilton is the rock they lean on. He doesn&apos;t just stand his ground - he inspires others to do the same, proving that true strength comes from never backing down, no matter how impossible the fight may seem. Hamilton remembers the battles that went wrong. The ones where no one planned for an enemy counterattack, where the extraction route collapsed, where people died because no one thought ahead. Now, he plans for everything. If he covers every angle, maybe he won&apos;t have to carve another name into the side of his helmet. </personalityDescription>
