			<personalityDescription>Jeff refuses to stand still, his mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. His adaptability keeps him one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. Jeff operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, he&apos;s playing it safe; the next, he&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with him is a challenge - predicting him is impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brains always five moves ahead - can&apos;t sit still.&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
