			<performanceExamScore>52</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Asavari doesn&apos;t just want - she takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, she ensures every advantage lands in her pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield check-in or a casual encounter in the barracks, Asavari never greets anyone normally. &quot;Ah-ha! My favorite sniper, still breathing, I see!&quot; &quot;BEHOLD, THE ACE MEKJOCK RETURNS FROM ANOTHER GLORIOUS VICTORY!&quot; Even in the middle of combat, she&apos;ll key her comm just to yell, &quot;GOOD MORNING, YOU MAGNIFICENT BASTARDS!&quot; It&apos;s impossible to ignore her - and, admittedly, hard to feel unappreciated. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes first, asks never. If it&apos;s not nailed down, it&apos;s already theirs.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
