			<personalityDescription>Harold never met a fight they didn&apos;t think they could win. Whether it&apos;s in combat, making bets, or mouthing off to the wrong people, Harold jumps in without thinking - because, really, what&apos;s the worst that could happen? Harold always seems to be up to something. They disappear without explanation, answer questions with vague half-smiles, and always seem to know more than they should. &quot;Relax. If I were planning something shady, you wouldn&apos;t know until it was too late.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 37%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overestimates self. Picks fights, makes bets, mouths off. No fear - no filter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
