			<personalityDescription>Alma&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as her ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, she indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. Alma doesn&apos;t just lead - she elevates those around her. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, she makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
