			<personalityDescription>Lyudmil weighs every decision carefully, considering all angles before taking action. He values logic over impulse, ensuring that every move he makes is well-thought-out and serves a greater purpose. Lyudmil has seen how large-scale strategies sacrifice the people actually fighting. He&apos;s seen plans drawn up by those who never have to bleed for them. He trusts what&apos;s real, what he can see, what he can control. Because he knows that when things go wrong, it&apos;s not the planners who suffer - it&apos;s the ones actually in the fight. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never rushes - everything&apos;s weighed, measured, executed clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
