			<personalityDescription>Barbra feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around her. It weighs on her, but she refuses to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. Barbra knows the situation is serious, but that doesn&apos;t mean she can&apos;t have a little fun. Whether it&apos;s teasing an ally or shamelessly charming the enemy, she keeps things light. &quot;Is your targeting is getting better, or are you just trying to show me a good time?&quot; </personalityDescription>
