			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for debate when Ramón is around. He dictates the course of action with absolute certainty, expecting others to fall in line without question - because, in his mind, there&apos;s no alternative. Ramón&apos;s greatest skill isn&apos;t combat or strategy - it&apos;s deception. Every deal, every handshake, every carefully crafted story is just another step in keeping up the illusion of who he wants people to believe he is. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 30%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No tolerance for disagreement. Only one path forward: theirs.&lt;br&gt;- Not a fighter, not a planner - just a damn good liar.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
