			<personalityDescription>No task is too small, no detail too minor for Don to overlook. He works tirelessly, knowing that success isn&apos;t about talent alone - it&apos;s about dedication, preparation, and an unwillingness to settle for mediocrity. Don makes it all look easy. Whether it&apos;s navigating a battlefield, negotiating a deal, or fixing a &apos;Mek with limited resources, he handles it with skill, confidence, and just the right amount of flair. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Obsesses over the details. Leaves nothing unchecked or unpolished.&lt;br&gt;- Gets it done with style - makes others look clumsy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
