			<personalityDescription>José carries a permanent chip on their shoulder, always ready to turn a disagreement into a full-blown confrontation. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s words or fists - what matters is proving they won. José plays the long game, outmaneuvering competitors before they even realize there&apos;s a game being played. They make alliances when they serve their goals, break them when they don&apos;t, and never loses sight of the bigger picture - their rise to the top. </personalityDescription>
