			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Hyun-Sil carves a path forward with unwavering determination. She doesn&apos;t ask for permission and doesn&apos;t wait for approval - Hyun-Sil acts, and others either follow or get left behind. Hyun-Sil doesn&apos;t do favors, fight for causes, or make sacrifices for free. If someone needs her skills, they&apos;d better be ready to pay up, because when the money stops, so does her interest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts without asking. Leads by momentum. Others fall in line or fall behind.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t move unless the C-Bills do. Motivation ends where the payment does.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
