			<personalityDescription>Some people make friends. Adrienne makes enemies - and seems to prefer it that way. Whether through biting sarcasm or outright aggression, she turns every interaction into a fight waiting to happen, and frankly, Adrienne wouldn&apos;t have it any other way. Wealth, power, and influence mean little to Adrienne if she can&apos;t use them to help those around her. She sees generosity as more than just kindness - it&apos;s a responsibility, one she takes seriously. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes enemies on purpose. Finds comfort in conflict, not camaraderie.&lt;br&gt;- Treats generosity like duty - takes it as seriously as rank.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
