			<personalityDescription>Waku doesn&apos;t just react to situations - they create them. They manipulate events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering their way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing their game all along. Waku&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. They adapt on the fly, find solutions where others see dead ends, and always seem to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in their favor. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pulls strings from the dark. Never in the spotlight, always in control.&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into leverage without blinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
