			<personalityDescription>Teamwork is just a means to an end for John. He&apos;ll play along as long as it benefits him, but the moment there&apos;s something to gain, he won&apos;t hesitate to take more than his fair share. John doesn&apos;t hesitate to help because no one should have to wait for medical care, not if he can do something about it. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s his job or not, if he has to be the one to keep people patched up, then so be it. </personalityDescription>
