			<personalityDescription>Ahana&apos;s hunger for success, power, and experience is bottomless. She consumes challenges, pushes boundaries, and refuses to settle for anything less than total domination - because anything less would be a waste. Ahana doesn&apos;t just look down on others - she barely acknowledges them. She sees most people as incompetent, useless, or beneath her, and she makes no effort to hide her disdain. If someone disagrees with her, she assumes they&apos;re simply too stupid to understand. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes everything. Leaves nothing.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t debate - dismisses. Everyone else? Background noise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
