			<personalityDescription>Faruk refuses to accept anything less than perfection. He puts in the time, the effort, and the relentless focus needed to ensure that when the moment comes, he&apos;s ready for anything. Faruk doesn&apos;t just lead - he inspires. Whether through quiet words of reassurance or a rallying cry before battle, he fuels those around him with the drive to keep moving, keep fighting, and keep believing in victory. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Demands excellence. Prepares until theres no room for error.&lt;br&gt;- Not just a leader - makes people want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
