			<personalityDescription>No task is too small, no detail too minor for Tapani to overlook. She works tirelessly, knowing that success isn&apos;t about talent alone - it&apos;s about dedication, preparation, and an unwillingness to settle for mediocrity. Tapani doesn&apos;t just admire old weapons - she sees them as a relic of a different kind of war. Battles with clear fronts, clear enemies, clear objectives. Now? Now, war never ends, and technology only makes it colder, more distant. Maybe, just maybe, the warriors of old understood something they&apos;ve all forgotten. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Obsesses over the details. Leaves nothing unchecked or unpolished.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
