			<personalityDescription>Minh doesn&apos;t believe in limits. Whether it&apos;s effort, firepower, or sheer presence, he always pushes past what&apos;s necessary, turning every task into something grander, louder, and more overwhelming than it has to be. By the time others are starting their first briefing, Minh has already run a full systems check, a workout, and possibly a simulated battle. &quot;I&apos;ve been productive for hours,&quot; he grims, as someone else mumbles, &quot;It&apos;s literally 05:00.&quot; </personalityDescription>
