			<personalityDescription>Every word Sarai speaks is calculated. They twist the truth, play people against each other, and makepretends to care just enough to gain trust before using it to their advantage. If someone thinks they&apos;re being sincere, they&apos;re already their next victim. Sarai is a solid fighter, but damn if they don&apos;t always forget something before a mission. Harness? Left it in the barracks. Comms check? Oops. Forgot to eat before deployment? Absolutely. Their squad has learned to double-check their gear along with their own because, sooner or later, Sarai is going to pat themself down and go, &quot;Wait... where&apos;s my sidearm?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 62%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like cards - gets close, gains trust, exploits it fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
