			<personalityDescription>Jaidyn has an instinct for reading between the lines. Whether it&apos;s a battlefield, a business deal, or a negotiation, she sees angles others miss and exploits them before anyone realizes what&apos;s happening. Jaidyn doesn&apos;t trust victories. She&apos;s seen how overconfidence gets people killed, how one unchecked mistake can doom an entire squad. So she criticizes everything, no matter how small. Because if people stop improving, they stop surviving. </personalityDescription>
