			<personalityDescription>Ila doesn&apos;t keep score - she gives freely, whether it&apos;s supplies, favors, or hard-earned wisdom. She believes that lifting others up strengthens everyone, and she never hesitates to share what she has. Ila knows how this goes. She&apos;s watched squads get wiped out, seen friends disappear from the comms, been the only one left in the aftermath. So she doesn&apos;t expect anyone to have her back. She doesn&apos;t wait for reinforcements. She fights like she&apos;s already alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t ask for anything back - gives like it&apos;s strategy, not charity.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
