			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>To Juan, every situation holds potential - he just has to find it. Whether it&apos;s flipping a crisis into an advantage or turning an enemy&apos;s mistake into his gain, he never lets an opening go to waste. Juan doesn&apos;t just fire his weapon - he tracks every single shot. &quot;Nine left. Two more reloads. Twenty-three hostiles still moving.&quot; His squad doesn&apos;t always appreciate the running tally, but when ammo runs low, Juan&apos;s the only one who actually knows how much is left. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats crisis as currency. Turns every shift into personal gain.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
