			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Roger sees strength not just in leading but in empowering others. He pushes people to be their best, celebrates their victories, and makes sure they know that, no matter how hard things get, they have someone in their corner. &quot;You ever hear about the warrior who took down a &apos;Mek bare-handed?&quot; Roger asks, grinning. &quot;No? Well, let me tell you...&quot; He exaggerates just enough to keep things entertaining - but never enough to be sure he&apos;s lying. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes others forward, never needs the spotlight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
