			<personalityDescription>To Arjan, war is not just necessary - it is a craving, an addiction that only destruction can satisfy. They take no prisoners, showing no mercy, and relishes the moment an enemy&apos;s &apos;Mek crumples under their relentless assault. Arjan doesn&apos;t just move - they propel themself forward with unstoppable energy. They thrive in fast-paced environments, where quick thinking and decisive action separate the victors from the forgotten. </personalityDescription>
