			<personalityDescription>Thuy measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To him, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw he has no intention of indulging. Thuy doesn&apos;t just see the game being played - he plays it better than everyone else. He spots weaknesses, exploits blind spots, and reads people like open books. By the time others realize they&apos;ve been outmaneuvered, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
