			<personalityDescription>Tristan&apos;s energy is contagious. He has a way of making even the worst situations seem manageable, keeping morale high with a well-timed joke, an inspiring speech, or a simple &quot;You&apos;ve got this.&quot; Tristan always eats, even when no one else can stomach it. He chews as he sighs off another casualty report. He nibbles on dried meat as he calculates supply losses. Because if he keeps eating, keeps living like normal, then maybe - just maybe-things aren&apos;t as bad as they look. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Good for keeping heads up when things go south.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
