			<personalityDescription>Jasa can sell a rusted-out &apos;Mek for triple its value and walk away smiling. He spins stories, plays up his credentials, and always has an answer ready when someone starts asking too many questions. By the time people realize they&apos;ve been had, he&apos;s long gone. Jasa sees no reason to dance around the truth. Whether it&apos;s giving orders, delivering bad news, or calling someone out on their mistakes, he doesn&apos;t soften the blow - because in his mind, reality doesn&apos;t come with padding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Could sell ice to polar troops and vanish before the melt.&lt;br&gt;- Truth hits hard. So do they. Doesnt apologize for either.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
