			<personalityDescription>Tyrone doesn&apos;t measure risk the way others do. Where they see danger, he sees duty; where others hesitate, he moves forward. Not because he doesn&apos;t feel fear, but because he refuses to let it define him. Tyrone believes he&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against him, he refuses to stop striving for the future he knows he can reach. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees duty, not danger. Fear present - but doesn&apos;t get a say.&lt;br&gt;- Believes they&apos;re destined for more. Each battle is a stepping stone.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
