			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a quiet, unshakable certainty to Fang-Hua, the kind that makes people listen when she speaks and follow when she leads. She doesn&apos;t need to prove herself - she already knows where she stands. For Fang-Hua, every challenge is simply an opportunity to prove just how infallible she is. She dismisses advice and warnings with a smirk, trusting that her skills and luck will always carry her through, no matter the risk. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t posture - just leads. Speaks, and others follow without question.&lt;br&gt;- Sees every warning as noise. Trusts skill to bail them out - always.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
