			<personalityDescription>Richard doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if he&apos;s daring the world to give him a reason to lash out. Richard&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. He tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that his loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. </personalityDescription>
