			<personalityDescription>Fouzia doesn&apos;t just want - she takes. Whether it&apos;s battlefield salvage, a lucrative contract, or an under-the-table bribe, she ensures every advantage lands in her pocket, leaving nothing for those too slow to seize it first. Fouzia&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. She tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that her loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes first, asks never. If it&apos;s not nailed down, it&apos;s already theirs.&lt;br&gt;- Makes you feel seen - until you realize you were just a mark.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
