			<personalityDescription>Fergus operates with a singular, unyielding drive. Whether it&apos;s perfecting his skills or executing a plan, he devotes himself completely, unwilling to let anything stand in his way. Fergus&apos;s indifference isn&apos;t an act - it&apos;s survival. He&apos;s seen too much, lost too much, and learned that the only way to endure is to stop feeling altogether. The universe burns, but he stopped worrying about the flames a long time ago. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pours everything into one task at a time. Refuses to be diverted.&lt;br&gt;- Hollow eyes. Doesnt hate you - just can&apos;t be bothered to.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
