			<personalityDescription>Terri treats every situation as an investment - whether in power, wealth, or influence. She instinctively spots angles others miss, turning setbacks into stepping stones and competition into leverage. &quot;Request approved. &apos;walk softly and carry a big gun.&apos;&quot; Every document Terri signs comes with an extra line of borrowed wisdom. No one&apos;s sure why she does it, but it&apos;s hard to be mad when a report arrives exactly as promised, with just the right words attached. </personalityDescription>
