			<personalityDescription>Valdemar&apos;s patience is as short as his temper is explosive. He doesn&apos;t wait, doesn&apos;t deliberate - he reacts, fast and forceful, often leaving those around him scrambling to keep up. Valdemar doesn&apos;t take chances. He&apos;s seen enemies get back up when people thought they were dead. He&apos;s watched someone turn away too soon, only to be caught off guard. He fights up close because when he ends something, he makes sure it stays ended. </personalityDescription>
