			<personalityDescription>Kaspar faces the unknown with fearless determination, always pushing forward where others hesitate. Whether it&apos;s uncharted space or a battlefield stacked against him, he refuses to back down from a challenge. Kaspar carries himself like a living legend, utterly convinced of his own greatness. Whether he deserves the reputation doesn&apos;t matter - he believes it, and that&apos;s enough for him. </personalityDescription>
