			<personalityDescription>Danh never truly relaxes - his mind is always scanning, always assessing. Every situation is a puzzle, every interaction a potential threat, and he refuses to be caught  off guard. Danh dreams of things that should not exist - impossible shapes, unknowable sounds, and colors that don&apos;t belong in this universe. He talks about it like it&apos;s a joke, but there&apos;s a thin edge to his voice. &quot;Yeah, I dream in high definition now. Too bad it&apos;s always something that wants to kill me.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t shut it off. Scans every room, every face - threats in all directions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
