			<personalityDescription>Sohvi doesn&apos;t just think she&apos;s invincible - she acts like it. She takes unnecessary risks, dismisses warnings, and underestimates opponents, convinced that sheer skill (or luck) will always pull her through. One day, it won&apos;t. Sohvi&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. She tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that her loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ignores danger, overestimates skill. One day, luck will run out.&lt;br&gt;- Makes you feel seen - until you realize you were just a mark.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
