			<personalityDescription>Rebeca always looks out for number one. If a situation doesn&apos;t benefit her directly, she&apos;s not interested. She&apos;ll work with others when it suits her, but the moment it stops being profitable, she&apos;s already moving on. Rebeca can&apos;t go five minutes without bringing up legendary duels. &quot;Yeah, yeah, battlefield tactics are fine, but have you see Molotov vs. Indigo? That was real combat.&quot; She knows every famous match, every underdog story, every historic upset and talk about them incessantly. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Helps when it helps them - otherwise, not their problem.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
