			<reasoning>13</reasoning>
			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Some people seek compromise - Alain seeks conflict. He thrives on tension, turning every conversation into a challenge and every challenge into a personal battle. If there&apos;s a peaceful solution, he&apos;s not interested. Alain remembers the battles that went wrong. The ones where no one planned for an enemy counterattack, where the extraction route collapsed, where people died because no one thought ahead. Now, he plans for everything. If he covers every angle, maybe he won&apos;t have to carve another name into the side of his helmet. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects compromise. Every discussion a duel waiting to happen.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
