			<personalityDescription>Kristiina doesn&apos;t waste time on altruism - every deal, every alliance, every action is about securing their own advantage. If helping someone else happens to benefit them too, all the better - but if it doesn&apos;t, they won&apos;t waste a second thought on them. Kristiina doesn&apos;t put faith in big-picture strategies. They focus on where they are, who they&apos;re with, and what&apos;s in front of them. They&apos;re more interested in terrain, cover, movement - things that actually decide a battle. &quot;Grand strategies are great until someone&apos;s got a knife at your throat.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t lift a finger unless it pays out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
