			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Raden doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - they believe in winning. They bend, break, and rewrite the rules to suit their needs, making sure that when the dust settles, they&apos;re the only one left standing. Raden doesn&apos;t waste a single calorie. Every meal is planned, every extra bite stored for later. While others celebrate after a mission with a feast, Raden quietly pockets leftovers. &quot;Might need it later,&quot; they mutter. Their squad jokes about it - until they&apos;re starving behind enemy lines and they&apos;re the only one still eating. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Victory at all costs. Leaves scorched earth behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
