			<personalityDescription>Wolfgang never truly relaxes - his mind is always scanning, always assessing. Every situation is a puzzle, every interaction a potential threat, and he refuses to be caught  off guard. Wolfgang doesn&apos;t know the meaning of the word quit. No matter how many times he&apos;s knocked down, outmaneuvered, or told something is impossible, he keeps pushing forward until he gets the result he wants. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t shut it off. Scans every room, every face - threats in all directions.&lt;br&gt;- Knocked down? Gets back up. Refuses to quit - ever.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
