			<personalityDescription>Kent faces the unknown with fearless determination, always pushing forward where others hesitate. Whether it&apos;s uncharted space or a battlefield stacked against him, he refuses to back down from a challenge. Kent doesn&apos;t just lead - he elevates those around him. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, he makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes into the unknown. Fearless in the face of risk. Refuses retreat.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt bark orders - just makes you want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
