			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Birthe&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, she keeps a running tally of offenses and finds creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. Birthe either forgets to eat for days or devours everything in sight, like she&apos;s afraid there won&apos;t be another meal. She doesn&apos;t talk about it, but those who know her well suspect she&apos;s been through famine, blockade, or a siege. She never wastes food. She never complains about rations. Because she remembers when there wasn&apos;t anything to eat at all. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Still mad about coffee from two deployments ago.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
