			<personalityDescription>Jacob doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, they&apos;ll do it their way - whether anyone asked for their help or not. Jacob has a knack for turning every situation into a payday. Whether it&apos;s salvage rights, lucrative contracts, or well-placed investments, they always find a way to make sure their time and effort result in cold, hard cash. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects teamwork. If it&apos;s not done their way, it&apos;s wrong.&lt;br&gt;- Always walks away with more than they came in with. Smiles while others scrape.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
