			<personalityDescription>Bill refuses to accept anything less than perfection. He puts in the time, the effort, and the relentless focus needed to ensure that when the moment comes, he&apos;s ready for anything. Bill doesn&apos;t just stand beside his allies - he lifts them up. Whether it&apos;s covering for a mistake, offering quiet reassurance, or taking the weight off someone&apos;s shoulders, he ensures that no one fights alone. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Demands excellence. Prepares until theres no room for error.&lt;br&gt;- Covers your six without being asked. Carries more than their weight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
