			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no middle ground with Ester - everything is turned up to eleven. She doesn&apos;t just prepare; she over-prepares. She doesn&apos;t just act; she goes all out. If there&apos;s a way to dial it back, she hasn&apos;t found it yet. Once Ester gets an idea in her head, nothing will get her to drop it. If she&apos;s convinced a flanking maneuver is the best strategy, she&apos;ll argue about it until deployment. If she thinks a certain loadout is ideal, she&apos;ll lecture anyone who&apos;ll listen. Sometimes it&apos;s annoying - but sometimes, she&apos;s right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cranks every dial to max. No balance, no brakes.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
