			<performanceExamScore>48</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for pleasantries in Klaudia&apos;s world. She delivers the hard truths, whether people can handle them or not, cutting through delusion with words as sharp as a blade. If someone&apos;s weak, incompetent, or making a mistake, she makes sure they know it. Klaudia has seen blood spill in ways no one should, has watched it drain from bodies, watched people cough it up, watched it soak into the ground like a stain that never washes away. She&apos;s lost too many people, and now the sight of it makes her stomach twist. &quot;It&apos;s not fear. It&apos;s knowing exactly what happens next.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through bullshit like a vibroblade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
