			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, even death - none of it matters. Anthony will see his mission through to the bitter end, no matter the cost. Stubbornness and sheer willpower keep him standing long after others have fallen. Anthony enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, he sees no reason to deny himself what he desires. </personalityDescription>
