			<personalityDescription>Michelle doesn&apos;t believe in fair play - they believe in winning. They bend, break, and rewrite the rules to suit their needs, making sure that when the dust settles, they&apos;re the only one left standing. Michelle has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply their presence, they remind people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
