			<personalityDescription>Kenny doesn&apos;t care about honor, mercy, or sentiment - only results. He dissects every situation with ruthless precision, seeing people as assets, obstacles, or liabilities. If a sacrifice needs to be made, he won&apos;t hesitate to pull the trigger. Nothing satisfies Kenny for long. He hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand his fortune - no matter the cost to those around him. </personalityDescription>
