			<personalityDescription>Konstancji&apos;s excitement is contagious. He approaches every challenge with boundless energy, hyping up his team and keeping morale high. Even when the odds look bad, he&apos;s the first to grin and say, &quot;Let&apos;s do this.&quot; &quot;Check your seals. Check your ammo. Check everything twice,&quot; Konstancji reminds his team every deployment. He isn&apos;t paranoid - he&apos;s survived enough bad situations to know that being unprepared is just another way of asking to die. </personalityDescription>
