			<personalityDescription>Zenos treats every challenge like a war of attrition - he doesn&apos;t have to be the fastest or the strongest, just the one still standing at the end. And he always is. Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Zenos - it&apos;s an obsession. He sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in his relentless pursuit of fortune. </personalityDescription>
