			<personalityDescription>Yee has big dreams and no intention of staying in the background. Whether it&apos;s becoming a legendary warrior, a feared commander, or a name spoken with respect across the Inner Sphere, he&apos;s always pushing himself toward something greater. Yee has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. He lies, cheats, and takes whatever he pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In his mind, the only crime is getting caught. </personalityDescription>
