			<personalityDescription>Armanoush refuses to waver, no matter the odds. Once she sets a goal, she sees it through with unshakable determination, standing firm even when everything around her is falling apart. Armanoush doesn&apos;t see retreat as cowardice - she sees it as strategy. If a fight isn&apos;t worth it, if there&apos;s a smarter way out, she&apos;ll take it. &quot;Survival isn&apos;t about winning every fight. It&apos;s about knowing which ones to walk away from.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unshakable once committed. Holds the line even as the world collapses.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
