			<personalityDescription>Khyati doesn&apos;t just move - she propels herself forward with unstoppable energy. She thrives in fast-paced environments, where quick thinking and decisive action separate the victors from the forgotten. Most people aren&apos;t worth Khyati&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how she sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath her notice, she brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
