			<personalityDescription>Haiba doesn&apos;t wait for things to happen - she makes them happen. Whether it&apos;s seizing the initiative in battle, fixing a problem before it escalates, or taking charge when others hesitate, she&apos;s always one step ahead. Haiba moves through life with an uncanny sense of knowing exactly what to do. Whether in the heat of battle or a tense negotiation, she reads the moment, trusts her gut, and makes the right call before anyone else sees the play. </personalityDescription>
