			<personalityDescription>Ysabel doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, she&apos;ll do it her way - whether anyone asked for her help or not. No matter how ruthless the world gets, Ysabel refuses to compromise her integrity. She sticks to her word, treats people with genuine respect, and never says something just for the sake of appearances. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 69%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Rejects teamwork. If it&apos;s not done their way, it&apos;s wrong.&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t sell you lies - not even to make it easier.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
