			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Anama carves a path forward with unwavering determination. He doesn&apos;t ask for permission and doesn&apos;t wait for approval - Anama acts, and others either follow or get left behind. &quot;Anama, how are you eating right now?&quot; someone shouts as bullets whiz overhead. &quot;Gotta keep my energy up,&quot; he replies, taking another bite of something that definitely shouldn&apos;t have survived this long in a combat zone. No one understands how he does it - but he never runs out. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts without asking. Leads by momentum. Others fall in line or fall behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
