			<personalityDescription>Caitlin doesn&apos;t just keep up - she stays ahead. She spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. Caitlin says what she means and means what she says. She doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - her words and actions come from a place of honesty, making her a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
