			<personalityDescription>Once Paula commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake her resolve once she&apos;s made up her mind. Paula isn&apos;t just quick - she&apos;s calculated. She anticipates problems before they arise and maneuvers people and situations to her advantage. By the time others react, she&apos;s already executing her next move. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Discussion ends at commitment. Mind closed, door locked.&lt;br&gt;- Anticipates, then executes. Already in motion while others are thinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
