			<personalityDescription>Patience and restraint have never been Cheri&apos;s strengths. She acts first, thinks later, and rarely regrets it - because in her mind, slowing down is just another way of losing. Cheri doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow her down. Every decision, every action is a step toward her goal. While others waver or compromise, she stays locked onto her objective, no matter what it takes to get there. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts fast, rarely looks back. Believes slowing down equals failure.&lt;br&gt;- Laser-focused. Doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise - just advances.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
