			<personalityDescription>Marielle sees adaptability as another word for indecision. Once they commit to a course of action, there&apos;s no turning back - no matter how much the situation changes around them. To Marielle, restraint is a foreign concept. They surround themself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy their endless cravings - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
