			<personalityDescription>Once, Olivia might have wanted more, but now? She&apos;s seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Olivia has long since stopped caring. Olivia has a talent for convincing others to do the hard work while she reaps the rewards. She plays on emotions, dangles promises just out of reach, and always manages to walk away with more than she put in. If someone ends up shortchanged, that&apos;s their problem. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Burned out or just gave up - either way, not climbing.&lt;br&gt;- Lets others do the work, then pockets the rewards with a smile.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
