			<personalityDescription>Distractions are for other people - Luis doesn&apos;t indulge them. He keeps his attention locked onto the task at hand, tuning out anything that doesn&apos;t push him closer to success. Nothing Luis does is without calculation. He manipulates trust, extracts favors, and keeps people close just long enough to drain them of their usefulness before moving on to the next opportunity. </personalityDescription>
