			<personalityDescription>The more dangerous the path, the more certain Sven is that it&apos;s the right one. They move forward without fear, seeing every unknown as a puzzle to solve, a victory to claim, or a story to tell later. Every move Sven makes is deliberate. They calculate risks, anticipate outcomes, and manipulate situations with ease, ensuring that no matter what happens, they&apos;re always in control. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- The harder the path, the more they want it. Danger is proof they&apos;re on track.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t roll the dice - loads them first.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
