			<personalityDescription>Distractions are for other people - Prabhu doesn&apos;t indulge them. He keeps his attention locked onto the task at hand, tuning out anything that doesn&apos;t push him closer to success. Prabhu won&apos;t just take any weapon, &apos;Mek, or gear - he has preferences, and he sticks to them religiously. If something isn&apos;t precisely the way he likes it, he won&apos;t touch it. &quot;No. That&apos;s wrong. Too heavy, wrong grip, balance is off. Get me the right one. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Tunes out distractions completely. Sees only the path forward.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
