			<personalityDescription>Tharia knows exactly how to push people to their limits - not for their benefit, but for their own. They pull strings, applies pressure, and always ensure that the cost of their success is paid by someone else. Tharia has lost people, places, and parts of themself to war, but their personal emblem remains. It&apos;s the one thing they can still control. If that symbol is still standing, then so are they. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, but never pulls weight - others carry the burden.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
