			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Trifiliy is always watching, always analyzing, never letting their guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, they stay one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. Trifiliy can&apos;t resist a puzzle. &quot;Trifiliy, we need those power cells moved.&quot; &quot;Sure thing - oh, but look at this encryption key, someone tried to hide something here...&quot; Their coworkers have learned to either give them puzzles on purpose or rip them out of their hands before they get lost in them. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always alert. Never caught off guard. Reacts before threats materialize.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
