			<personalityDescription>Habika doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make her walk away from something she&apos;s committed to. Habika has a sharp mind and a keen eye for details. She quickly picks up on patterns, sees through deception, and understands situations faster than most, making her a formidable strategist both on and off the battlefield. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees setbacks as challenges, not endings. Keeps advancing.&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through noise - grabs the signal before anyone else hears it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
