			<personalityDescription>Alastair never met a fight he didn&apos;t think he could win. Whether it&apos;s in combat, making bets, or mouthing off to the wrong people, Alastair jumps in without thinking - because, really, what&apos;s the worst that could happen? Alastair has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply his presence, he reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overestimates self. Picks fights, makes bets, mouths off. No fear - no filter.&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
