			<personalityDescription>Elaine never second-guesses herself - why would she, when she&apos;s always right? Every word, every step; every decision is made with the certainty of someone who expects the universe to bend to her will. Elaine speaks in the same steady, flat tone whether she&apos;s giving orders, dodging fire, or watching a disaster unfold. She operates like a machine, precise and deliberate, even as everything around her burns. &quot;We handle it. That&apos;s all. Doesn&apos;t matter how bad it looks.&quot; </personalityDescription>
