			<personalityDescription>Patience is just wasted time in Jack&apos;s eyes. They meet every challenge head-on, cutting through hesitation with sheer force of will. The only direction that matters is forward, and anything in their way is just another problem to crush. No sugarcoating, no empty promises - Jack tells it like it is, whether people want to hear it or not. They refuse to play politics or pretend to be something they aren&apos;t, even if it makes them enemies. </personalityDescription>
