			<personalityDescription>Tai-Sun feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around her. It weighs on her, but she refuses to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. Tai-Sun doesn&apos;t just study ancient firearms - she talks about them constantly. No matter the topic, she finds a way to bring up old-world guns. &quot;Oh, supply logistics? You know, back in the 21st century...&quot; </personalityDescription>
