			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fire in Amélia&apos;s eyes that never dims, a relentless drive that refuses to acknowledge limits. Whether facing a challenge or simply making her presence known, she moves through life like she&apos;s already won. Amélia has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to her side. Whether she&apos;s negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking her way out of trouble, her confidence and charm make it hard to say no. </personalityDescription>
