			<personalityDescription>When the moment demands action, Waseme doesn&apos;t hesitate. She thrives in high-pressure situations, cutting through doubt and disorder with a clear, unwavering sense of purpose. Waseme doesn&apos;t just reach for power - she grabs for it, no matter the cost. Her ambition drives her to overextend, making enemies and burning bridges as she chases goals that always seem just out of reach. One day, she&apos;ll push too far, and there&apos;ll be no coming back. </personalityDescription>
