			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>António puts on a friendly face, but it&apos;s a survival tactic as much as anything. He knows being likable keeps people from turning on him, but deep down, he&apos;s always waiting for the moment when trust becomes a liability. António never lets a situation stay too serious. &quot;If we die, I just want you all to know - I left my laundry on.&quot; His squad doesn&apos;t always appreciate the timing, but sometimes, the right joke at the right time is just enough to break the tension. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows every name, every story. Makes people feel like they matter.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
