			<performanceExamScore>50</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>While others argue and analyze, Luaipou is already in motion. He doesn&apos;t need endless deliberation to see the best path forward - Luaipou weighs the options, picks a course, and executes it with ruthless efficiency. Luaipou&apos;s habit of collecting callsigns isn&apos;t just trivia - it&apos;s a survival tactic. He knows who&apos;s on the other side of the radio before they say a word. &quot;That&apos;s Razor on comms. If he&apos;s talking, it&apos;s already bad.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cuts through debate. Acts while others plan. Cold efficiency.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
