			<personalityDescription>Derenik lives by one rule: act now, figure out the details later. He barrels through obstacles with sheer confidence, trusting that if things go wrong, he&apos;ll deal with it when he gets there - assuming he even cares. Derenik&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. He adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in his favor. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges through obstacles. Plans on-the-fly, if at all. May improvise into disaster.&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into leverage without blinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
