			<personalityDescription>Amando&apos;s greatest strength isn&apos;t just their skill, but their ability to think. They sift through information, discard the irrelevant, and act with precision, ensuring that when they move, it&apos;s with absolute certainty. Amando talks big because if they don&apos;t, something else will break first. They boast, they laugh, they grim like they&apos;re invincible - because if they stop, if they admit how bad things really are, the weight of it all might finally crush them. </personalityDescription>
