			<personalityDescription>Gicheru knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll take the best deal for himself. He&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, he&apos;ll make sure he walks away with the biggest share. Gicheru doesn&apos;t just move - he propels himself forward with unstoppable energy. He thrives in fast-paced environments, where quick thinking and decisive action separate the victors from the forgotten. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;br&gt;- Built for chaos - turns speed into a weapon.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
