			<personalityDescription>Trust is a liability, and Min-zhong trusts no one. He watches every angle, anticipating betrayal, ambushes, and unseen threats. Whether it&apos;s paranoia or wisdom, his constant vigilance has kept him alive this long. Min-zhong says what he means and means what he says. He doesn&apos;t believe in playing games or sugarcoating the truth - his words and actions come from a place of honesty, making him a rare presence in a world full of deception. </personalityDescription>
