			<personalityDescription>Dorothy doesn&apos;t just give - she gives big. Whether it&apos;s picking up the tab, upgrading a friend&apos;s &apos;Mek, or spreading wealth where it&apos;s needed, she believes that success means nothing if you can&apos;t share it. &quot;Check your seals. Check your ammo. Check everything twice,&quot; Dorothy reminds her team every deployment. She isn&apos;t paranoid - she&apos;s survived enough bad situations to know that being unprepared is just another way of asking to die. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Generosity&apos;s big, loud, and hard to miss - keeps spreading the wealth like it&apos;ll never run out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
