			<personalityDescription>To Priita, true strength lies in restraint. They stand firm in their belief that there&apos;s always another way, no matter how much the galaxy tries to prove them wrong. Priita doesn&apos;t get distracted, doesn&apos;t let setbacks slow them down. Every decision, every action is a step toward their goal. While others waver or compromise, they stay locked onto their objective, no matter what it takes to get there. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Believes restraint is strength. Refuses to be changed by brutality.&lt;br&gt;- Laser-focused. Doesn&apos;t waver, doesn&apos;t compromise - just advances.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
