			<performanceExamScore>55</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Saleh understands that no one has all the answers - not even him. He remains open to ideas, quick to learn from mistakes, and always willing to adapt when a better path presents itself. Saleh knows the war doesn&apos;t guarantee survival. But his decals? They might last longer than he does. Maybe someone will see them one day, wonder who he was, what he fought for. Maybe that&apos;s enough. Maybe that&apos;s all anyone can really hope for. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows when to pivot. No shame in growth.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
