			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a bad idea, Phinam will be the first to try it. She hates waiting, hates planning, and definitely hates being told to slow down - because she always believes the best way forward is straight through the enemy. Phinam never lets things go, but she doesn&apos;t always act on it directly. Instead, she makes snide comments, &quot;forgets&quot; to relay important information, and subtly undermines people in ways that are just deniable enough to avoid confrontation. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- First to try the worst idea. Hates waiting, planning, and orders.&lt;br&gt;- Undermines with a smile - dangerous.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
