			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Irfan is already halfway through it. He thrives on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Irfan doesn&apos;t coddle - he drives people forward. His words are sharp, his expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around him survive. If he&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because he refuses to let them fail. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Risks draw them in. Sees combat as challenge, not threat.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes hard, expects more - pressure makes diamonds.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
