			<personalityDescription>Nathan doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if they&apos;re daring the world to give them a reason to lash out. Nathan doesn&apos;t just fight - they calculate. Every shot, every movement, every approach is based on angles, arcs, and positioning. &quot;You don&apos;t just fire - you predict. You don&apos;t just move - you control the space.&quot; </personalityDescription>
