			<personalityDescription>Kristina sees opportunities where others see obstacles. Whether it&apos;s a business venture, a battlefield maneuver, or a political play, she&apos;s always looking for ways to turn a situation into an advantage. No one knows when Kristina does it, but somehow, there&apos;s always a small paper crane, fox, or star waiting near her bunk, inside DropShips maintenance panels, or tucked into the ammo crates. &quot;Figure if we&apos;re always breaking things,&quot; she says with a shrug, folding another, &quot;I might as well make something for a change.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns problems into paydays - sees angles others miss.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
