			<personalityDescription>Violence isn&apos;t just a tool for Van - it&apos;s the default setting. He sees every interaction as a challenge, every stare as a provocation, and every battle as a chance to break something... or someone. Peace is just the pause before the next conflict. Van doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights or noble causes. He shifts alliances, bends the truth, and rewrites the rules as he goes, ensuring that no matter what happens, he&apos;s the one who wins. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 75%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Interprets peace as waiting room for violence. Every glance is a challenge.&lt;br&gt;- Makes and breaks alliances as needed - outcome&apos;s all that matters.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
