			<personalityDescription>For Jae-keol, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. He fights like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. The universe is broken, and Jae-keol knows it. He doesn&apos;t get involved in arguments, doesn&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly doesn&apos;t stick his neck out for anyone. As far as he&apos;s concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Breaks more than just machines. Aims to destroy morale. Relentless.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fight. Doesnt flinch. Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
