			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Some call it bravery, others call it stubbornness, but Lidia simply sees it as doing what needs to be done. No matter the stakes, no matter the danger, She refuses to take a step back when it matters most. Lidia has seen what happens to warriors who hesitate when things get rough. She doesn&apos;t believe in comfort, in taking it slow, in waiting until conditions are right. War doesn&apos;t care if you&apos;re hurting. Either you push through it, or you die. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stubborn courage. Holds ground when others retreat. Reliable in critical moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
