			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fine line between bravery and recklessness, but Constância doesn&apos;t care. She leaps before she looks, convinced that if no one else dares to try, it just means she&apos;s the only one bold enough to succeed. Every move Constância makes is intentional. She never fights just for the sake of it - she maneuvers, controls engagements, and dictates the pace of battle, making sure every skirmish ends on her terms. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Leaps before thinking. Believes boldness is its own justification.&lt;br&gt;- Controls the tempo. Makes the enemy dance to his tune.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
