			<personalityDescription>Once, Kyung-soo might have wanted more, but now? They&apos;ve seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Kyung-soo has long since stopped caring. Kyung-soo is easy to like. They greet everyone with a smile, make conversation effortlessly, and genuinely enjoy getting to know people. Whether ally or stranger, they treat everyone with kindness and respect. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 67%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Burned out or just gave up - either way, not climbing.&lt;br&gt;- Easy rapport with everyone. Keeps team morale high without trying.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
