			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Jaidyn&apos;s strengths. She speaks before thinking, acts before planning, and never apologizes for either. If boldness is a virtue, then she considers herself a saint. Jaidyn doesn&apos;t waste time on distractions. She measures success not by effort but by results, constantly driving forward with a clear vision of where she&apos;s going and how she&apos;ll get there. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No patience, no filter, no regrets. Speaks and acts before thinking. Owns it.&lt;br&gt;- Measures success by outcome, not effort. Keeps the path clear and forward.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
