			<personalityDescription>Lewis lives by one rule: act now, figure out the details later. They barrel through obstacles with sheer confidence, trusting that if things go wrong, they&apos;ll deal with it when they get there - assuming they even care. Lewis has a reputation for bending the truth, cutting corners, and looking out for themself first. They&apos;re likable, sure, but trusting them? That&apos;s a gamble few are willing to take. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 41%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges through obstacles. Plans on-the-fly, if at all. May improvise into disaster.&lt;br&gt;- Friendly face, forked tongue. Double-check every word.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
