			<personalityDescription>Tofeeq doesn&apos;t waste time on people or ideas he deems unimportant. If he thinks someone&apos;s opinion is useless, he brushes them off without a second thought and moves forward on his own terms. Tofeeq&apos;s mind wanders at the worst possible times. Mid-mission, mid-skirmish, even while waiting for an enemy to make a move - he&apos;s caught staring into the distance, lost in thought. &quot;Tofeeq, focus!&quot; someone shouts. He blinks, snapping back. &quot;Yeah, yeah - I was just thinking.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brushes off anything that doesn&apos;t serve immediate purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
