			<personalityDescription>Ivan never plays fair - he plays to win. Every promise, every alliance, every deal is just another tool in his arsenal, and he always ensures he comes out ahead. Ivan doesn&apos;t care about technical readouts or factory settings - he knows when a unit feels right. If he&apos;s forced into something that doesn&apos;t match him, he feels it immediately. &quot;You don&apos;t pick something based on numbers. You feel what belongs to you.&quot; </personalityDescription>
