			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Yunus would rather go down in flames than play it safe. He lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy he can get - and somehow, he usually pulls it off. Yunus has a sharp eye for opportunities and a mind built for strategy. He quickly size up situations, makes smart decisions, and always seems to be one step ahead of the competition. </personalityDescription>
