			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Serenna has no patience for hesitation. She faces overwhelming firepower with a defiant grin, daring fate to try and stop her. Whether it&apos;s reckless courage or sheer madness, only the battlefield will decide. Everything grates on her - people, orders, even the sound of her own comms. Serenna is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who she is, her temper is a fuse ready to blow. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats fear like weakness. Smiles at overwhelming odds. Borderline reckless.&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
