			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Mary acts. She doesn&apos;t wait for orders, approval, or the perfect moment - she takes control, makes the call, and ensures things get done her way. Mary doesn&apos;t waste time on moral debates - she does what needs to be done. If that means breaking promises, cutting corners, or stepping over someone to get ahead, so be it. </personalityDescription>
