			<personalityDescription>Naemi has a natural ability to sense what others are feeling. She listens without judgment, offers genuine support, and always seems to know exactly what someone needs to hear - whether they realize it or not. Naemi doesn&apos;t just check the time - she tracks it. She knows exactly how long it&apos;s been since deployment, how much time they have until extraction, and how late support is running. &quot;Naemi, do you have to check your watch every five minutes?&quot; &quot;Yes. And you should too.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads people like a book. Knows when to speak - and when not to.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
