			<personalityDescription>Ooma sees uncertainty as an invitation rather than a threat. They step into the unknown without hesitation, confident that no matter what awaits, they&apos;ll find a way through. Ooma doesn&apos;t just have confidence - they have certainty. In their mind, they&apos;re always the smartest, strongest, and most capable person around, and anyone who disagrees is simply too blind to see it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats uncertainty like a map. Goes first, figures it out mid-stride.&lt;br&gt;- Confidence hardened into certainty. No room for disagreement - only correction.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
