			<personalityDescription>Ora isn&apos;t satisfied with just getting by - they want more. Whether it&apos;s climbing the ranks, commanding their own unit, or carving their name into history, they&apos;re always pushing forward, never content to stay in one place for long. Ora doesn&apos;t just fight - they narrate the moment. Whether it&apos;s ancient war poetry, battlefield elegies, or lines of verse that no one else recognizes, they speak as if they&apos;ve seen this all before. &quot;Bent double, we cursed through sludge; till towards our distant rest began to trudge.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never satisfied. Always reaching for more - rank, power, legacy.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
