			<personalityDescription>Where others see only the surface, Yoon-Mi digs deeper. They pick up on the smallest tells, the hidden motivations, the why behind every action - turning knowledge into power before anyone realizes they have it. Yoon-Mi makes people believe in something greater than themselves. Whether through their unshakable resolve, their fearless leadership, or the quiet moments where they remind someone of their worth, they spark hope in even the darkest times. </personalityDescription>
