			<personalityDescription>Nata doesn&apos;t entertain the idea of failure. Whether it&apos;s natural talent, unbreakable will, or sheer force of personality, she carries herself like someone who expects to win - and usually does. Nata has a way of making everyone feel welcome. Whether it&apos;s a rookie looking for guidance or an old rival at a bar, her easygoing nature and open demeanor put people at ease, breaking down walls before they&apos;re even built. </personalityDescription>
