			<personalityDescription>Shonda doesn&apos;t know the meaning of the word quit. No matter how many times they&apos;re knocked down, outmaneuvered, or told something is impossible, they keep pushing forward until they get the result they want. Shonda has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to their side. Whether they&apos;re negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking their way out of trouble, their confidence and charm make it hard to say no. </personalityDescription>
