			<personalityDescription>Lashin moves through life with absolute certainty, her presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When she speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Lashin measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To her, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw she has no intention of indulging. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commands attention by presence alone. No showmanship - just certainty.&lt;br&gt;- Emotion is leverage, not weakness. Hesitation isn&apos;t tolerated.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
