			<personalityDescription>Morality is just a tool for the naive. Jeffrey does whatever it takes to get ahead, stepping over anyone who gets in his way and never looking back. Jeffrey has a number for everything. If something has happened before, been studied, or analyzed, he knows the probability of it happening again - and he will bring it up. &quot;Based on historical trends, there&apos;s a 41.67% chance this will fail exactly the same way as last time.&quot; </personalityDescription>
