			<performanceExamScore>46</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Cadha always pushes for more than she can realistically handle. Whether it&apos;s taking on impossible missions, making reckless bets, or biting off more than she can chew, she refuses to accept her limits - often to her own detriment. Cadha&apos;s body keeps going, but her mind is fractured in ways she&apos;ll never fully fix. The stutter is just a symptom, a telltale sign that something in her is still processing all the things she&apos;ll never talk about. &quot;J-j-just let me w-w-work. D-d-doesn&apos;t matter how I say it, as long as I g-g-get it d-d-done.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bites off more than they can shoot. Leaves cleanup for the rest of us.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
