			<performanceExamScore>55</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Rajindar operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, he&apos;s playing it safe; the next, he&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with him is a challenge - predicting him is impossible. Rajindar writes because it&apos;s the only way to process the things he&apos;s seen. The words are sharp, brutal, and honest in a way that scares even him sometimes. &quot;If I don&apos;t put it down on paper, it stays in my head. And trust me - you don&apos;t want it staying there.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
