			<personalityDescription>Marilyn doesn&apos;t believe in waiting for the right moment - she makes the moment right. Her determination fuels everything she does, propelling her forward no matter the obstacles in her way. To Marilyn, restraint is just another word for cowardice. She overextends herself at every opportunity, chasing grand plans and high-stakes gambles, never considering that one wrong move could send it all crashing down. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t wait for chances - builds them. Momentum is the fuel.&lt;br&gt;- Chases every high-risk move like it&apos;s glory. Won&apos;t stop until it&apos;s wreckage.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
