			<personalityDescription>Toafo treats every challenge like a battle of endurance, convinced that if they just hold out long enough, the world will bend before they do. Sometimes it works - sometimes it just makes life harder for everyone around them. Toafo doesn&apos;t just lead - they elevate those around them. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, they make people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. </personalityDescription>
