			<personalityDescription>Robert never raises his voice when a well-placed sentence will do. He doesn&apos;t just smooth things over - he reshapes conversations to his advantage, leaving even his rivals wondering how they ended up agreeing with him. Robert&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. He scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts his will so thoroughly that those around him rarely get the chance to think for themselves. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t argue - redirects. Leaves opponents convinced they won.&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
