			<personalityDescription>Why fight when you can talk your way out - or better yet, talk your enemy into fighting for you? Husam al Din knows how to turn a phrase, spin a deal, and leave everyone thinking they got the better end of the bargain. Husam al Din&apos;s ambition isn&apos;t just a trait - it&apos;s a force of nature. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t look back, and doesn&apos;t accept limitations. If there&apos;s a path forward, he&apos;ll find it, no matter how steep the climb. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Talks others into doing their dirty work. Master of the soft sell.&lt;br&gt;- Ambition drives every step. Limits aren&apos;t accepted - they&apos;re broken.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
