			<personalityDescription>Hikaru has no patience for nonsense. He cuts through distractions and emotions, keeping his mind locked onto the mission. While others get lost in doubt or debate, he moves forward with ruthless efficiency. No matter how ruthless the world gets, Hikaru refuses to compromise his integrity. He sticks to his word, treats people with genuine respect, and never says something just for the sake of appearances. </personalityDescription>
