			<personalityDescription>In Tyler&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. He seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the only one left standing. Patience has never been Tyler&apos;s strong suit. He leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, his restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - he lives for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees kindness as weakness. Destroys problems before they form.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
