			<personalityDescription>Gwendolyn doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only what works. They lie, cheat, and betray without hesitation, using people as stepping stones on their path to power. If someone trusted them, they&apos;ve already made their last mistake. Gwendolyn has a way of making everyone feel welcome. Whether it&apos;s a rookie looking for guidance or an old rival at a bar, their easygoing nature and open demeanor put people at ease, breaking down walls before they&apos;re even built. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty? Ethics? Dead weight. Uses people like tools.&lt;br&gt;- Walks into a room, tension walks out.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
