			<personalityDescription>Colin approaches every fight with precision, analyzing the battlefield and making calculated moves. He doesn&apos;t waste effort on flashy maneuvers - every action serves a purpose, every shot is deliberate. To Colin, leadership isn&apos;t about power - it&apos;s about responsibility. He takes the weight of others&apos; burdens without complaint, ensuring that no one suffers alone, even when it means carrying more than he should. </personalityDescription>
