			<personalityDescription>Philippe&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s his ability to manipulate. He spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, he&apos;s already taken what he wanted. Philippe says exactly what&apos;s on his mind, with no concern for sugarcoating or social niceties. If the truth is harsh, so be it - he sees no point in dressing it up. </personalityDescription>
