			<personalityDescription>Euphemia adapts faster than anyone else. She thrives in unpredictability, adjusting her approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes her way - no matter who gets left behind. Euphemia never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, she&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - she calls it smart business. </personalityDescription>
