			<personalityDescription>Once Tvorimir commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake his resolve once he&apos;s made up his mind. Even when Tvorimir offers help, it comes wrapped in barely concealed disdain. His advice drips with superiority, his compliments feel backhanded, and every conversation leaves people wondering if they&apos;ve just been insulted. </personalityDescription>
