			<personalityDescription>Once, Juan might have wanted more, but now? They&apos;ve seen too many people claw their way to the top only to die just like everyone else. Ambition is just another word for desperation, and Juan has long since stopped caring. &quot;Juan is moving to cover now. Juan is reloading. Juan would appreciate it if someone covered Juan while Juan does this.&quot; Their lance has learned that if Juan suddenly stops narrating themself, something has gone very wrong. </personalityDescription>
