			<personalityDescription>Ömer doesn&apos;t believe in aimless effort - every action, every decision serves a purpose. They keep their eyes on the prize, unwilling to let anything pull them off course. To Ömer, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits them, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. They&apos;re not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits them most in the moment. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every move has purpose. Won&apos;t tolerate drift or distraction.&lt;br&gt;- Honor&apos;s a prop - drops it the second it stops paying off.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
