			<personalityDescription>Once Joo-il sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no shaking him. He&apos;ll keep coming, keep working, and keep fighting long after others would have given up, proving that sheer force of will can sometimes be the most dangerous weapon of all. Joo-il thrives on audacity. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether he&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, he does it all with a smirk and a shrug. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 75%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Once committed, won&apos;t let go. Willpower becomes weapon.&lt;br&gt;- Built from brass and boldness. No filter, no fear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
