			<personalityDescription>Sylwia&apos;s energy is impossible to ignore. She drives conversations, sparks ideas, and keeps people moving, her sheer momentum pulling others along whether they&apos;re ready or not. Sylwia moves through life like a ghost, detached from the surrounding chaos. Orders are followed, tasks are completed, but there&apos;s no fire behind her actions - just a quiet acceptance that nothing really changes. </personalityDescription>
