			<personalityDescription>Shenaz has a knack for turning every situation into a payday. Whether it&apos;s salvage rights, lucrative contracts, or well-placed investments, she always finds a way to make sure her time and effort result in cold, hard cash. Every insult, every disagreement, every minor inconvenience is a personal attack in Shenaz&apos;s mind. She holds grudges for years, going out of her way to make sure anyone who crosses her regrets it, even if it costs her more than it&apos;s worth. </personalityDescription>
