			<personalityDescription>War isn&apos;t personal for Bryan - it&apos;s a business. They weigh risks like investments, treat allies like temporary partners, and know that in the end, survival isn&apos;t about honor - it&apos;s about profit. Bryan rarely entertains arguments or second opinions - they&apos;ve already made up their mind. When others try to offer input, they wave them off with a sigh or a curt reply, making it clear they don&apos;t have time for nonsense. </personalityDescription>
