			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Gaetan has no patience for it. He throws himself into battle with wild abandon, ignoring risks and consequences. Whether it&apos;s bravery or a death wish, sooner or later, it&apos;s going to catch up with him. Gaetan&apos;s favorite mug has been with him longer than most of his comrades. He&apos;s left planets behind, lost equipment, abandoned people - but this remains. Gaetan doesn&apos;t talk about where he got it or why he won&apos;t replace it. He just holds it a little tighter on the nights when the war feels particularly close. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ignores risk entirely. Bravery or death wish - hard to tell.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
