			<personalityDescription>Trista weighs every decision carefully, considering all angles before taking action. She values logic over impulse, ensuring that every move she makes is well-thought-out and serves a greater purpose. Trista keeps the music going because without it, all that&apos;s left is the sound of gunfire, screams, and things she&apos;d rather not remember. She drowns it all out before it can creep in. &quot;You want me to turn it off? No. I don&apos;t do silence.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Never rushes - everything&apos;s weighed, measured, executed clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
