			<personalityDescription>Matej believes leadership isn&apos;t about consensus - it&apos;s about control. He doesn&apos;t ask for loyalty; he assumes it, and those who resist quickly learn that standing in his way is never a good idea. Matej doesn&apos;t just want to prove himself - he needs to. He throws himself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show he&apos;s worthy of something bigger. </personalityDescription>
