			<personalityDescription>For Adrian, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. They fight like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. Every move Adrian makes is deliberate. They calculate risks, anticipate outcomes, and manipulate situations with ease, ensuring that no matter what happens, they&apos;re always in control. </personalityDescription>
