			<personalityDescription>Calvin knows how to navigate difficult conversations without causing unnecessary conflict. He chooses his words carefully, smoothing over tensions and ensuring that problems get solved without making enemies. Calvin tells stories not because they&apos;re entertaining, but because he refuses to let people be forgotten. He speaks of old battles, fallen comrades, places that don&apos;t exist anymore. He remembers so that others won&apos;t have to. Or maybe, because he knows no one else will. </personalityDescription>
