			<personalityDescription>No matter how ruthless the world gets, Mirela refuses to compromise her integrity. She sticks to her word, treats people with genuine respect, and never says something just for the sake of appearances. When Mirela isn&apos;t in battle, she&apos;s sitting with a whetstone, running it over the edge of her blade again and again. It doesn&apos;t matter if it&apos;s already sharp - she keeps at it anyway. It&apos;s not about the blade. It&apos;s about the motion, the control, the focus. Her team has learned that if Mirela&apos;s sharpening in silence, it&apos;s best to leave her be. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Won&apos;t sell you lies - not even to make it easier.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
