			<personalityDescription>Theo isn&apos;t just a fighter - he&apos;s a chess master with live ammunition. He sets traps, lures enemies into kill zones, and plays mind games that leave opponents scrambling while he calmly executes his next move. Theo isn&apos;t just a warrior - he&apos;s a historian of destruction. Every time he picks up a new weapon, he&apos;s comparing it to ancient ballistic arms. &quot;You think this is impressive? Back in the 20th century, they were pulling off headshots with iron sights and lead slugs.&quot; </personalityDescription>
