			<personalityDescription>Trust is a weakness Kenan has no interest in. He keeps everyone at arm&apos;s length - sometimes through words, sometimes through force - because in his world, attachments are just another vulnerability waiting to be exploited. Kenan doesn&apos;t just check the time - he tracks it. He knows exactly how long it&apos;s been since deployment, how much time they have until extraction, and how late support is running. &quot;Kenan, do you have to check your watch every five minutes?&quot; &quot;Yes. And you should too.&quot; </personalityDescription>
