			<personalityDescription>In Woody&apos;s world, hesitation is death and kindness is a liability. He seizes every advantage, eliminates threats before they become problems, and ensures that when the dust settles, he&apos;s the only one left standing. Reading between the lines is second nature to Woody. He picks up on tone, body language, and unspoken concerns, responding with careful precision to make sure no detail - no matter how small - goes unnoticed. </personalityDescription>
