			<personalityDescription>To Ashanti, war is not just necessary - it is a craving, an addiction that only destruction can satisfy. She takes no prisoners, showing no mercy, and relishes the moment an enemy&apos;s &apos;Mek crumples under her relentless assault. Ashanti is convinced she&apos;s the best warrior, the best tactician, and probably the smartest person in the room. She doesn&apos;t just believe in herself - she assumes everyone else is playing catch-up, whether they realize it or not. </personalityDescription>
