			<personalityDescription>Oharu doesn&apos;t let morality get in the way of what she wants. Rules, ethics, and ideals are just obstacles to be sidestepped when necessary - she does whatever works, and if that means playing dirty, so be it. Oharu always has a story about the time she stood her ground against impossible odds. Whether it was charging into fire, refusing to retreat, or staring down a superior force without blinking - she makes sure everyone knows about it. &quot;You think this is bad? Let me tell you about the time I...&quot; </personalityDescription>
