			<personalityDescription>Mimi carries an air of barely restrained aggression, her words sharp and her patience nonexistent. Every conversation feels like a confrontation and that&apos;s how she likes it. Mimi&apos;s patience is razor-thin, and it shows. Every delay, every misstep, every pointless conversation feels like nails on a chalkboard. She doesn&apos;t have time for nonsense - just get to the point and do the job right. </personalityDescription>
