			<personalityDescription>Ipok knows where she wants to be, and she knows how to get there. With a mix of charm, strategy, and just the right amount of risk-taking, she maneuvers her way toward success, making the right allies and cutting loose the dead weight as needed. Ipok loves the sound of her own voice, spending more time talking about her greatness than actually proving it. She overcomplicates simple ideas, inserts herself into situations just to show off, and acts as if every decision she makes is revolutionary - even when it&apos;s not. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategic climber. Makes allies, cuts weight, eyes always on the prize.&lt;br&gt;- Loves their own voice more than the sound of gunfire.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
