			<personalityDescription>Stéphan doesn&apos;t hesitate when faced with the impossible - He meets it head-on, with a steady gaze and an unshakable will. He knows that fear is inevitable, but surrender is a choice. Stéphan treats sleep as optional. &quot;We&apos;ve got deadlines.&quot; &quot;We&apos;ve got a mission.&quot; &quot;We&apos;ve got so much work to do.&quot; He pushes himself harder than anyone else and gets frustrated when others can&apos;t keep up. Not because he&apos;s angry - because if Stéphan needs sleep, that means he&apos;s doing something wrong. </personalityDescription>
