			<personalityDescription>Planning has never been Jagoda&apos;s strong suit. She follows instinct over strategy, letting adrenaline and quick thinking dictate her path. Sometimes it works, sometimes it doesn&apos;t - but either way, she never hesitates. Jagoda rarely takes others seriously, rolling her eyes at concerns she doesn&apos;t find valid. Whether it&apos;s a risky plan, a personal grievance, or a suggestion she thinks is dumb, she shuts it down with a snide remark and moves on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategy ignored. Runs on instinct and adrenaline. Sometimes lucky, always fast.&lt;br&gt;- Eye-rolls and shutdowns. Doesn&apos;t bother pretending to care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
