			<personalityDescription>Billy is always watching, always analyzing, never letting his guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, he stays one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. No matter how ruthless the world gets, Billy refuses to compromise his integrity. He sticks to his word, treats people with genuine respect, and never says something just for the sake of appearances. </personalityDescription>
