			<personalityDescription>Patience has never been Sun-woo&apos;s strong suit. He leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, his restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - he lives for action, for motion, for doing something. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Sun-woo knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what he wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 61%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;br&gt;- Plays people like strings - never needs to raise a voice.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
