			<personalityDescription>Every conversation with Rosa is a game of unseen moves and hidden motives. She weaves lies with truth, controlling the flow of information so effortlessly that by the time anyone realizes they&apos;ve been played, it&apos;s already too late. To Rosa, restraint is a foreign concept. She surrounds herself with luxury, excitement, and temptation, always seeking the next thrill to satisfy her endless cravings - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Talks in moves and motives. Controls the game long before anyone sees the board.&lt;br&gt;- Lives for indulgence - luxury, temptation, distraction. A liability in quiet moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
