			<personalityDescription>Where others see only the surface, Leonidas digs deeper. They pick up on the smallest tells, the hidden motivations, the why behind every action - turning knowledge into power before anyone realizes they have it. Leonidas rarely entertains arguments or second opinions - they&apos;ve already made up their mind. When others try to offer input, they wave them off with a sigh or a curt reply, making it clear they don&apos;t have time for nonsense. </personalityDescription>
