			<personalityDescription>Everything grates on her - people, orders, even the sound of her own comms. Norma is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who she is, her temper is a fuse ready to blow. Norma doesn&apos;t just hear callsigns - she remembers them. Every hero, every ace, every fallen comrade - she keeps a mental log. &quot;Stormbringer? Yeah, I fought against them once. Tough bastard. Still out there?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
