			<personalityDescription>Cherles is always watching, always analyzing, never letting his guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, he stays one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. In the chaos of war, Cherles keeps one thing constant. Maybe it&apos;s a trinket from home, maybe it&apos;s something given to him by someone long gone. It doesn&apos;t matter what it is - what matters is that it&apos;s his. When the battle&apos;s over and the adrenaline fades, he he grips it tight, reminding himself that he&apos;s still here. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always alert. Never caught off guard. Reacts before threats materialize.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
