			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Aghajan avoids - it&apos;s something they seek. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, They meet every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Loyalty is just another tool to be used and discarded. Aghajan lies, betrays, and manipulates without hesitation, making promises they never intend to keep. If someone still trusts them, it&apos;s only because they haven&apos;t been burned yet. </personalityDescription>
