			<personalityDescription>Ettore never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, he&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - he calls it smart business. Ettore doesn&apos;t see the point in announcing his presence. Every movement is controlled, every step soft. While others crash forward, he&apos;s already maneuvering unseen. &quot;Loud gets you killed. Quiet lets you choose when to strike.&quot; </personalityDescription>
