			<personalityDescription>With a quick joke and a warm smile, Andre turns even the coldest encounters into something comfortable. They treat allies like family and strangers like potential friends, believing that a little kindness can go a long way - even in war. Andre doesn&apos;t just enjoy the rush - they need it. In the quiet moments, their hands shake, their mind won&apos;t stop racing. But when the crisis hits? They&apos;re steady, clear, unbreakable. Because if they&apos;re not in danger, they&apos;re not sure who they even is anymore. </personalityDescription>
