			<personalityDescription>Afoniy doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. He does what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in his world, only the strong deserve to survive. Persuasion is just another tool for control. Afoniy knows exactly how to twist words, play on emotions, and push people into doing what he wants - whether they realize it or not. By the time they see the trap, it&apos;s already too late. </personalityDescription>
