			<personalityDescription>Iukekini doesn&apos;t believe in delegation, compromise, or second opinions. If something needs to be done, he&apos;ll do it his way - whether anyone asked for his help or not. Iukekini isn&apos;t loud about his support, but it&apos;s always there. A nod at the right time, an unspoken gesture of help, or simply being present when it matters - his strength lies in knowing exactly what people need, even when they don&apos;t ask for it. </personalityDescription>
