			<personalityDescription>Some call it bravery, others call it stubbornness, but Isabis simply sees it as doing what needs to be done. No matter the stakes, no matter the danger, She refuses to take a step back when it matters most. Standard-issue gear? Not a chance. Isabis&apos;s sidearm has a custom grip, her biometrics system runs on a personally adjusted algorithm, and no one quite understands what she did to her HUD. Her mods usually work - until they don&apos;t. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Stubborn courage. Holds ground when others retreat. Reliable in critical moments.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
