			<personalityDescription>Kiersten doesn&apos;t dwell on uncertainty. She processes information quickly, chooses a course of action, and moves forward without hesitation - confident that momentum is the key to victory. Kiersten is constantly narrating, cracking jokes, and running commentary, even when dodging enemy fire. &quot;Oh great, another missile lock - real original, guys!&quot; Her squad has learned to tune her out or roll with it. </personalityDescription>
