			<personalityDescription>Adhipa sees rules as obstacles, not boundaries. If there&apos;s a shortcut to be taken or a loophole to exploit, they&apos;ll find it - ethics and fairness be damned. By the time others are starting their first briefing, Adhipa has already run a full systems check, a workout, and possibly a simulated battle. &quot;I&apos;ve been productive for hours,&quot; they grim, as someone else mumbles, &quot;It&apos;s literally 05:00.&quot; </personalityDescription>
