			<personalityDescription>Loyalty is just a word, and Manuel has no use for it. He lies, schemes, and betrays without hesitation, using anyone and everyone to climb higher. If someone trusts him, they&apos;ve already lost. No matter where he is, Manuel can&apos;t stop apologizing. He&apos;ll say &quot;Sorry&quot; for calling a warning too late, for calling it too early, for asking a question, and sometimes just for existing. He fights hard, but his squad suspects he&apos;d apologize to an inbound PPC if given the chance. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Loyalty means nothing. Lies and betrayal are just tools of the trade.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
