			<personalityDescription>Pham doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects him to stick his neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. Pham keeps everything - ammo, supplies, spare parts - because you never know when you&apos;ll need them. He refuses to let go of anything useful, even if it means stockpiling more than he could ever realistically use. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trusts no one, helps no one, and always walks away richer.&lt;br&gt;- Keeps everything that isn&apos;t nailed down. Doesn&apos;t share. Doesn&apos;t trust.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
