			<personalityDescription>Bishr never met a fight he didn&apos;t think he could win. Whether it&apos;s in combat, making bets, or mouthing off to the wrong people, Bishr jumps in without thinking - because, really, what&apos;s the worst that could happen? Bishr never does anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s firepower, preparation, or just sheer intensity, he goes all-in, often pushing beyond what&apos;s necessary - or even reasonable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overestimates self. Picks fights, makes bets, mouths off. No fear - no filter.&lt;br&gt;- Always goes all-in. Pushes past whats needed - usually past reason.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
