			<personalityDescription>Olan is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. They roll their eyes, mutter under their breath, and get annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, they still get the job done. Olan isn&apos;t afraid to fight, but they feel better when there&apos;s a ceiling over their head, solid walls around them, and nowhere for enemies to flank them. Wide, open battlefields? They&apos;ll take their chances elsewhere. &quot;I don&apos;t trust empty space. Too many angles, too many places to get hit from.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 76%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No time for fools - barely any for friends.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
