			<personalityDescription>Sasha lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, she never slows down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. Even when Sasha offers help, it comes wrapped in barely concealed disdain. Her advice drips with superiority, her compliments feel backhanded, and every conversation leaves people wondering if they&apos;ve just been insulted. </personalityDescription>
