			<personalityDescription>Erten doesn&apos;t do diplomacy, small talk, or patience. Every interaction is laced with an edge of hostility, as if he&apos;s daring the world to give him a reason to lash out. Erten treats combat like a sport, and fueling his body is part of his routine. He&apos;s always chewing on protein bars, popping dried fruit between drills, and downing electrolyte drinks like they&apos;re going out of style. His squad teases him, but they don&apos;t complain when he hands out energy-packed snacks that keep them going during long deployments. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always confrontational. Anticipates violence, welcomes it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
