			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Adam refuses to bend. He will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in his mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Adam doesn&apos;t believe in limits. Whether it&apos;s effort, firepower, or sheer presence, he always pushes past what&apos;s necessary, turning every task into something grander, louder, and more overwhelming than it has to be. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t recognize limits. Turns every task into spectacle.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
