			<personalityDescription>Edward lives by one rule: act now, figure out the details later. They barrel through obstacles with sheer confidence, trusting that if things go wrong, they&apos;ll deal with it when they get there - assuming they even care. Edward can&apos;t not try to break things down. They spend downtime solving riddles, tweaking battle plans, or picking apart mission briefings like they&apos;re crossword clues. &quot;It&apos;s just a simple recon op, Edward.&quot; They shake their head. &quot;That&apos;s what they want you to think.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges through obstacles. Plans on-the-fly, if at all. May improvise into disaster.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
