			<personalityDescription>Kadzumi doesn&apos;t see the point in fighting for a bigger slice of the pie when she&apos;s already got enough to get by. Others can stress over promotions and prestige - she&apos;ll take her time, do what&apos;s necessary, and enjoy life without all the extra pressure. Kadzumi has a way with words and an even better way with deals. She can navigate complex negotiations, twist situations in her favor, and come out ahead in any conversation. If someone tries to con her, they&apos;d better be ready to lose. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 44%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows their lane. Won&apos;t leave it. Won&apos;t look up.&lt;br&gt;- Silver tongue and iron grip - gets what they want, walks away clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
