			<personalityDescription>Sebastiana never sits back and lets events unfold - they&apos;re always moving, always planning, always ensuring they&apos;re the one shaping the outcome rather than reacting to it. Sebastiana talks a good game about loyalty and teamwork, but at the end of the day, they&apos;re only loyal to themself. They know exactly when to walk away, who to throw under the bus, and how to spin things so they always land on their feet. </personalityDescription>
