			<personalityDescription>Cassia doesn&apos;t just have confidence - she has certainty. In her mind, she&apos;s always the smartest, strongest, and most capable person around, and anyone who disagrees is simply too blind to see it. In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Cassia refuses to become just another manipulator. She holds onto her integrity, even when it costs her, because she knows that if she loses that, she&apos;s lost everything. </personalityDescription>
