			<personalityDescription>Yoshiki doesn&apos;t just want to prove himself - he needs to. He throws himself into battles, pushes limits, and takes on risks that others would shy away from, desperate to show he&apos;s worthy of something bigger. Yoshiki fights hard, but his mind is elsewhere. He dreams about what he&apos;d do if he weren&apos;t here, imagines different places, different battles, different endings. Sometimes, he wonders if he&apos;ll ever get to see any of them. </personalityDescription>
