			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Mary has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply her presence, she reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. If Mary can do something in a harder, more exhausting way, she will. She sprints to the DropShip instead of walking, does pull-ups on cargo racks, and somehow turns reloading a missile rack into a full-body workout. &quot;Gotta stay combat-ready,&quot; she says, between sets of one-arm push-ups. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
