			<personalityDescription>Maroof always wants more - more money, more power, more influence. No matter how much he has, it&apos;s never enough, and he&apos;s always looking for the next way to add to his wealth and status. Maroof doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. He sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if he has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
