			<performanceExamScore>26</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Cham doesn&apos;t acknowledge fear as anything more than a passing thought. He moves forward with unwavering certainty, meeting every challenge as if failure were never a possibility. Cham doesn&apos;t just look at people - he locks on like a targeting computer. Enemy lining up a shot? He stares them down through the HUD like he dares them to miss. Comrade panicking under fire? He grips their shoulder and holds their gaze until they snap out of it. His stare isn&apos;t just intense - it&apos;s commanding. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 25%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t consider failure. Confidence absolute - maybe dangerously so.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
