			<personalityDescription>Ruwaida exudes a fearless certainty that turns heads the moment she enters a room. Every word, every gesture carries an undeniable weight, as if doubt itself has no place in her world. After seeing too much death and betrayal, Ruwaida has stopped caring. She doesn&apos;t form attachments, doesn&apos;t believe in causes, and doesn&apos;t waste energy on emotions. In her mind, caring only leads to pain. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 35%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries weight just by entering a room. Commands presence without trying.&lt;br&gt;- Seen too much, feels nothing. Not dead - just numb.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
