			<personalityDescription>To Habiba, every situation is a battlefield, and she plays it like a master tactician. She anticipates actions before they happen, positioning herself for success while others struggle to keep up. Habiba doesn&apos;t coddle - she drives people forward. Her words are sharp, her expectations high, but it&apos;s all to make sure those around her survive. If she&apos;s hard on someone, it&apos;s because she refuses to let them fail. </personalityDescription>
