			<personalityDescription>Klaudie never acts on impulse - every move she makes is carefully thought out, every action weighed against its potential outcome. Whether in battle or negotiations, she plays the long game, ensuring she always comes out ahead. Klaudie believes every strategy should be tested, retested, and stress-tested again. If something isn&apos;t solid, she&apos;s stopping everything until it is. &quot;Look, you can go with this version, or you can go with the one that actually works.&quot; </personalityDescription>
