			<personalityDescription>Meirul-Nisa knows how to act like a team player, but when push comes to shove, she&apos;ll take the best deal for herself. She&apos;ll smile, shake hands, and make promises - but when it&apos;s time to cash in, she&apos;ll make sure she walks away with the biggest share. Meirul-Nisa&apos;s loyalty is measured in cash, and the only flag she follows is the one that pays her the most. If the contract is right, she&apos;ll fight for anyone, against anyone - principles be damned. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 33%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays nice until theres something to take - then takes it all.&lt;br&gt;- Will shoot for anyone if the money&apos;s good. Morals not included.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
