			<personalityDescription>Everything grates on them - people, orders, even the sound of their own comms. Idola is always on edge, snapping at allies and enemies alike. Whether it&apos;s stress, trauma, or just who they are, their temper is a fuse ready to blow. Idola&apos;s foot taps as they calculate supply orders, budget projections, and shipment schedules in real-time. It&apos;s like their brain is moving too fast for their body to keep up. The tapping isn&apos;t impatience - it&apos;s momentum. They&apos;re already thinking about the next problem before anyone else even realizes there is one. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Radio chatter sets them off. So do people.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
