			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no room for hesitation in Ryuichi&apos;s world. They step forward without looking back, their decisions made with the kind of conviction that leaves little space for argument. Whether they&apos;re right or wrong, they never linger in uncertainty. Ryuichi has zero patience for people who say something can&apos;t be done. They&apos;ll stay up as long as it takes, trying every method, every angle, until they force a solution into existence. &quot;I don&apos;t fail. I solve problems. Even if it takes forever.&quot; </personalityDescription>
