			<personalityDescription>Eoghan&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in skill or strategy - it&apos;s in sheer, unyielding willpower. Once he starts something, he&apos;ll see it through to the bitter end, no matter what it costs. Eoghan always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. He knows when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. </personalityDescription>
