			<personalityDescription>Harold is always watching, always analyzing, never letting his guard down. Whether on the battlefield or in everyday life, he stays one step ahead, ready to react before danger strikes. Harold&apos;s flask is always full, and he&apos;s always willing to pass it around. Before a mission, after a mission, in the middle of one if things are slow enough. &quot;Nothing wrong with a quick sip,&quot; he says, handing it over with a grin. No one&apos;s sure if it&apos;s actual alcohol, battlefield coffee, or something worse - but whatever it is, it burns. </personalityDescription>
