			<personalityDescription>Teika&apos;s drive is infectious. His sheer enthusiasm and determination make people believe in him, rallying allies to his side and pushing them to go further than they ever thought possible. Money isn&apos;t just a luxury for Teika - it&apos;s an obsession. He sees every interaction as a transaction, every person as a potential asset or obstacle in his relentless pursuit of fortune. </personalityDescription>
