			<personalityDescription>Svjetlana lives life on her own terms, never second-guessing herself or feeling bad for taking risks. She&apos;ll say what others won&apos;t, do what others fear, and walk away grinning, no matter the fallout. Diplomacy is second nature to Svjetlana. She reads people like an open book, adjusting her words and approach to persuade without pressuring, ensuring that even those who disagree walk away feeling like they&apos;ve been heard. </personalityDescription>
