			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Jamie refuses to bend. He will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in his mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Jamie enjoys the finer pleasures in life and pursues them with enthusiasm. Whether it&apos;s romance, excitement, or indulgence, he sees no reason to deny himself what he desires. </personalityDescription>
