			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Besmira avoids - it&apos;s something she seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, She meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Besmira sees through people like glass. She picks apart their motives, exploits their weaknesses, and predicts their actions before they even realize what they&apos;re going to do. It&apos;s not empathy - it&apos;s just another tool for survival. </personalityDescription>
