			<personalityDescription>Darcel doesn&apos;t care what people think of her. Whether she&apos;s bragging, bending the truth, or cutting corners, she does what she wants without hesitation or embarrassment. Darcel doesn&apos;t pretend to be something she&apos;s not. She speaks her mind, stays true to her beliefs, and refuses to put on a mask just to impress others. What you see is exactly what you get. </personalityDescription>
