			<personalityDescription>Patience has never been Jamison&apos;s strong suit. They lean forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, their restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - they live for action, for motion, for doing something. Jamison always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear they think they&apos;re the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, they have a way of making others feel small without ever raising their voice. </personalityDescription>
