			<personalityDescription>Eva moves through life like a ghost, detached from the surrounding chaos. Orders are followed, tasks are completed, but there&apos;s no fire behind their actions - just a quiet acceptance that nothing really changes. Eva cycles through comms channels like they&apos;re flipping through music stations. Squad chatter, command directives, even open frequencies - if anyone is talking, they&apos;re listening. &quot;Eva, stay on our channel!&quot; &quot;I am - mostly.&quot; </personalityDescription>
