			<personalityDescription>Aileene refuses to do anything halfway. Whether it&apos;s war, business, or pleasure, she throws herself into everything with a level of intensity that&apos;s exhilarating - or terrifying, depending on where you stand. Aileene doesn&apos;t just enjoy the rush - she needs it. In the quiet moments, her hands shake, her mind won&apos;t stop racing. But when the crisis hits? She&apos;s steady, clear, unbreakable. Because if she&apos;s not in danger, she&apos;s not sure who she even is anymore. </personalityDescription>
