			<personalityDescription>Clara has a knack for thinking on her feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, she&apos;s always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. Clara stretches because it&apos;s something to control. Muscles loosen, joints adjust, everything works the way it&apos;s supposed to. Unlike her past mistakes. Unlike the ghosts she keeps running from. Her body has to be ready - because if it ever locks up, so will she. </personalityDescription>
