			<personalityDescription>With Mounga, what you see is what you get. They don&apos;t play games, don&apos;t manipulate, and don&apos;t bother with deception. Whether in battle or in conversation, they&apos;re always straightforward, even when the truth is hard to hear. Mounga doesn&apos;t believe in manufacturer guarantees. They don&apos;t care what the specs say - they need proof. So they push every piece of equipment past its redline, just to make sure it holds up when it really matters. &quot;If it survives me, it&apos;ll survive a battlefield.&quot; </personalityDescription>
