			<personalityDescription>Kara knows where she wants to be, and she knows how to get there. With a mix of charm, strategy, and just the right amount of risk-taking, she maneuvers her way toward success, making the right allies and cutting loose the dead weight as needed. Kara doesn&apos;t just think ahead - she sees ahead. She plays the long game, maneuvering people and events to her advantage, making sure every move she makes strengthens her position while others scramble to keep up. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Strategic climber. Makes allies, cuts weight, eyes always on the prize.&lt;br&gt;- Plays the long game like it&apos;s short. Everyone else is just a pawn.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
