			<personalityDescription>David treats every situation as an investment - whether in power, wealth, or influence. He instinctively spots angles others miss, turning setbacks into stepping stones and competition into leverage. David wasn&apos;t always like this. His phrases? They weren&apos;t his first. Some belonged to comrades who aren&apos;t around anymore. Some were last words. Some were muttered over comms, half-forgotten in the haze of war. He says them because if he doesn&apos;t, those people are truly gone. </personalityDescription>
