			<personalityDescription>Marjani chases every high, every challenge, every risk like she&apos;s possessed. Whether it&apos;s wealth, battle, or adrenaline, she can&apos;t stop herself from pushing further, faster, and harder - because the moment she slows down, she gets bored. And that is unacceptable. In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Marjani refuses to become just another manipulator. She holds onto her integrity, even when it costs her, because she knows that if she loses that, she&apos;s lost everything. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Restless, reckless, always hunting the next rush. Can&apos;t sit still.&lt;br&gt;- Holds the line on integrity, even when it hurts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
