			<personalityDescription>Djodja has big dreams and no intention of staying in the background. Whether it&apos;s becoming a legendary warrior, a feared commander, or a name spoken with respect across the Inner Sphere, they&apos;re always pushing themself toward something greater. Djodja is easy to like. They greet everyone with a smile, make conversation effortlessly, and genuinely enjoy getting to know people. Whether ally or stranger, they treat everyone with kindness and respect. </personalityDescription>
