			<personalityDescription>Sébastien doesn&apos;t believe in aimless effort - every action, every decision serves a purpose. He keeps his eyes on the prize, unwilling to let anything pull him off course. The repair bays stink of sweat and burnt wiring, the barracks always reek of gun oil, and the battlefield is worse. Sébastien fights the stink of war with an arsenal of lavender, sandalwood, and citrus candles. His squadmates mock him - until they realize his bunk actually smells nice. </personalityDescription>
