			<personalityDescription>Doubt and hesitation have no place in Cerelia&apos;s mind. Once she sets her course, nothing - not fear, not failure, not even overwhelming odds - will make her stray from it. Cerelia has no patience for obstacles - she removes them. Promotions, power, and prestige don&apos;t come to those who wait; they go to those who take them, and Cerelia fully intends to claim what she believes is her. </personalityDescription>
