			<personalityDescription>Once Rudy sets his sights on something, there&apos;s no shaking him. He&apos;ll keep coming, keep working, and keep fighting long after others would have given up, proving that sheer force of will can sometimes be the most dangerous weapon of all. Rudy moves through life with a hardened heart. Death, betrayal, and suffering don&apos;t faze him - they&apos;re just the natural order of things. He does what needs to be done and doesn&apos;t waste time mourning the cost. </personalityDescription>
