			<personalityDescription>Fenya exudes a fearless certainty that turns heads the moment he enters a room. Every word, every gesture carries an undeniable weight, as if doubt itself has no place in his world. Fenya keeps flipping comm channels because silence means something has gone wrong. Someone&apos;s down. A signal&apos;s lost. A squad isn&apos;t reporting back. He&apos;s seen too many signals go quiet forever - so he never stops listening, because the moment he does, he might miss someone&apos;s last words. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries weight just by entering a room. Commands presence without trying.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
