			<personalityDescription>Cian naturally takes control of every situation, expecting others to follow his lead without question. Whether on the battlefield or in command, he believes that authority is best wielded with absolute confidence - and little room for dissent. Cian sees every situation as a business opportunity. If there&apos;s money to be made, he&apos;s already working the angles, cutting deals, and making sure he walks away with the biggest share - preferably at someone else&apos;s expense. </personalityDescription>
