			<personalityDescription>Julian has a sharp mind and a keen eye for details. He quickly picks up on patterns, sees through deception, and understands situations faster than most, making him a formidable strategist both on and off the battlefield. Most people aren&apos;t worth Julian&apos;s attention - at least, that&apos;s how he sees it. Whether it&apos;s new recruits, subordinates, or anyone beneath his notice, he brushes them aside with a look of boredom and a dismissive wave. </personalityDescription>
