			<personalityDescription>Enough is never enough for Sjur. He overcommits, overkills, and overcompensates, whether it&apos;s unloading an entire magazine into a crippled enemy or turning a simple job into an all-consuming mission. If restraint is a virtue, Sjur never learned it. Reading between the lines is second nature to Sjur. He picks up on tone, body language, and unspoken concerns, responding with careful precision to make sure no detail - no matter how small - goes unnoticed. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Overcommits, overkills, overdoes. Restraint is a foreign concept.&lt;br&gt;- Misses nothing. Repeats nothing. Acts only when ready.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
