			<personalityDescription>Lonnie sees every challenge as an opportunity, but their hunger for success often blinds them to reality. They push past safe margins, ignoring warnings, convinced that as long as they keep moving forward, nothing can stop them - until it does. Lonnie is easy to like. They greet everyone with a smile, make conversation effortlessly, and genuinely enjoy getting to know people. Whether ally or stranger, they treat everyone with kindness and respect. </personalityDescription>
