			<performanceExamScore>47</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Some warriors fight to survive. Rob fights for the fun of watching others squirm. Whether it&apos;s taunting an outmatched opponent or deliberately crippling a &apos;Mek just to prolong the suffering, he always makes sure to enjoy himself. Rob gives because he knows what it&apos;s like to have nothing. He&apos;ll take the hard jobs, give up his share, and put himself in danger for the sake of others - even when it costs him more than he can afford to lose. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Enjoys watching others suffer. Fights for fun, not necessity.&lt;br&gt;- Gives more than they should. Probably won&apos;t stop until it breaks them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
