			<personalityDescription>Giap never second-guesses himself - why would he, when he&apos;s always right? Every word, every step; every decision is made with the certainty of someone who expects the universe to bend to his will. Giap doesn&apos;t believe in dead ends - only obstacles waiting to be overcome. No setback, failure, or rejection is enough to make him walk away from something he&apos;s committed to. </personalityDescription>
