			<personalityDescription>Türkol treats every piece of gear like a lifeline, stockpiling supplies in hidden caches and refusing to part with anything that might prove useful. Even when others go without, he holds tight to what he&apos;s gathered - just in case. Türkol feels everything - the pain, the fear, the suffering of those around him. It weighs on him, but he refuses to turn away, even when caring too much becomes a liability in a universe that rewards cruelty. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Has backup caches for backup caches. Won&apos;t crack them open unless dying.&lt;br&gt;- Carries others&apos; pain. Could break under it, but hasn&apos;t yet.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
