			<personalityDescription>For Selina, compromise is just another word for weakness. She sticks to her principles, strategies, and orders with unwavering determination, even when logic - or survival - suggests a different path. Even in the heat of war, Selina never loses sight of the people fighting beside her. Whether it&apos;s sharing supplies, covering for a comrade&apos;s mistake, or simply checking in, she proves that true leadership starts with empathy. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees compromise as failure. Principles trump survival instinct.&lt;br&gt;- Leads with empathy. The kind we need more of.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
