			<personalityDescription>Keith&apos;s greatest weapon isn&apos;t a gun - it&apos;s his ability to manipulate. He spins lies effortlessly, plants doubts where needed, and ensures that by the time the truth comes out, he&apos;s already taken what he wanted. Keith&apos;s attention to detail is unmatched. Whether reviewing battlefield intel or adjusting a targeting system, he works tirelessly to ensure every factor is in his favor - because in his world, overlooking one detail is a mistake he refuses to make. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lies like breathing. By the time truth lands, they&apos;re long gone and richer.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t blink without a checklist. Won&apos;t move until every variable&apos;s locked down.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
