			<personalityDescription>The more dangerous the path, the more certain Lynn is that it&apos;s the right one. They move forward without fear, seeing every unknown as a puzzle to solve, a victory to claim, or a story to tell later. Lynn is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. They roll their eyes, mutter under their breath, and get annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, they still get the job done. </personalityDescription>
