			<personalityDescription>Peter doesn&apos;t believe in overthinking - if an idea crosses their mind, it&apos;s already halfway to reality. Every decision is made in the moment, with no time wasted on doubt or second-guessing. Peter doesn&apos;t pressure people - they make them think they&apos;re making their own choices. Their calm demeanor, well-placed words, and ability to read a situation let them guide conversations where they want them to go, without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been led. </personalityDescription>
