			<personalityDescription>Larry thrives on audacity. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether he&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, he does it all with a smirk and a shrug. Larry grips hands like he&apos;s afraid to let go, like he&apos;s holding onto something real in a universe where people vanish in an instant. His squad has seen it before - he shakes hands like it might be the last time. And too often, it is. </personalityDescription>
