			<personalityDescription>Mahi builds her life on lies, and she&apos;s good at it. False identities, rigged contracts, and backroom deals are just part of the game she plays. The real trick isn&apos;t just fooling people - it&apos;s making sure they never realize they&apos;ve been fooled at all. Mahi never says what she really means. Every compliment is layered with hidden intent, every deal comes with unspoken conditions, and every alliance is built on words that sound sincere but are ultimately hollow. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Lives in a house of cards and dares you to knock.&lt;br&gt;- You don&apos;t see the knife til it&apos;s already in your back.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
