			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Ludwig acts. They don&apos;t wait for orders, approval, or the perfect moment - they take control, make the call, and ensures things get done their way. Ludwig lives fast and takes everything to the extreme. Whether it&apos;s indulging in pleasures, taking insane risks, or chasing impossible goals, they never slow down. Moderation is for people who are afraid to live. </personalityDescription>
