			<personalityDescription>Fadhila&apos;s drive is infectious. Her sheer enthusiasm and determination make people believe in her, rallying allies to her side and pushing them to go further than they ever thought possible. Fadhila is known for being fearless - until a situation involves heights. She avoids cliffs, refuses to stand near edges, and takes every alternate route possible. &quot;Yeah, yeah, I know it&apos;s the &apos;quickest way.&apos; It&apos;s also a death sentence.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 57%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes others by sheer force of will. Drive spreads like fire.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
