			<personalityDescription>Amalgarbha treats the impossible like an invitation. He never slows down, never looks back, and never lets fear dictate his choices - because, to him, fear is just an excuse he refuses to entertain. Amalgarbha thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. He&apos;s impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but him. </personalityDescription>
