			<personalityDescription>Jeannie doesn&apos;t believe in playing it safe. She thrives on risk, constantly pushing limits and daring fate to keep up - because to her, caution is just another word for hesitation. To Jeannie, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits her, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. She&apos;s not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits her most in the moment. </personalityDescription>
