			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Caution is boring, and Greg would rather go down in flames than play it safe. He lives for the thrill of insane risks, treating the battlefield like a proving ground for just how crazy he can get - and somehow, he usually pulls it off. Greg doesn&apos;t wait for things to happen - he makes them happen. Whether it&apos;s seizing the initiative in battle, fixing a problem before it escalates, or taking charge when others hesitate, he&apos;s always one step ahead. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Thrill-seeker. Battlefield is their playground. Somehow survives - so far.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t wait - acts. Always one step ahead of the mess.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
