			<personalityDescription>Beyza&apos;s energy is impossible to ignore. She drives conversations, sparks ideas, and keeps people moving, her sheer momentum pulling others along whether they&apos;re ready or not. Beyza sings softly, barely audible over the crackle of comms. It&apos;s an old war tune, a bar song, or some half-forgotten melody from a planet she barely remembers. The squad knows that if they hear her singing, the fight hasn&apos;t really started yet. If she stops? That&apos;s when things have gone bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Their energy drags others into action. Momentum becomes group inertia.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
