			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Taşkın refuses to bend. He will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in his mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Taşkın doesn&apos;t fight just to win; he fights the right way. He has rules, a code, a line he won&apos;t cross - even if it would make things easier. &quot;Honor matters,&quot; he says. &quot;Without it, we&apos;re just killers in metal coffins.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
