			<personalityDescription>Nivin meets everyone with suspicion and barely concealed aggression, always expecting betrayal. She sees the universe as a battlefield, where trust is a liability and violence is the only language that truly matters. Nivin doesn&apos;t just focus - she fixate. She drills her skills, studies her enemies, and plans every move with relentless intensity. To her, anything less than total commitment is the first step toward failure. </personalityDescription>
