			<personalityDescription>Steffen treats every piece of gear like a lifeline, stockpiling supplies in hidden caches and refusing to part with anything that might prove useful. Even when others go without, he holds tight to what he&apos;s gathered - just in case. Steffen&apos;s workspace is a model of precision. Tools are perfectly arranged, spare parts gleam under harsh lighting, and every surface is dust-free. Anyone who messes up his spotless system is likely to get a mop shoved into their hands and a long lecture on &quot;basic respect for shared spaces.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Has backup caches for backup caches. Won&apos;t crack them open unless dying.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
