			<personalityDescription>In a galaxy where hesitation means death, Paul carves a path forward with unwavering determination. They don&apos;t ask for permission and don&apos;t wait for approval - Paul acts, and others either follow or get left behind. Paul believes that strength isn&apos;t just about winning battles - it&apos;s about lifting others up. They offer encouragement when morale is low, step in when someone struggles, and always ensure those around them feel seen and valued. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Acts without asking. Leads by momentum. Others fall in line or fall behind.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t forget the people in the fight. Makes sure no one gets left behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
