			<personalityDescription>Loyda carries an air of barely restrained aggression, her words sharp and her patience nonexistent. Every conversation feels like a confrontation and that&apos;s how she likes it. Loyda remembers every slight - every ambush, every dirty trick, every insult over open comms. And she doesn&apos;t just get even - she makes sure whoever wronged her never forgets it. &quot;You thought I&apos;d forget what you did? That&apos;s adorable.&quot; </personalityDescription>
