			<personalityDescription>Svjetlana doesn&apos;t rush - she refines. Every plan, every shot, every move is calculated and practiced until it&apos;s second nature. She believes that mastery comes from discipline, and discipline comes from doing the work no one else is willing to. Svjetlana doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action she takes is calculated to serve her own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Repetition breeds mastery. Refines until perfection is habit.&lt;br&gt;- No favors, no debts. Operates on pure self-interest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
