			<personalityDescription>Inga measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To her, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw she has no intention of indulging. Inga doesn&apos;t just hoard weapons - she collects them. Laser rifles, old ballistics, experimental prototypes - her quarters look like a personal weapons depot. &quot;You say &apos;overkill,&apos; I say &apos;being prepared for any situation.&apos;&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Emotion is leverage, not weakness. Hesitation isn&apos;t tolerated.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
