			<personalityDescription>Isadorer never misses a chance to turn a profit. If there&apos;s a way to squeeze extra value out of a deal, a mission, or even a friend, she&apos;ll find it. Some call it ruthless - she calls it smart business. Isadorer has watched people fall to their deaths. She&apos;s seen what&apos;s left when they hit the ground. She remembers the silence right before impact. Her fear isn&apos;t irrational - it&apos;s experience. &quot;You ever hear the sound someone makes when they realize there&apos;s no way back up? I have.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Bleeds every deal dry. Doesn&apos;t care who&apos;s on the other end.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
