			<personalityDescription>Svjetlana doesn&apos;t just enjoy passion - she commands it. With a confident smirk and an irresistible charm, she draws others into her orbit, knowing exactly how to fuel the fire of desire and leave them wanting more. Svjetlana&apos;s words carry weight because they come from a place of honesty. She doesn&apos;t waste time with false flattery or empty promises - when she speaks, people listen, because they know she means it. </personalityDescription>
