			<personalityDescription>Mabel&apos;s intelligence isn&apos;t just about knowledge - it&apos;s about application. She adapts on the fly, finds solutions where others see dead ends, and always seens to know exactly what to say or do to shift a situation in her favor. Nothing moves Mabel anymore. Loss, suffering, and chaos are just background noise, and she doesn&apos;t waste energy pretending to care. Whether someone lives or dies, wins or loses - it&apos;s all the same in the end. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 32%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Turns setbacks into leverage without blinking.&lt;br&gt;- Watches suffering like it&apos;s weather - present, distant, irrelevant.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
