			<personalityDescription>Risk isn&apos;t something Hasnaa avoids - it&apos;s something she seeks. Whether facing an impossible mission or an untested idea, She meets every challenge with steady resolve and an eager grin. Hasnaa doesn&apos;t trust anyone to provide for her, so she keeps everything for herself. Every credit, every round of ammo, every salvageable scrap is hidden away because she knows that when things go bad, only those who&apos;ve prepared will survive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Seeks out risk. Smiles at impossible odds, eager for the test.&lt;br&gt;- Survivalist mindset. Would rather let others go without than run dry.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
