			<personalityDescription>Yi-ping doesn&apos;t wait for opportunity - he creates it. Whether it&apos;s training, strategizing, or climbing the ranks, he throws himself into every task with relentless determination, always pushing toward his next goal. No one knows when Yi-ping does it, but somehow, there&apos;s always a small paper crane, fox, or star waiting near his bunk, inside DropShips maintenance panels, or tucked into the ammo crates. &quot;Figure if we&apos;re always breaking things,&quot; he says with a shrug, folding another, &quot;I might as well make something for a change.&quot; </personalityDescription>
