			<personalityDescription>Chris sees uncertainty as an invitation rather than a threat. He steps into the unknown without hesitation, confident that no matter what awaits, he&apos;ll find a way through. Trusting Chris is like betting against the house - the game is already rigged. He knows how to talk, how to persuade, and how to convince people that they&apos;re making the right choice, even when it&apos;s all just another carefully designed con. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats uncertainty like a map. Goes first, figures it out mid-stride.&lt;br&gt;- Every word a hook - smiles while fleecing the mark.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
