			<personalityDescription>Maurice&apos;s drive is infectious. His sheer enthusiasm and determination make people believe in him, rallying allies to his side and pushing them to go further than they ever thought possible. Maurice&apos;s actions rarely follow a clear pattern. One moment, he&apos;s cautious and methodical; the next, he&apos;s diving headfirst into chaos. His unpredictability keeps enemies - and sometimes allies - on edge. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes others by sheer force of will. Drive spreads like fire.&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable. Keeps everyone guessing - sometimes that&apos;s an asset.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
