			<personalityDescription>Yoshimasa isn&apos;t just skilled - they&apos;re honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake they won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Yoshimasa&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping them alive. Yoshimasa doesn&apos;t get involved unless they have to. Other people&apos;s problems, moral dilemmas, or even the bigger picture don&apos;t concern them - they focus on what directly affects them and ignores the rest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 38%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Learned the hard way, remembers every lesson.&lt;br&gt;- Does the job. Doesn&apos;t care who signs the check.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
