			<reasoning>14</reasoning>
			<performanceExamScore>58</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Riena-Rachmatillah doesn&apos;t argue - they explain, as if talking to a child who just can&apos;t grasp the obvious. Every interaction feels like a lesson, delivered with an exasperated sigh and the unshakable certainty that they&apos;re always right. Riena-Rachmatillah doesn&apos;t just fear fire - they&apos;ve watched it consume people. They&apos;ve heard the screams, smelled the smoke, seen what&apos;s left after an Inferno. And they know that if they ever ends up in that situation, there won&apos;t be anything left to save. &quot;I&apos;d take a bullet over fire. A hundred times over. At least a bullet leaves something behind.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Every correction feels like a lecture. Grates on nerves fast.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
