			<personalityDescription>Moire knows that greatness isn&apos;t given - it&apos;s earned. She pushes herself harder than anyone else, refusing to accept limits, because in her mind, every struggle brings her closer to her ultimate goal. In a universe full of deception, Moire is refreshingly straightforward. She says what she means, does what she promises, and refuses to play games just to gain favor. Her word is one of the few things that can be trusted. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pushes harder than most. Sees struggle as proof they&apos;re on the right path.&lt;br&gt;- Straight shooter. Won&apos;t bend, won&apos;t budge, won&apos;t lie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
