			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Nairna doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - she&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. She&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw her way to the top, no matter who gets in her way. Nairna refuses to let war reduce her to grunts and curses. She speaks in layered, precise language because it reminds her that she&apos;s still human. That she&apos;s still thinking. Because the moment she starts speaking like the others - like a killer - she knows there&apos;s nothing left to save. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
