			<personalityDescription>Tariq never raises his voice when a well-placed sentence will do. He doesn&apos;t just smooth things over - he reshapes conversations to his advantage, leaving even his rivals wondering how they ended up agreeing with him. Tariq doesn&apos;t do favors, doesn&apos;t owe loyalty, and certainly doesn&apos;t sacrifice for anyone. Every action he takes is calculated to serve his own interests, and if someone gets left behind, that&apos;s just the price of doing business. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t argue - redirects. Leaves opponents convinced they won.&lt;br&gt;- No favors, no debts. Operates on pure self-interest.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
