			<personalityDescription>Addy&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. She scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts her will so thoroughly that those around her rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Addy never lets things go, but she doesn&apos;t always act on it directly. Instead, she makes snide comments, &quot;forgets&quot; to relay important information, and subtly undermines people in ways that are just deniable enough to avoid confrontation. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;br&gt;- Undermines with a smile - dangerous.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
