			<personalityDescription>Lorenzo&apos;s enjoyment of conflict goes far beyond strategy or skill. There&apos;s a gleam in his eye whenever someone else is hurting, a twisted satisfaction in knowing that the suffering is entirely his doing. Lorenzo isn&apos;t just skilled - he&apos;s honed. Every lesson was learned the hard way, every scar a reminder of a mistake he won&apos;t make twice. In a world where the weak don&apos;t last, Lorenzo&apos;s expertise is the only thing keeping him alive. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 43%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Finds pleasure in cruelty. Hurt is the goal, not the side effect.&lt;br&gt;- Learned the hard way, remembers every lesson.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
