			<personalityDescription>Lucille lives by one rule: act now, figure out the details later. They barrel through obstacles with sheer confidence, trusting that if things go wrong, they&apos;ll deal with it when they get there - assuming they even care. Even in the heat of war, Lucille never loses sight of the people fighting beside them. Whether it&apos;s sharing supplies, covering for a comrade&apos;s mistake, or simply checking in, they prove that true leadership starts with empathy. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Charges through obstacles. Plans on-the-fly, if at all. May improvise into disaster.&lt;br&gt;- Leads with empathy. The kind we need more of.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
