			<personalityDescription>Justin isn&apos;t content with where he is - his eyes are always on the horizon. He sees every challenge as a stepping stone, every setback as a lesson, all leading toward the future he&apos;s determined to claim. Justin has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. He lies, cheats, and takes whatever he pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In his mind, the only crime is getting caught. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 56%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not satisfied with now. Every obstacle is part of the climb.&lt;br&gt;- Laughs at guilt like it&apos;s a bad joke.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
