			<personalityDescription>Giacobbe doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - he&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. He&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw his way to the top, no matter who gets in his way. Giacobbe sings softly, barely audible over the crackle of comms. It&apos;s an old war tune, a bar song, or some half-forgotten melody from a planet he barely remembers. The squad knows that if they hear him singing, the fight hasn&apos;t really started yet. If he stops? That&apos;s when things have gone bad. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 36%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
