			<personalityDescription>Anandam knows what he wants and isn&apos;t afraid to take charge. Whether on the battlefield or in a briefing room, he speaks with confidence and expects to be heard - hesitation is not in his vocabulary. Anandam will do whatever it takes to survive and profit. He switches sides when the money&apos;s right, abandons allies if the deal goes sour, and never lets sentiment get in the way of a paycheck. If someone wants loyalty, they&apos;d better pay extra. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 68%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Speaks with confidence, expects compliance. No tolerance for indecision.&lt;br&gt;- Switches sides mid-fight if the payout shifts. Not to be trusted without a signed contract.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
