			<personalityDescription>Shrabana is a force of nature - chaotic, relentless, and impossible to pin down. Her tactics shift constantly, her decisions keep enemies guessing, and her sheer momentum makes her nearly impossible to stop once she sets her sights on something. &quot;Cover me!&quot; Shrabana&apos;s squad shouts, diving for cover. Shrabana, standing still, replies, &quot;Cover you with what? Suppressive fire? Smoke? A tarp?&quot; While her squad groans, she&apos;s already assessing precisely what they need - because in battle, clarity matters. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Unpredictable, high-pressure operator - don&apos;t get in their way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
