			<personalityDescription>For Baia, hesitation is just another form of failure. She throws herself into danger without a second thought, making split-second calls that can mean brilliance or disaster - but either way, she never slows down. Baia may work support, but she&apos;s built like an elite commando. She wakes up before the MekWarriors to train, runs extra PT drills, and somehow convinces maintenance crews to do push-ups while waiting for system diagnostics. She insists it&apos;s just a hobby, but when she casually deadlifts a supply crate meant for two people, no one&apos;s sure anymore. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Hesitation rejected. Decisions made mid-charge. High risk, high volatility.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
