			<personalityDescription>Nothing satisfies Nathara for long. She hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand her fortune - no matter the cost to those around her. Nathara kneels, mutters a phrase in a language no one recognizes, and presses her fingers against the barrel of her weapon for exactly five seconds. &quot;What are you doing?&quot; someone finally asks. She shrugs. &quot;Making sure we got through this one clean.&quot; They don&apos;t ask again. </personalityDescription>
