			<personalityDescription>Tim thrives on risk, always pushing limits and taking chances others wouldn&apos;t dare. Whether piloting through a storm of enemy fire or attempting a near-impossible maneuver, he believes that fortune favors the bold. Tim doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. He sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if he has something to say, people will know it matters. </personalityDescription>
