			<personalityDescription>Dakshayani moves through life with absolute certainty, her presence commanding attention without the need for theatrics. When she speaks, it&apos;s with purpose - direct, confident, and impossible to ignore. Dakshayani doesn&apos;t just look down on others - she barely acknowledges them. She sees herself as superior in every way, treating allies as tools and enemies as annoyances. If someone disagrees with her, it&apos;s because they&apos;re too stupid to understand why she&apos;s right. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Commands attention by presence alone. No showmanship - just certainty.&lt;br&gt;- Barely acknowledges teammates. Sees people as tools or distractions.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
