			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a glint in Paola&apos;s eye that never quite fades, a restless energy that crackles just beneath the surface. Whether in conversation or silence, there is an intensity to them, quiet delight in the inevitable breakdown of order. The universe is broken, and Paola knows it. They don&apos;t get involved in arguments, don&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly don&apos;t stick their neck out for anyone. As far as they&apos;re concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Carries constant hunger. Intensity even at rest.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fight. Doesnt flinch. Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
