			<personalityDescription>For Lucas, there&apos;s always a next step, a bigger challenge, a greater prize to chase. No victory is ever enough - he&apos;s always looking beyond the horizon for the next opportunity to climb higher. Lucas doesn&apos;t just use weapons and equipment - he studies them. He can quote weight distribution, fire rates, and optimal calibration settings from memory. &quot;Lucas, just fire the damn thing!&quot; someone shouts. &quot;Not before I confirm its heat efficiency tolerances,&quot; he replies, flipping through a dog-eared field guide. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 59%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No victory lasts. Chasing the next big thing is the real drive.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
