			<personalityDescription>Ares carries himself like a living legend, utterly convinced of his own greatness. Whether he deserves the reputation doesn&apos;t matter - he believes it, and that&apos;s enough for him. Patience has never been Ares&apos;s strong suit. He leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, his restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - he lives for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
