			<personalityDescription>Ebere isn&apos;t interested in debates or second opinions - she&apos;s here to get things done. Her confidence is a stabilizing force, her direction clear, and when others waver, they instinctively look to her to lead the way. Money isn&apos;t just a goal for Ebere - it&apos;s a skill. She spots opportunities others miss, investing in the right places at the right time, always ensuring that whatever she puts in, she gets twice as much back. </personalityDescription>
