			<personalityDescription>Jung-gwon operates with a relentless sense of purpose, never allowing distractions or setbacks to pull him off course. Every failure is just another lesson, every victory another step toward his ultimate goal. When the fight begins, Jung-gwon&apos;s voice is calm, rhythmic, measured. A stanza here, a line there, whispered into comms like a battle hymn. His squad doesn&apos;t know whether to be inspired or unsettled. His enemies? They just think he&apos;s insane. </personalityDescription>
