			<personalityDescription>Chin-seok doesn&apos;t just react to situations - he creates them. He manipulates events from behind the scenes, setting traps, forcing hands, and maneuvering his way to the top before anyone realizes they were playing his game all along. Chin-seok measures success in wealth and power, and he refuses to settle for anything less than everything. If there&apos;s something to gain, he&apos;ll take it - no matter the cost. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pulls strings from the dark. Never in the spotlight, always in control.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt take a slice - takes the whole damn pie.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
