			<performanceExamScore>51</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>For Marc, battle is about domination - breaking the enemy&apos;s line, their machines, and their spirit. He fights like a force of nature, unrelenting and merciless, never stopping until there&apos;s nothing left but smoking wreckage. Marc refuses to abandon his squad, even when it means putting himself in danger. He&apos;s the one diving into enemy fire to pull a comrade out, the one holding the line so others can escape. &quot;You go,&quot; he says, standing firm. &quot;I&apos;ll make sure they don&apos;t follow you.&quot; </personalityDescription>
