			<personalityDescription>To Abra, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits her, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. She&apos;s not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits her most in the moment. Abra rigs the barracks door to announce everyone&apos;s full rank and name when they enter. She swaps someone&apos;s comm ID so they sound exactly like the unit commander. Even in the middle of a war, she finds ways to make people laugh - because sometimes, that&apos;s the only thing keeping them from breaking. </personalityDescription>
