			<personalityDescription>Curt is a natural at what he does. Whether it&apos;s piloting, strategy, or problem-solving, he picks things up quickly and executes with precision, making even the most difficult tasks look effortless. People want to believe Curt. His words are smooth, his arguments airtight, and his timing impeccable. He plants ideas like seeds, letting them take root until others think they were their own all along. </personalityDescription>
