			<personalityDescription>Takiyah&apos;s leadership style leaves no room for autonomy. She scrutinizes every action, corrects every mistake before it happens, and exerts her will so thoroughly that those around her rarely get the chance to think for themselves. Embarrassment is for other people. Takiyah takes what she wants, says what she pleases, and never worries about how she&apos;s perceived. If someone doesn&apos;t like it, that&apos;s their problem, not her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Smothers autonomy. Others follow not by choice - but by lack of room to do otherwise.&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t care how it looks - as long as it works.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
