			<personalityDescription>Gail has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, her sharp mind and keen perception give her an edge in any encounter. Gail doesn&apos;t believe in singular focus. She&apos;s coordinating movements, rechecking systems, listening to multiple comms channels - all while actively engaging the enemy. &quot;You can focus on one thing at a time,&quot; she scoffs. &quot;Or you can actually keep up.&quot; </personalityDescription>
