			<personalityDescription>Saira isn&apos;t just careful - she&apos;s possessive. She stashes supplies, claims the best loot before anyone else, and resists sharing even when she has more than enough. If someone wants something from her, they&apos;d better be ready to trade big. The universe is broken, and Saira knows it. She doesn&apos;t get involved in arguments, doesn&apos;t waste time on idealism, and certainly doesn&apos;t stick her neck out for anyone. As far as she&apos;s concerned, nothing really matters in the long run. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- First to the salvage, last to offer help. Everything&apos;s a personal stockpile.&lt;br&gt;- Doesnt fight. Doesnt flinch. Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
