			<personalityDescription>Jamison doesn&apos;t believe in impossible. Every setback is just another problem to solve, every failure a lesson to be learned. No matter how long it takes or how hard the road, she refuses to turn back. Empathy is a luxury Jamison doesn&apos;t afford herself. She operates with cold efficiency, avoiding emotional entanglements and unnecessary attachments. Others may struggle with choices - she simply makes them and never looks back. </personalityDescription>
