			<personalityDescription>To Maya, honor is just another tool - useful when it suits her, disposable when it doesn&apos;t. She&apos;s not bound by loyalty or ideals, only by what benefits her most in the moment. Maya doesn&apos;t just check if something works - she checks if it can survive abuse. She runs systems hotter, pushes components harder, and doesn&apos;t stop until something fails spectacularly. &quot;Oh, come on, it says it can handle this - so let&apos;s find out.&quot; </personalityDescription>
