			<personalityDescription>The universe breaks the weak, but Clementine refuses to bend. They will fight, bleed, and suffer before ever conceding an inch - because in their mind, the only way to truly lose is to give in. Clementine has been battered, broken, and left for dead more times than they can count - but they&apos;re still here. Pain, loss, and suffering don&apos;t slow them down; they fuel them, turning every setback into another reason to keep fighting. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Would rather suffer than yield. Sees concession as defeat.&lt;br&gt;- Pain fuels the fire. Still here, still fighting.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
