			<personalityDescription>Chien-shih doesn&apos;t believe in fair fights or noble causes. He shifts alliances, bends the truth, and rewrites the rules as he goes, ensuring that no matter what happens, he&apos;s the one who wins. Chien-shih has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply his presence, he reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes and breaks alliances as needed - outcome&apos;s all that matters.&lt;br&gt;- Makes people feel seen. That alone can turn a losing fight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
