			<personalityDescription>Rage fuels Luzvimindo like a reactor running hot, always on the edge of boiling over. He fights with raw fury, never backing down, never letting a slight go unanswered - whether it&apos;s an enemy on the battlefield or an insult in the mess hall. Luzvimindo has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to his side. Whether he&apos;s negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking his way out of trouble, his confidence and charm make it hard to say no. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fueled by anger. Never lets an insult slide - on or off the field.&lt;br&gt;- Could sell ice to a snowbound Mek crew.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
