			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Anthony is probably already doing it. He doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - he buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Anthony&apos;s presence alone is enough to lift spirits. His confidence is contagious, his words ignite courage, and his actions prove that even against impossible odds, there&apos;s always a way forward. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases danger for fun. Dares what others dismiss. Laughs off rules.&lt;br&gt;- Rallies troops with words and actions. No false bravado.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
