			<personalityDescription>Bob&apos;s charm is as polished as it is deceptive. He tells people exactly what they want to hear, making them feel valued - until they realize too late that his loyalty was nothing more than an illusion. Bob has to hear what&apos;s going on. Friendly lances, enemy signals, background noise - he constantly switches between them. &quot;Gotta stay informed,&quot; he says. His lance jokes that he probably knows the enemy&apos;s dinner plans before they do. </personalityDescription>
