			<personalityDescription>Christa has a way with words and an even better way with deals. She can navigate complex negotiations, twist situations in her favor, and come out ahead in any conversation. If someone tries to con her, they&apos;d better be ready to lose. Christa doesn&apos;t just shake hands - she grips with both hands, shakes firmly, and holds on just a little too long. &quot;Good to meet you, friend! We&apos;re going to do great things together!&quot; Her enthusiasm is infectious, but some recruits worry they&apos;ve just signed an unspoken blood pact with her. </personalityDescription>
