			<personalityDescription>Regina doesn&apos;t believe in stopping - ever. No setback, no injury, no force in the universe can keep her from pushing forward until she&apos;s achieved what she set out to do. Regina has a rare gift: the ability to make others feel seen. Whether with a few words, a knowing glance, or simply her presence, she reminds people that they are not alone in their struggles. </personalityDescription>
