			<personalityDescription>Lillian sees rules as obstacles, not boundaries. If there&apos;s a shortcut to be taken or a loophole to exploit, she&apos;ll find it - ethics and fairness be damned. Lillian clutches onto everything she can get her hands on, unwilling to share or let anything slip through her fingers. She&apos;ll betray, deceive, and exploit if it means keeping herself ahead - because in her mind, scarcity is just another battlefield. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats rules like suggestions. Never plays clean.&lt;br&gt;- Grips every scrap like it&apos;s life support. Won&apos;t share. Won&apos;t blink.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
