			<personalityDescription>Corinne naturally takes control of every situation, expecting others to follow her lead without question. Whether on the battlefield or in command, she believes that authority is best wielded with absolute confidence - and little room for dissent. When others falter, Corinne keeps moving. She refuses to accept failure as an option, pushing forward with relentless determination, no matter how long it takes to succeed. </personalityDescription>
