			<personalityDescription>Balbina doesn&apos;t believe in right or wrong - only what works. They lie, cheat, and betray without hesitation, using people as stepping stones on their path to power. If someone trusted them, they&apos;ve already made their last mistake. Balbina counts steps, counts supplies, counts the seconds between each transmission ping. If something isn&apos;t accounted for, it bothers them. &quot;How many crates were moved?&quot; &quot;Forty-six.&quot; &quot;You didn&apos;t even check.&quot; &quot;I know.&quot; And they&apos;re always right. </personalityDescription>
