			<personalityDescription>Radomira&apos;s strength isn&apos;t just in battle - it&apos;s in people. She connects with others effortlessly, making them feel heard, valued, and understood. Whether leading a unit or comforting a friend, her empathy draws others to her. Radomira used to feel more, used to let herself react. But she&apos;s seen too many people lose control, seen how fast things spiral the moment someone lets fear in. Now, she keeps it buried - because survival demands it. &quot;You think staying calm is easy? No. But it&apos;s the only reason I&apos;m still here.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Connects with the crew fast. Morale anchor.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
