			<personalityDescription>Zaiba stands firm when others falter, facing danger with unwavering resolve. she doesn&apos;t flinch under fire, believing that true bravery isn&apos;t about being fearless - it&apos;s about acting despite the fear. Zaiba doesn&apos;t rush - she refines. Every plan, every shot, every move is calculated and practiced until it&apos;s second nature. She believes that mastery comes from discipline, and discipline comes from doing the work no one else is willing to. </personalityDescription>
