			<personalityDescription>Shenaz doesn&apos;t need recognition - she just wants her people to succeed. Whether in battle, in planning, or in moments of doubt, she offers steady, unwavering support that reminds others they&apos;re never truly alone. Her hands shake after missions, so she bites her nails. It gives her something to focus on, something small to control when everything else spirals beyond her grasp. If her fingers are raw, if her nails are ruined - well, at least it&apos;s proof she&apos;s still here. At least it&apos;s her own damage, not someone else&apos;s. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not in it for glory. Just wants the team to make it home.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
