			<personalityDescription>Mike&apos;s presence in battle is like a wildfire - unstoppable, all consuming, and utterly devastating. There&apos;s no hesitation, no mercy, just the raw, unfiltered instinct to tear through whatever stands before him. If Mike&apos;s on your side today, don&apos;t count on him tomorrow. He&apos;s an expert at playing both sides, shifting allegiances, and making sure he always lands on top - no matter who he has to betray. </personalityDescription>
