			<personalityDescription>To Rasuna, hesitation is just another word for failure. She throws caution aside, charging headlong into danger with raw aggression and an utter disregard for self-preservation. If survival means second-guessing, then maybe survival isn&apos;t worth it. Rasuna has a way with words and an even better way with deals. She can navigate complex negotiations, twist situations in her favor, and come out ahead in any conversation. If someone tries to con her, they&apos;d better be ready to lose. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ignores self-preservation. Sees hesitation as death. Risk of early burnout.&lt;br&gt;- Silver tongue and iron grip - gets what they want, walks away clean.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
