			<personalityDescription>Arshia is always spoiling for a fight, whether it&apos;s on the battlefield or in a bar. She thrives on confrontation and never backs down, turning even the smallest slight into an excuse to throw a punch - or fire a shot. Arshia is the kind of person who remembers names, listens to stories, and makes people feel valued. Whether in the heat of battle or in downtime between missions, her ability to connect with others makes her the heart of any crew. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Picks fights over nothing. Escalates at the drop of a hat. Dangerous in close quarters.&lt;br&gt;- Even the grunts open up to them. That says a lot.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
