			<personalityDescription>Gadi doesn&apos;t just fight to win - they fight to annihilate. Enemies aren&apos;t obstacles to be overcome; they&apos;re targets to be erased, and they won&apos;t stop until the battlefield is silent. Gadi doesn&apos;t believe in second chances or sentimental attachments. If someone can&apos;t keep up, they&apos;re left behind. They see emotions as liabilities, and nothing - not guilt, grief, or regret - will slow them down. </personalityDescription>
