			<personalityDescription>Ray is a walking powder keg, always a moment away from igniting. His temper flares fast and burns bright, leaving little room for reason once he&apos;s set on a path - whether right or wrong. Ray lives life on his own terms, never second-guessing himself or feeling bad for taking risks. He&apos;ll say what others won&apos;t, do what others fear, and walk away grinning, no matter the fallout. </personalityDescription>
