			<personalityDescription>The line between confidence and recklessness is one Alisanne never bothers to acknowledge. She acts on impulse, ignores warnings, and barrels forward at full speed, trusting that she&apos;ll figure things out before it&apos;s too late. Alisanne has a way of seeing things that others miss. Whether it&apos;s reading people, predicting enemy movements, or understanding complex situations, her sharp mind and keen perception give her an edge in any encounter. </personalityDescription>
