			<personalityDescription>Where others see only the surface, Musfira digs deeper. She picks up on the smallest tells, the hidden motivations, the why behind every action - turning knowledge into power before anyone realizes she has it. Musfira speaks in the same steady, flat tone whether she&apos;s giving orders, dodging fire, or watching a disaster unfold. She operates like a machine, precise and deliberate, even as everything around her burns. &quot;We handle it. That&apos;s all. Doesn&apos;t matter how bad it looks.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees the motive, not the motion. Can predict a betrayal before it starts.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
