			<personalityDescription>Betty makes it seem like she&apos;s a team player, but everything she does is carefully crafted to benefit herself first. She&apos;s always angling for the best outcome for her, making sure that when the dust settles, she&apos;s the one standing on top. Betty has watched entire towns vanish under &apos;Mek fire. She&apos;s seen warriors pulped by autocannons meant for armored targets. And the worst part? Most MekWarriors don&apos;t seem to care, they just continue walking forward like nothing happened.&quot; </personalityDescription>
