			<personalityDescription>Indecision is just another form of weakness, and Arouge refuses to entertain it. She makes the call, moves forward, and never looks back - because in the brutal reality of war, second-guessing gets people killed. Arouge refuses to let hardship define her. She&apos;s weathered every storm life has thrown at her, adapting, enduring, and proving that no amount of pain or pressure can break her will. </personalityDescription>
