			<personalityDescription>Foster doesn&apos;t see the point in fighting for a bigger slice of the pie when he&apos;s already got enough to get by. Others can stress over promotions and prestige - he&apos;ll take his time, do what&apos;s necessary, and enjoy life without all the extra pressure. Foster has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. He can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get his way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where he wants them to go. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows their lane. Won&apos;t leave it. Won&apos;t look up.&lt;br&gt;- Gets agreement without argument. Smooth operator.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
