			<personalityDescription>No task is too small, no detail too minor for Satenig to overlook. They work tirelessly, knowing that success isn&apos;t about talent alone - it&apos;s about dedication, preparation, and an unwillingness to settle for mediocrity. Satenig tells stories not because they&apos;re entertaining, but because they refuse to let people be forgotten. They speak of old battles, fallen comrades, places that don&apos;t exist anymore. They remember so that others won&apos;t have to. Or maybe, because they know no one else will. </personalityDescription>
