			<personalityDescription>Where others hesitate, Daryl acts. They don&apos;t wait for orders, approval, or the perfect moment - they take control, make the call, and ensures things get done their way. Daryl operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, they&apos;re playing it safe; the next, they&apos;re charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with them is a challenge - predicting them is impossible. </personalityDescription>
