			<personalityDescription>Yamune doesn&apos;t just reach for power - she grabs for it, no matter the cost. Her ambition drives her to overextend, making enemies and burning bridges as she chases goals that always seem just out of reach. One day, she&apos;ll push too far, and there&apos;ll be no coming back. &quot;Yamune appreciates your patience. Yamune is considering your request. Yamune will now take a moment to think.&quot; She speaks like she&apos;s playing a role in a script only she knows. People have stopped asking why - Yamune wouldn&apos;t explain anyway. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ambition outweighs sense. Making enemies faster than allies.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
