			<personalityDescription>Riyadh doesn&apos;t know the meaning of the word quit. No matter how many times they&apos;re knocked down, outmaneuvered, or told something is impossible, they keep pushing forward until they get the result they want. Riyadh is easy to like. They greet everyone with a smile, make conversation effortlessly, and genuinely enjoy getting to know people. Whether ally or stranger, they treat everyone with kindness and respect. </personalityDescription>
