			<personalityDescription>Valeriu doesn&apos;t dwell on uncertainty. They process information quickly, chooses a course of action, and moves forward without hesitation - confident that momentum is the key to victory. Valeriu always wants more - more money, more resources, more power. No matter how much they gain, it&apos;s never enough, and they&apos;ll do whatever it takes to keep stacking up wealth and influence. </personalityDescription>
