			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Sanjaya is probably already doing it. He doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - he buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Sanjaya approaches his work with the discipline of a warrior. He follows personal principles, respects hierarchy and tradition, and refuses to cut corners. To him, every role is part of the battle, and he performs his with absolute dedication. </personalityDescription>
