			<personalityDescription>Malu&apos;s expertise isn&apos;t just learned - it&apos;s ingrained. Whether adapting to new challenges or refining old skills, he performs with a level of competence that leaves others struggling to keep up. Responsibility doesn&apos;t sit well with Malu. Whether it&apos;s managing a unit, maintaining his gear, or following through on commitments, he tends to let things fall apart and expects someone else to clean up the mess. </personalityDescription>
