			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, and impossible odds mean nothing to Unggul. He will fight until the mission is done, even if it means crawling from the wreckage to finish the job with his bare hands. Unggul isn&apos;t just chasing a dream - he&apos;s clawing for survival in a universe that doesn&apos;t care. He knows ambition alone won&apos;t get him there, and he&apos;s willing to fight, bleed, and sacrifice to make sure he&apos;s not just another forgotten warrior. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 39%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Will finish the mission bleeding and broken if needed. Pure willpower.&lt;br&gt;- Fighting for more than glory - fighting to be remembered. Survival with purpose.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
