			<personalityDescription>Nursevin does what&apos;s required, nothing more, nothing less. She isn&apos;t lazy - she just sees ambition as a fool&apos;s game, one that leads to stress, betrayal, and an early grave. Nursevin loves the spotlight and works hard to stay in it. She boasts, exaggerates, and makes sure her victories are as public as possible. While her ego can be exhausting, her charm and sheer confidence make it hard to completely dislike her. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not lazy, just finished trying. No threat, no spark.&lt;br&gt;- Wants the spotlight. Needs the praise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
