			<personalityDescription>Nothing Aberashid does is by chance - he plays the long game, reading between the lines and thinking five steps ahead. By the time others realize what&apos;s happening, he&apos;s already won. Aberashid is never caught off guard. He reads situations in real time, adjusts his strategy on the fly, and always has a backup plan - or three. No matter how bad things get, he finds a way to turn the fight in his favor. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Always several moves ahead. Opponents realize too late they&apos;ve lost.&lt;br&gt;- Reads the battlefield like a map he drew himself.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
