			<personalityDescription>Amina doesn&apos;t waste time with indecision or second-guessing - she makes the call and expects others to keep up. Amina isn&apos;t rude, just efficient - after all, in the heat of battle, clear orders save lives. Amina has seen people die because a system failed under real conditions. She doesn&apos;t trust any spec sheet - she only trusts what she&apos;s tested herself. If that means she destroys some gear in the process, so be it. It&apos;s better than losing people because someone trusted an untested number on a screen. </personalityDescription>
