			<personalityDescription>People trust Artur because they know he&apos;s real. He doesn&apos;t put on a facade or tell people what they want to hear - he tells them what they need to hear. His sincerity makes him a reliable friend and an unwavering ally. No matter what&apos;s happening, Artur finds a way to comment on it. &quot;Oh, another system failure? I&apos;m shocked. Truly.&quot; His coworkers groan, but when things get stressful, his humor is sometimes the only thing keeping them from snapping. </personalityDescription>
