			<personalityDescription>Cynthia doesn&apos;t just take charge - she owns every situation she steps into. Her presence alone demands compliance, and she has little patience for those who hesitate to fall in line. Cynthia always seems to be at the right place at the right time, making the right deals. She knows when to buy, when to sell, and when to walk away with a fortune while everyone else is still figuring out what just happened. </personalityDescription>
