			<personalityDescription>Theresa is always in motion - quick to adapt, quick to lead, and quick to take action. Whether on the battlefield or in negotiations, they bring an energy that keeps things moving forward, never letting stagnation take hold. Theresa has a natural gift for getting people to listen without feeling pressured. They can steer conversations, soften harsh truths, and get their way without anyone realizing they&apos;ve been guided exactly where they want them to go. </personalityDescription>
