			<personalityDescription>José doesn&apos;t believe in overthinking - if an idea crosses his mind, it&apos;s already halfway to reality. Every decision is made in the moment, with no time wasted on doubt or second-guessing. People exhaust him, and trust is a luxury he can&apos;t afford. José keeps his distance, avoids unnecessary interactions, and only engages when absolutely necessary. Solitude isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s survival. </personalityDescription>
