			<personalityDescription>Banu trusts exactly one person to get things done right - herself. She nitpicks every detail, overrides decisions she doesn&apos;t like, and refuses to delegate unless she has no other choice. Money isn&apos;t just a goal for Banu - it&apos;s a skill. She spots opportunities others miss, investing in the right places at the right time, always ensuring that whatever she puts in, she gets twice as much back. </personalityDescription>
