			<personalityDescription>Some call it paranoia; Nichole calls it survival. She keeps her eyes open, her mind sharp, and her instincts honed, because the moment she lets her guard down, she knows that&apos;s when disaster will strike. Nichole brings an infectious energy to everything she does. She&apos;s the first to charge into battle, the last to leave the bar, and somehow always has the stamina for one more round - whether it&apos;s a firefight or a drinking contest. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Calls it survival, not paranoia. Guard never drops, not for a second.&lt;br&gt;- Brings fire to everything. Fights hard, parties harder, never fades.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
