			<personalityDescription>Gloria refuses to settle for mediocrity. Every step she takes is calculated, every move designed to propel her forward - because in her mind, staying still is just another form of failure. Gloria&apos;s hunger for success, control, or destruction knows no limits. She takes and takes, pushing herself and others past the breaking point, never feeling like it&apos;s enough. Her drive isn&apos;t ambition - it&apos;s addiction. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Refuses stagnation. Standing still equals failure in their book.&lt;br&gt;- Pushes past limits like they don&apos;t exist. Burnout risk? Doesnt care.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
