			<personalityDescription>Subtlety and patience have never been Thanh-Tan&apos;s strengths. They speak before thinking, act before planning, and never apologize for either. If boldness is a virtue, then they consider themself a saint. No matter how hardened the universe tries to make them, Thanh-Tan refuses to shut themself off from others. They carry their burdens as if they were their own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. </personalityDescription>
