			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no such thing as &quot;good enough&quot; in Lluz&apos;s world. She pushes harder, works longer, and refuses to stop until she&apos;s exactly where she wants to be - because to her, success is the only acceptable outcome. Lluz hates when people turn basic tasks into logistical nightmares. If she sees someone struggling with pointless extra steps, she can&apos;t help but step in. &quot;Just do it like this - see? Done. No headaches. Why are we making this complicated?&quot; </personalityDescription>
