			<performanceExamScore>53</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Saeed doesn&apos;t just want success - they demand it. They climb over anyone in their way, cutting deals, betraying allies, and making sacrifices without hesitation. In their mind, the weak stay where they are, and the strong take what they deserve. Saeed stays calm under pressure, never raising their voice, never letting stress crack through. Alarms blaring? Still focused. People panicking? They&apos;re already handling the problem. &quot;Losing your head won&apos;t fix it. Focus.&quot; </personalityDescription>
