			<personalityDescription>Lizaveta knows best - just ask her. Whether it&apos;s battle tactics, logistics, or how to hold a damn coffee cup, she has an opinion and makes sure everyone hears it. If Lizaveta had more hands, she would probably try to do everyone&apos;s job at the same time. Lizaveta doesn&apos;t just oppose the enemy - she despires them. Any attempt at rationalizing, debating, or finding common ground sets her on edge. &quot;You think they&apos;d show you the same sympathy? They wouldn&apos;t. So stop wasting your breath.&quot; </personalityDescription>
