			<personalityDescription>Gürsel refuses to stand still, his mind always racing with new ideas, new angles, new possibilities. His adaptability keeps him one step ahead, shifting gears effortlessly while others struggle to keep up. Gürsel doesn&apos;t simplify things out of laziness - he does it because he&apos;s seen what happens when systems collapse under their own weight. The more complex something is, the more likely it is to fail at the worst possible moment. Simple isn&apos;t just better - it&apos;s safer. </personalityDescription>
