			<personalityDescription>Budiman refuses to quit, no matter how tough the fight gets. They keep pushing forward, adapting, enduring, and overcoming, because in their mind, the only real defeat is giving up. Budiman isn&apos;t just quick - they&apos;re calculated. They anticipate problems before they arise and maneuver people and situations to their advantage. By the time others react, they&apos;ve already executing their next move. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Keeps going no matter what. Adaptable, unyielding - quitting isn&apos;t an option.&lt;br&gt;- Anticipates, then executes. Already in motion while others are thinking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
