			<personalityDescription>Dali operates with a singular, unyielding drive. Whether it&apos;s perfecting his skills or executing a plan, he devotes himself completely, unwilling to let anything stand in his way. Dali isn&apos;t loud about his support, but it&apos;s always there. A nod at the right time, an unspoken gesture of help, or simply being present when it matters - his strength lies in knowing exactly what people need, even when they don&apos;t ask for it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pours everything into one task at a time. Refuses to be diverted.&lt;br&gt;- Knows what you need before you ask. Delivers, quiet and sure.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
