			<personalityDescription>If it&apos;s crazy, reckless, or just plain stupid, Jamie is probably already doing it. He doesn&apos;t just flirt with danger - he buys it a drink and takes it for a ride, laughing in the face of common sense all the way. Jamie doesn&apos;t dress things up, doesn&apos;t soften the truth. He calls things exactly as they are, and if that means dropping more expletives than actual words, so be it. &quot;You want me to phrase it nicely? Fine. We&apos;re totally ****ed.&quot; </personalityDescription>
