			<personalityDescription>Violence isn&apos;t just a tool for Joseph - it&apos;s the default setting. He sees every interaction as a challenge, every stare as a provocation, and every battle as a chance to break something... or someone. Peace is just the pause before the next conflict. Joseph&apos;s excitement is contagious. He approaches every challenge with boundless energy, hyping up his team and keeping morale high. Even when the odds look bad, he&apos;s the first to grin and say, &quot;Let&apos;s do this.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 48%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Interprets peace as waiting room for violence. Every glance is a challenge.&lt;br&gt;- Brings energy - keeps morale up even when the odds suck.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
