			<personalityDescription>Nobuhisa treats every challenge like a battle of endurance, convinced that if he just holds out long enough, the world will bend before he does. Sometimes it works - sometimes it just makes life harder for everyone around him. Nobuhisa always has a smug remark loaded, making it painfully clear he thinks he&apos;s the smartest person in the room. Whether through subtle jabs or outright mockery, he has a way of making others feel small without ever raising his voice. </personalityDescription>
