			<personalityDescription>Malika doesn&apos;t just have confidence - she has certainty. In her mind, she&apos;s always the smartest, strongest, and most capable person around, and anyone who disagrees is simply too blind to see it. Malika thrives on spontaneity, making split-second decisions that seem reckless - until they somehow work. She&apos;s impossible to predict, always thinking three steps ahead in ways that make no sense to anyone but her. </personalityDescription>
