			<personalityDescription>Epestemiya operates with a singular, unyielding drive. Whether it&apos;s perfecting her skills or executing a plan, she devotes herself completely, unwilling to let anything stand in her way. It doesn&apos;t matter what she&apos;s doing - Epestemiya has a list for it. Daily tasks? Listed. Emergency protocols? Color-coded and categorized. Someone asks her about inventory? She flips through her secondary list to cross-reference the real list. No one knows how she keeps track of so much, but without her, the whole operation would grind to a halt. </personalityDescription>
