			<personalityDescription>Mark&apos;s generosity isn&apos;t just about giving - it&apos;s about ensuring others have what they need. Whether he&apos;s sacrificing his own comfort, pulling strings to help a friend, or making sure no one is left behind, he never hesitates to step up. Mark keeps things running like clockwork, but if anyone so much as touches his mug, they&apos;re in for a lecture. &quot;You want coffee? Fine. You don&apos;t use this mug.&quot; He&apos;s signed off on impossible job lists without blinking, but the day someone borrowed his mug? That was a crisis. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sacrifices comfort for crew. Good heart, dangerous habit.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
