			<personalityDescription>Bill could sell shorts on an ice world and still walk away with a profit. He weaves half-truths, dodges direct answers, and always has an excuse ready - because if you can talk your way out of trouble, why bother telling the truth? No matter how ruthless the battlefield becomes, Bill refuses to let it harden him. He protects, he comforts, and he never forgets that behind every fight, there are lives that still matter. </personalityDescription>
