			<personalityDescription>Judy doesn&apos;t bend, doesn&apos;t break, and certainly doesn&apos;t back down. Her resolve is a force of nature, pushing her forward even when everything else is telling her to stop. No matter how ruthless the world gets, Judy refuses to compromise her integrity. She sticks to her word, treats people with genuine respect, and never says something just for the sake of appearances. </personalityDescription>
