			<personalityDescription>Harrison has a way of making people believe in themselves, even when they don&apos;t. His steady confidence and unwavering support push others beyond their limits, proving that they&apos;re stronger than they ever realized. Harrison doesn&apos;t just check if something works - he checks if it can survive abuse. He runs systems hotter, pushes components harder, and doesn&apos;t stop until something fails spectacularly. &quot;Oh, come on, it says it can handle this - so let&apos;s find out.&quot; </personalityDescription>
