			<personalityDescription>Florence isn&apos;t afraid of consequences - she simply doesn&apos;t think about them. She jumps before looking, commits before planning, and laughs in the face of disaster, because for her, the thrill of the risk is always worth it. Florence believes in results, not feelings. She dismisses emotions as distractions and refuses to waste time comforting others. To her, facts, logic, and action matter - sympathy does not. </personalityDescription>
