			<personalityDescription>Allen&apos;s grudges are legendary. Whether it&apos;s a minor disagreement or a perceived disrespect, they keep a running tally of offenses and find creative ways to make sure people pay for them - often long after they&apos;ve forgotten what they did. Allen doesn&apos;t believe in impossible problems. If something can&apos;t be done, they find another way. Their solutions are unconventional, creative, and sometimes reckless, but they always work. &quot;If the rulebook says it can&apos;t be done, the rulebook is wrong.&quot; </personalityDescription>
