			<personalityDescription>Glenna doesn&apos;t just chase profits - they extract them. They cut costs, exploit loopholes, and squeeze every last drop out of a deal, no matter who gets shortchanged in the process. If there&apos;s money to be made, morality is just an inconvenience. Glenna thrives in the company of others, feeding off their energy and returning it tenfold. Whether swapping war stories, cracking jokes, or turning a quiet gathering into a full-blown celebration, they know how to bring people together. </personalityDescription>
