			<personalityDescription>Diem-Thuy acts on instinct, rarely stopping to consider the consequences before charging ahead. Whether on the battlefield or in conversation, she prefers action over hesitation - sometimes to her own detriment. Diem-Thuy doesn&apos;t believe in second chances or sentimental attachments. If someone can&apos;t keep up, they&apos;re left behind. She sees emotions as liabilities, and nothing - not guilt, grief, or regret - will slow her down. </personalityDescription>
