			<personalityDescription>Ivan operates on impulse, changing direction at a moment&apos;s notice. One day, he&apos;s playing it safe; the next, he&apos;s charging into a situation no sane person would touch. Keeping up with him is a challenge - predicting him is impossible. Ivan doesn&apos;t think being support staff means being unarmed. He&apos;s got sidearms stashed in toolkits, a shotgun behind a supply crate, and at least one knife strapped somewhere no one expects. &quot;Look, I don&apos;t plan for things to go south - I just make sure when they do, I&apos;m still standing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- No warning before a hard turn. Can&apos;t rely on them to stick to plan.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
