			<personalityDescription>Isagani has a way with words, effortlessly swaying people to his side. Whether he&apos;s negotiating a deal, rallying a unit, or talking his way out of trouble, his confidence and charm make it hard to say no. Isagani doesn&apos;t care about standard procedures or official methods. If there&apos;s a faster, more efficient, or completely unconventional way to do something, he&apos;s already doing it. &quot;Oh, you wanted it done properly? No. I got it done right.&quot; </personalityDescription>
