			<personalityDescription>Caution is for those who expect to live forever, and Kenny has no such illusions. He charges into the most dangerous situations with unwavering resolve, knowing that fortune - and survival - favors only those bold enough to seize it. Kenny is always willing to share, whether it&apos;s resources, time, or advice. He looks out for his allies, making sure no one goes without, and doesn&apos;t hesitate to lend a hand when someone needs it. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Accepts danger as part of the job. Charges forward with purpose, not illusion.&lt;br&gt;- Always bringing extras - makes sure no one&apos;s left empty-handed.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
