			<personalityDescription>Nada&apos;s patience is as short as her temper is explosive. She doesn&apos;t wait, doesn&apos;t deliberate - she reacts, fast and forceful, often leaving those around her scrambling to keep up. Nada&apos;s novel is perpetually unfinished, but that doesn&apos;t stop her from talking about it like it&apos;s just a few chapters away from being complete. &quot;Yeah, I&apos;m almost done. Just need to rewrite the beginning. And the middle. And maybe the end.&quot; </personalityDescription>
