			<personalityDescription>Chau-Trinh is ruled by her desires, chasing pleasure with reckless abandon. She consumes, indulges, and takes what she wants without concern for the consequences, leaving behind a trail of broken promises and burned bridges. Chau-Trinh doesn&apos;t just commit - she over-commits. If she&apos;s fixing something, it&apos;s getting rebuilt from scratch. If she&apos;s preparing for a job, she&apos;s triple-checking everything. &quot;You don&apos;t need to go that far,&quot; someone says. Chau-Trinh just shrugs. &quot;If you&apos;re doing something, why not do it completely?&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Chases pleasure like it&apos;s a mission objective. Leaves wreckage behind.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
