			<personalityDescription>Fear is for the weak, and Robert has no patience for it. They throw themself into battle with wild abandon, ignoring risks and consequences. Whether it&apos;s bravery or a death wish, sooner or later, it&apos;s going to catch up with them. Robert believes the best way to handle a crisis is to prevent it before it happens. They stay ahead of the curve, anticipating challenges and solving problems before anyone else even sees them coming. </personalityDescription>
