			<personalityDescription>Jake makes it all look easy. Whether it&apos;s navigating a battlefield, negotiating a deal, or fixing a &apos;Mek with limited resources, he handles it with skill, confidence, and just the right amount of flair. Jake&apos;s handshakes are too firm, too eager, too desperate. Like he&apos;s making sure you know you exist, that you&apos;re real, that you&apos;re still here. Because the last time he let someone go without a proper handshake, they walked into a battle they didn&apos;t walk out of. And he&apos;s been making up for it ever since. </personalityDescription>
