			<personalityDescription>For Kao-tsu, compromise is just another word for weakness. They stick to their principles, strategies, and orders with unwavering determination, even when logic - or survival - suggests a different path. Kao-tsu has a slippery relationship with the truth, bending it whenever it suits them. Whether they&apos;re bluffing an enemy, exaggerating their achievements, or making promises they never intend to keep, they always have a way with words. </personalityDescription>
