			<personalityDescription>Farhat has survived things that should have killed her - more than once. No matter how many times she gets knocked down, she just keeps getting back up, proving that sometimes, sheer refusal to die is a strategy all its own. Farhat throws out a pair of finger guns like it&apos;s all under control. Like things aren&apos;t crumbling, like the latest casualty report doesn&apos;t hurt, like she&apos;s still someone who can crack jokes and keep going. Because if she ever stops... what then? </personalityDescription>
