			<personalityDescription>Stuart plays to win, and he doesn&apos;t care how messy it gets. Whether it&apos;s business, politics, or the battlefield, he exploits weaknesses, eliminates competition, and ensures he&apos;s the last one standing - no matter the cost. Stuart isn&apos;t cruel, but he doesn&apos;t see the point in getting emotionally invested. He makes decisions based on logic, not feelings, and while others may take things personally, he simply shrugs and moves on. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays dirty, wins clean. Eliminates threats without blinking - cost is irrelevant.&lt;br&gt;- Shrugs off blood, blame, and bad calls. Keeps walking.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
