			<personalityDescription>Falley adapts faster than anyone else. He thrives in unpredictability, adjusting his approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes his way - no matter who gets left behind. Falley handles supply crates, repair tools, and even paperwork with gloved hands. &quot;You do not want to know how dirty these surfaces are,&quot; he insists while disinfecting a shipment manifest. The tech crews roll their eyes, but when they see what actually grows inside a poorly maintained coolant line, they start wondering if he&apos;s got a point. </personalityDescription>
