			<personalityDescription>Linda doesn&apos;t believe in sharing, trusting, or sacrificing for others. The universe is cruel, and only those who look out for themselves survive. If someone expects her to stick her neck out for them, they&apos;re in for a rude awakening. Diplomacy is second nature to Linda. She reads people like an open book, adjusting her words and approach to persuade without pressuring, ensuring that even those who disagree walk away feeling like they&apos;ve been heard. </personalityDescription>
