			<personalityDescription>Pain, exhaustion, even death - none of it matters. Emma will see her mission through to the bitter end, no matter the cost. Stubbornness and sheer willpower keep her standing long after others have fallen. Emma is good at her job, but she&apos;ll never admit it. No matter how well she manages things, she acts like a single misstep could doom the entire unit. She&apos;ll triple-check orders, then apologize for bothering people about them. If you thank her, she&apos;ll probably just say, &quot;Oh, it wasn&apos;t much, really. Sorry if it was.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pain means nothing. Mission above all. Stands long after support falls.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
