			<personalityDescription>Money isn&apos;t just a goal for Muammar - it&apos;s a skill. He spots opportunities others miss, investing in the right places at the right time, always ensuring that whatever he puts in, he gets twice as much back. Muammar has seen too many situations turn disastrous because everyone panicked at the wrong moment. He refuses to be that guy. If no one else can keep their head, he will. Because if someone doesn&apos;t stay calm, then no one makes it out. </personalityDescription>
