			<personalityDescription>Atso isn&apos;t heartless, just detached. He doesn&apos;t feel the need to intervene, fix things, or fight for anything beyond his own survival. If someone expects him to care, they&apos;ll be sorely disappointed. Atso doesn&apos;t believe in the idea of &apos;safe zones.&apos; He&apos;s seen support staff get wiped out, seen people die reaching for weapons they didn&apos;t have. He refuses to be helpless when the fighting reaches him. If war comes, he&apos;s bringing his own guns to the fight. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 66%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Detached, not cruel - but don&apos;t count on backup.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
