			<personalityDescription>Charles doesn&apos;t just focus - he fixate. He drills his skills, studies his enemies, and plans every move with relentless intensity. To him, anything less than total commitment is the first step toward failure. Charles&apos;s off-duty clothes tend to feature animal motifs - subtle at first, but obvious once you notice the pattern. He&apos;s not embarrassed about it, and when someone points it out, he just shrugs. &quot;It&apos;s comfortable. And honestly? It looks good.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Fixates. Trains, studies, plans - every move laser-precise.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
