			<personalityDescription>Widodo doesn&apos;t wait for opportunity - he creates it. Whether it&apos;s training, strategizing, or climbing the ranks, he throws himself into every task with relentless determination, always pushing toward his next goal. Trying to anticipate Widodo&apos;s next move is a waste of time. He follows no pattern, sticks to no script, and seems to act purely on instinct - sometimes brilliant, sometimes reckless, but always unpredictable. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Makes their own opportunities. Relentless pursuit of the next goal.&lt;br&gt;- Wild card. Dangerous. Might save the mission - or sink it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
