			<personalityDescription>No matter how hardened the universe tries to make him, Hemmu refuses to shut himself off from others. He carries their burdens as if they were his own, always willing to stand beside those who feel lost or alone. Here&apos;s your mission briefings, and a surprise!&quot; Hemmu grins as a warrior opens the box to find a single bright pink paint can labeled &apos;EXPERIMENTAL CAMO.&apos; He&apos;s mastered the art of harmless, mildly infuriating pranks - but never enough to get himself actually fired. </personalityDescription>
