			<personalityDescription>Pain is just another weapon in Ouko&apos;s arsenal, and she wield it with ruthless precision. She doesn&apos;t rush to end a fight; she draws it out, savoring every moment of her opponent&apos;s fear and despair. Ouko believes she&apos;s meant for something more, and every battle, every mission, every hard-earned victory is a step toward proving it. Even when the odds are against her, she refuses to stop striving for the future she knows she can reach. </personalityDescription>
