			<personalityDescription>While others argue and analyze, Yi-Hsia is already in motion. She doesn&apos;t need endless deliberation to see the best path forward - Yi-Hsia weighs the options, picks a course, and executes it with ruthless efficiency. Trusting Yi-Hsia is like betting against the house - the game is already rigged. She knows how to talk, how to persuade, and how to convince people that they&apos;re making the right choice, even when it&apos;s all just another carefully designed con. </personalityDescription>
