			<personalityDescription>Mai doesn&apos;t waste time on moral debates - she does what needs to be done. If that means breaking promises, cutting corners, or stepping over someone to get ahead, so be it. Mai never lets things go, but she doesn&apos;t always act on it directly. Instead, she makes snide comments, &quot;forgets&quot; to relay important information, and subtly undermines people in ways that are just deniable enough to avoid confrontation. </personalityDescription>
