			<personalityDescription>Subtlety has never been Alma&apos;s strong suit. She speaks in hard facts and brutal honesty, never sugarcoating her words or wasting time on delicate phrasing. If someone doesn&apos;t like it, that&apos;s their problem. Alma doesn&apos;t hesitate - she just acts. System failure? She&apos;s on it before anyone finishes panicking. Major logistical issue? Already moving to fix it. &quot;Less talking, more doing.&quot; </personalityDescription>
