			<personalityDescription>Patrícia adapts faster than anyone else. She thrives in unpredictability, adjusting her approach on the fly and taking full advantage of every chance that comes her way - no matter who gets left behind. Patrícia is the guy who sighs loudly when someone asks a dumb question. She rolls her eyes, mutters under her breath, and gets annoyed over small things - but beneath the grumbling, she still gets the job done. </personalityDescription>
