			<performanceExamScore>54</performanceExamScore>
			<personalityDescription>Jae-chun measures everything - risks, rewards, weaknesses - before making a move. To him, emotion is just another factor to manipulate, and hesitation is a flaw he has no intention of indulging. Nothing satisfies Jae-chun for long. He hoards wealth, demands more, and always looks for the next deal, the next scheme, the next way to expand his fortune - no matter the cost to those around him. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Emotion is leverage, not weakness. Hesitation isn&apos;t tolerated.&lt;br&gt;- Always chasing the next payout. Never sticks around after the take.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
