			<personalityDescription>Carolina knows how to get the most out of people and situations. Whether it&apos;s leveraging favors, bending the rules, or pushing people just hard enough to get results, she always makes sure she&apos;s coming out ahead. Carolina doesn&apos;t criticize to be difficult - she criticizes because she knows what happens when details get overlooked. The smallest oversight can spiral into catastrophe. If she&apos;s harsh, if she&apos;s relentless, it&apos;s because she&apos;s seen how easily things fall apart when people stop paying attention. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 51%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Knows how to squeeze blood from stone - always walks away with more than they gave.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
