			<personalityDescription>In a universe built on lies and betrayals, Bonnie refuses to become just another manipulator. She holds onto her integrity, even when it costs her, because she knows that if she loses that, she&apos;s lost everything. &quot;You really believe that alarm will go off when it&apos;s supposed to? That&apos;s... optimistic.&quot; Bonnie treats every emergency system as already broken. If something hasn&apos;t failed yet, it&apos;s because it hasn&apos;t a chance to. </personalityDescription>
