			<personalityDescription>Tammy doesn&apos;t believe in rushing headfirst into a situation - she dissects it first. She considers risks, weighs benefits, and ensures that every move she makes is deliberate, calculated, and designed for maximum impact. Tammy has seen people die because a system failed under real conditions. She doesn&apos;t trust any spec sheet - she only trusts what she&apos;s tested herself. If that means she destroys some gear in the process, so be it. It&apos;s better than losing people because someone trusted an untested number on a screen. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Dissects every situation before stepping in. No surprises.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
