			<personalityDescription>Vid has an instinct for spotting opportunities before anyone else. They&apos;re always watching, always analyzing, ready to capitalize on any weakness, hesitation, or shift in circumstance. Patience has never been Vid&apos;s strong suit. They lean forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, their restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - they live for action, for motion, for doing something. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 55%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sees opportunity before it&apos;s visible. Moves first, reaps the reward.&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
