			<personalityDescription>Rachelia doesn&apos;t just stand beside her allies - she lifts them up. Whether it&apos;s covering for a mistake, offering quiet reassurance, or taking the weight off someone&apos;s shoulders, she ensures that no one fights alone. Rachelia isn&apos;t afraid of solitude. She&apos;s afraid of what happens to her in solitude. The thoughts that come back, the ghosts that settle in, the weight of everything she&apos;s lost pressing down on her all at once. &quot;You think being alone just means no one&apos;s around? No. It means there&apos;s no one left.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Covers your six without being asked. Carries more than their weight.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
