			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s a fire in Bob&apos;s eyes that never dims, a relentless drive that refuses to acknowledge limits. Whether facing a challenge or simply making his presence known, he moves through life like he&apos;s already won. Bob collects tales of the past - because someone has to. The contracts lost, the MekWarriors who never came back, the deals that went south. If he stops talking, if he stops telling these stories, it&apos;ll be like they never existed at all. And he refuses to let that happen. </personalityDescription>
