			<personalityDescription>Felicia doesn&apos;t get angry - she gets efficient. Killing isn&apos;t about rage or revenge; it&apos;s about eliminating threats as quickly and effectively as possible. If she has to wipe out an entire company to make a point, so be it. Felicia operates with a singular, unyielding drive. Whether it&apos;s perfecting her skills or executing a plan, she devotes herself completely, unwilling to let anything stand in her way. </personalityDescription>
