			<personalityDescription>Lacey&apos;s excitement is contagious. She approaches every challenge with boundless energy, hyping up her team and keeping morale high. Even when the odds look bad, she&apos;s the first to grin and say, &quot;Let&apos;s do this.&quot; Lacey can&apos;t give a briefing, tell a story, or even trash-talk an enemy without animated, sweeping gestures. She&apos;s nearly smacked her own comrades more than once while explaining a maneuver mid-battle. She fights just as expressively - every reload, every charge, every headshot somehow feels like it belongs in an action holo. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 49%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Brings energy - keeps morale up even when the odds suck.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
