			<personalityDescription>Laura doesn&apos;t just dream of greatness - she&apos;s willing to do whatever it takes to achieve it. Compromise, mercy, and hesitation are for those too weak to seize what they want. She&apos;ll fight, scheme, and claw her way to the top, no matter who gets in her way. Laura doesn&apos;t just believe in the legend of the Black Marauder - she treats it like fact. She&apos;s heard the stories, maybe even witnessed the impossible. &quot;You ever see a lance go silent with no explanation? Yeah. That&apos;s it. The Black Marauder&apos;s real - and if it comes for you, you just don&apos;t see it coming.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 47%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Ruthless when needed. Mercy optional. Will climb over anyone in the way.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
