			<personalityDescription>There&apos;s no middle ground with Angelia - everything is turned up to eleven. She doesn&apos;t just prepare; she over-prepares. She doesn&apos;t just act; she goes all out. If there&apos;s a way to dial it back, she hasn&apos;t found it yet. Every decision Angelia makes is rooted in logic and foresight. She doesn&apos;t get caught up in reckless ambition or emotional distractions - she plays the long game, ensuring that her choices serve a greater strategy. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 63%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Cranks every dial to max. No balance, no brakes.&lt;br&gt;- Long-game thinker. Doesn&apos;t blink at setbacks - plans for aftermath.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
