			<personalityDescription>Delano&apos;s appetite for pleasure is as boundless as his ambition. Whether it&apos;s the thrill of the chase, the rush of conquest, or the warmth of fleeting intimacy, he indulges in life&apos;s vices without hesitation or regret. Delano doesn&apos;t believe in measured risks. He doesn&apos;t pull back, doesn&apos;t hold back, and never takes a fight expecting to retreat. &quot;If you&apos;re already in, then be all in.&quot; He&apos;s either the first in the fight or the last one standing. There is no middle ground. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 53%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Treats vice like victory. Always hunting the next high.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
