			<personalityDescription>Jerry is never caught off guard. He reads situations in real time, adjusts his strategy on the fly, and always has a backup plan - or three. No matter how bad things get, he finds a way to turn the fight in his favor. Once, Jerry might have cared. Now, he just drifts. Wars rage, alliances shift, people come and go, and none of it moves him. He does what&apos;s necessary to get by, but passion and purpose are long-forgotten luxuries. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Reads the battlefield like a map he drew himself.&lt;br&gt;- Burned out long before we met them. Just ash in uniform.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
