			<personalityDescription>Wani doesn&apos;t just lead - he elevates those around him. Whether it&apos;s a rousing speech before battle, a quiet word of encouragement, or leading by example, he makes people feel like they can accomplish the impossible. Wani&apos;s workspace is never quiet. Whether it&apos;s a steady beat, a slow melody, or something completely chaotic, there&apos;s always some kind of sound filling the air. &quot;I work better with music. And you? You&apos;ll get used to it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
