			<personalityDescription>Once Kawthar commits to something, that&apos;s the end of the discussion. No argument, no persuasion, no force in the universe is enough to shake her resolve once she&apos;s made up her mind. Kawthar never stops - because stopping means thinking, and thinking means facing the ghosts that haunt her. She fights, trains, and pushes herself beyond exhaustion, running from a past that never quite lets her rest. </personalityDescription>
