			<personalityDescription>Aurélio doesn&apos;t just avoid conflict - he redirects it. A well-placed phrase, a subtle shift in tone, or a carefully chosen silence can turn an argument into an opportunity, ensuring that things go his way without force. Aurélio has seen too many quiet moments shattered by disaster. He&apos;s lived through peace turning into chaos in an instant. So he never fully relaxes, never lets his guard down, because he knows what happens when you do. &quot;The second you start thinking you&apos;re safe, that&apos;s when it happens. That&apos;s when you lose everything.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 42%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Redirects conflict like a pro. Never seen them lose their temper.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
