			<personalityDescription>Patience has never been Maria&apos;s strong suit. She leans forward in every briefing, itching to get moving, her restless energy practically vibrating through the room. Sitting still isn&apos;t an option - she lives for action, for motion, for doing something. Maria doesn&apos;t just care about getting somewhere - she enjoys the process of getting there. The planning, the movement, the sense of progress. &quot;A base is just a place. The mission? That&apos;s a story unfolding in real time.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Can&apos;t sit still - lives for the green light.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
