			<personalityDescription>David attacks every opportunity with unshakable enthusiasm, eyes gleaming with the thrill of the challenge ahead. Whether it&apos;s a fight, a negotiation, or a risky venture, he&apos;s always the first to jump in, hungry for the next test of his skills. David doesn&apos;t just handle tasks - he prepares for them. Before getting to work, before checking manifests, before signing a single form, he stretches. &quot;Gotta stay loose,&quot; he says, rolling his neck before approving a basic request. </personalityDescription>
