			<personalityDescription>Kelby doesn&apos;t just take charge - he owns every situation he steps into. His presence alone demands compliance, and he has little patience for those who hesitate to fall in line. Kelby isn&apos;t just careful - he&apos;s possessive. He stashes supplies, claims the best loot before anyone else, and resists sharing even when he has more than enough. If someone wants something from him, they&apos;d better be ready to trade big. </personalityDescription>
