			<personalityDescription>Glen believes he&apos;s the best, and he acts like it. Whether he&apos;s fighting for his life, strategizing, or calling the shots, he never doubts himself - even when he really should. Glen has an unbreakable routine. &quot;It&apos;s efficient,&quot; he says. But if someone tries to rush him, he still sticks to his routine. &quot;Break the order,&quot; he mutters, &quot;and that&apos;s when things go wrong.&quot; </personalityDescription>
