			<personalityDescription>Iris didn&apos;t get this far by being naive. She&apos;s seen every trick, survived every scam, and learned how to play the game better than most. She trusts no one, always keeps an edge, and makes sure she&apos;s the one doing the exploiting - not the other way around. Iris never outright says she has a problem, but she&apos;s always positioning herself near exits, keeping space between herself and others, and avoiding rooms that feel too small. &quot;I&apos;ll stand. Don&apos;t need to sit. Yeah, the corner&apos;s fine. More space.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 98%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not fooled easily. Seen the worst, and learned to profit from it.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
