			<personalityDescription>Torborg thrives on impulse, driven by an unshakable belief that momentum is more important than caution. Plans are for people who doubt themselves - Torborg simply does, and lets the universe catch up. Torborg has a knack for thinking on her feet, catching subtleties others miss, and responding with razor-sharp wit. Whether in battle or conversation, she&apos;s always a step ahead, ready with a clever solution - or a cutting remark. </personalityDescription>
