			<personalityDescription>Subtlety isn&apos;t Nikolaus&apos;s style - why waste time sneaking when he can just punch through the front door? He charges in, guns blazing, daring anyone to try and stop him. Tactics are for cowards - brute force gets the job done faster. Nikolaus fights for one thing: the highest bidder. He&apos;s not interested in honor, loyalty, or causes - just cold, hard cash and a contract that keeps him alive and well-paid. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Doesn&apos;t sneak. Doesn&apos;t flank. Prefers head-on assaults. No nuance.&lt;br&gt;- Hired gun. No cause, no loyalty - just money.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
