			<personalityDescription>Ryan believes that hesitation is just another way to lose. He trusts his instincts, makes the call, and commits fully - because in his mind, the worst decision is no decision at all. Ryan doesn&apos;t waste time on second chances or sentiment. He does what needs to be done, no matter the cost, because in his world, only the strong deserve to survive. </personalityDescription>
