			<personalityDescription>Aaron never stops - because stopping means thinking, and thinking means facing the ghosts that haunt them. They fight, train, and push themself beyond exhaustion, running from a past that never quite lets them rest. Aaron doesn&apos;t just move - they propel themself forward with unstoppable energy. They thrive in fast-paced environments, where quick thinking and decisive action separate the victors from the forgotten. </personalityDescription>
