			<personalityDescription>Most people call it bravery, but Hamza just calls it fun. He thrives on chaos, laughs in the face of danger, and treats every brush with death like just another story to tell over drinks. Hamza always has an excuse, a clever explanation, or a way to shift blame. He might sound sincere, but when push comes to shove, he&apos;ll disappear, take the better offer, or leave others holding the bag. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Danger is entertainment. Laughs at risk. Borderline thrill-seeker.&lt;br&gt;- Slippery. Never in the wrong, never where you left them.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
