			<personalityDescription>To Muriyani, control isn&apos;t just a preference - it&apos;s a necessity. They demand obedience and tolerates no weakness, bending others to their will through sheer force of personality or, if needed, raw intimidation. Muriyani doesn&apos;t just win - they make sure everyone knows they won. They taunt enemies, overplays their hand, and takes flashy risks just for the sake of proving they can. They&apos;re good - they just might not be as good as they think. </personalityDescription>
