			<personalityDescription>Ayana doesn&apos;t just lead - she inspires. Whether through quiet words of reassurance or a rallying cry before battle, she fuels those around her with the drive to keep moving, keep fighting, and keep believing in victory. Ayana needs to know why people do what they do. If someone takes an unexpected approach, if a decision seems even slightly unusual, she&apos;s asking way too many questions about it. &quot;Oh, interesting choice - why? No, really, walk me through it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Not just a leader - makes people want to follow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
