			<personalityDescription>Patsy plays to win, and she doesn&apos;t care how messy it gets. Whether it&apos;s business, politics, or the battlefield, she exploits weaknesses, eliminates competition, and ensures she&apos;s the last one standing - no matter the cost. Patsy doesn&apos;t just keep up - she stays ahead. She spots angles others miss, adapts on the fly, and always seems to know the right move before anyone else has even figured out the game. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 50%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Plays dirty, wins clean. Eliminates threats without blinking - cost is irrelevant.&lt;br&gt;- Always two moves ahead. Makes the rest of us look slow.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
