			<personalityDescription>If there&apos;s a risk to take, Bert is already halfway through it. They thrive on danger, seeing every challenge as an opportunity and every battle as an adventure waiting to unfold. Safe choices are for lesser warriors. Bert is never satisfied - their hunger for power, resources, and dominance knows no limits. They devour opportunities, crush competition, and take what they want without hesitation. Sooner or later, even their allies will wonder if they&apos;re next. </personalityDescription>
			<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 54%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Risks draw them in. Sees combat as challenge, not threat.&lt;br&gt;- Will strip allies for parts if they&apos;re the last thing left to take.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
