				<performanceExamScore>45</performanceExamScore>
				<personalityDescription>Jonatan isn&apos;t just careful - he&apos;s possessive. He stashes supplies, claims the best loot before anyone else, and resists sharing even when he has more than enough. If someone wants something from him, they&apos;d better be ready to trade big. Jonatan won&apos;t touch new systems until they&apos;ve been through hell and back. &quot;They say this interface makes things &apos;more efficient.&apos; Yeah? Let&apos;s see how &apos;efficient&apos; it is when it inevitably crashes at the worst time.&quot; He&apos;s always got a backup plan because he&apos;s always expecting failure. </personalityDescription>
				<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 40%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- First to the salvage, last to offer help. Everything&apos;s a personal stockpile.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
