				<personalityDescription>Emmanuel has no guilt, no regrets, and no shame. He lies, cheats, and takes whatever he pleases, laughing at anyone who expects remorse. In his mind, the only crime is getting caught. Once Emmanuel gets an idea in his head, nothing will get him to drop it. If he&apos;s convinced a flanking maneuver is the best strategy, he&apos;ll argue about it until deployment. If he thinks a certain loadout is ideal, he&apos;ll lecture anyone who&apos;ll listen. Sometimes it&apos;s annoying - but sometimes, he&apos;s right. </personalityDescription>
				<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 52%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Laughs at guilt like it&apos;s a bad joke.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
