				<personalityDescription>Doubt is a disease, and Milek refuses to be infected. He knows he&apos;s the best, fights like it, and never flinches - because the moment he does, the enemy will pounce. Confidence isn&apos;t a choice; it&apos;s survival. Milek always wants more - more money, more power, more influence. No matter how much he has, it&apos;s never enough, and he&apos;s always looking for the next way to add to his wealth and status. </personalityDescription>
