				<personalityDescription>To Kyung-chul, hesitation is just another word for failure. He throws caution aside, charging headlong into danger with raw aggression and an utter disregard for self-preservation. If survival means second-guessing, then maybe survival isn&apos;t worth it. Kyung-chul isn&apos;t just chasing a dream - he&apos;s clawing for survival in a universe that doesn&apos;t care. He knows ambition alone won&apos;t get him there, and he&apos;s willing to fight, bleed, and sacrifice to make sure he&apos;s not just another forgotten warrior. </personalityDescription>
