				<personalityDescription>Chitrani doesn&apos;t wait for chances - she takes them, regardless of the cost. Allies, morals, and promises are all secondary to survival and success. If there&apos;s a gap to exploit, she&apos;ll find it, and if there isn&apos;t one, she&apos;ll make one. Once, Chitrani might have cared. Now, she just drifts. Wars rage, alliances shift, people come and go, and none of it moves her. She does what&apos;s necessary to get by, but passion and purpose are long-forgotten luxuries. </personalityDescription>
				<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 46%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Takes chances without hesitation. Morals are optional - results aren&apos;t.&lt;br&gt;- Burned out long before we met them. Just ash in uniform.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
