				<personalityDescription>Lorraine doesn&apos;t waste words. Every sentence is deliberate, every thought carefully considered before spoken. She sees no need to fill silences with empty chatter - if she has something to say, people will know it matters. Lorraine can be discussing critical situations, but that won&apos;t stop her from dropping a playful remark or two. Whether it&apos;s mock admiration or genuine charm, she makes sure no conversation is boring. &quot;That&apos;s a beautiful comms setup you&apos;ve got there. But not as beautiful as the voice coming through it.&quot; </personalityDescription>
				<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trust is earned. Rarely given.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
