				<personalityDescription>Jonas has been battered, broken, and left for dead more times than he can count - but he&apos;s still here. Pain, loss, and suffering don&apos;t slow him down; they fuel him, turning every setback into another reason to keep fighting. Jonas thrives on audacity. He doesn&apos;t hesitate, doesn&apos;t second-guess, and certainly doesn&apos;t blush. Whether he&apos;s making an obscene profit, pushing boundaries, or walking away from the wreckage, he does it all with a smirk and a shrug. </personalityDescription>
				<personalityInterviewNotes>&lt;html&gt;&lt;b&gt;Performance Exam:&lt;/b&gt; 45%&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Pain fuels the fire. Still here, still fighting.&lt;br&gt;- Built from brass and boldness. No filter, no fear.&lt;/html&gt;</personalityInterviewNotes>
